msgctxt "character-guide/3/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/3/0x4"
msgstr "Protagonist{window:3}Arcadian Prince{window:4}M, 12{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Prince of Arcadia. He fled when the\nEmperor stormed the kingdom and fights\nto retake it with the Three Warriors."

msgctxt "character-guide/4/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/4/0x4"
msgstr "Regina{window:3}Arcadian Warrior{window:4}F, 14{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Warrior of Arcadia and the prince's tutor,\nof Zoidian blood. Serious and meddlesome;\nshe knows ancient technology."

msgctxt "character-guide/5/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/5/0x4"
msgstr "Arth{window:3}Arcadian Warrior{window:4}M, 22{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Warrior of Arcadia, ex-officer of Guylos:\nhe brings the Empire's view. Quiet but\ncutting. A fine fighter."

msgctxt "character-guide/6/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/6/0x4"
msgstr "Jack{window:3}Arcadian Warrior{window:4}M, 25{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Warrior of Arcadia, ex-officer of Helic:\nhe brings the Republic's view and is\nthe prince's strategist."

msgctxt "character-guide/7/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/7/0x4"
msgstr "Dr. T{window:3}Zoid Researcher{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Researcher at Arcadia's Zoid lab. He\nstudied the legacy of Arcadia at the\nKing's request."

msgctxt "character-guide/8/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/8/0x4"
msgstr "King of Arcadia{window:3}King of Arcadia{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}The hero's father. The Emperor took\nhim when he invaded Arcadia. No one\nknows where he is."

msgctxt "character-guide/9/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/9/0x4"
msgstr "Queen of Arcadia{window:3}Queen of Arcadia{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}The hero's mother. The Emperor took\nher when he invaded Arcadia. No one\nknows where she is."

msgctxt "character-guide/23/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/23/0x4"
msgstr "Fran{window:3}Four Kings{window:4}F, 20{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}One of the Four Kings, from the Empire\nlike Arth. Cold and calm, yet she shows\nArth her hatred. What happened to them?"

msgctxt "character-guide/24/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/24/0x4"
msgstr "Gale{window:3}Four Kings{window:4}M, 30{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}One of the Four Kings. He was Jack's\nmentor in the Republic; now he stands\nin his way."

msgctxt "character-guide/25/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/25/0x4"
msgstr "Opis{window:3}Four Kings{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}One of the Four Kings. A Zoid scientist\nexpelled from the Empire for his\ndangerous experiments."

msgctxt "character-guide/26/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/26/0x4"
msgstr "Blood{window:3}Four Kings{window:4}M, 16{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Leader of the Four Kings, trusted by the\nEmperor, with boundless ambition.\nThe prince's rival."

msgctxt "character-guide/27/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/27/0x4"
msgstr "Emperor{window:3}Supreme Ruler{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Cause of Arcadia's ruin. No one has\nseen his face behind the mask. He took\nthe kingdom in a single night."

msgctxt "character-guide/43/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/43/0x4"
msgstr "Gold Judgeman{window:3}Zoid Referee{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids Saga{window:6}Presides over the colosseum final. The\nJudgeman of all Judgemen."

msgctxt "character-guide/203/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/203/0x4"
msgstr "Rob Herman{window:3}Helic Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Helic captain, later colonel. He met Van\nat Red River. Stubborn and loved by his\nmen. The President's son."

msgctxt "character-guide/204/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/204/0x4"
msgstr "Ford{window:3}Helic Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Helic lieutenant colonel, Krueger's aide.\nHe often leads the unit in his place. No\nflair, but a solid strategist."

msgctxt "character-guide/205/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/205/0x4"
msgstr "O'Connell{window:3}Helic Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Helic lieutenant, Herman's aide. Always\non the front line, as stubborn as his\nboss. He hired Moonbay at Red River."

msgctxt "character-guide/206/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/206/0x4"
msgstr "Krueger{window:3}Helic Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}Helic colonel who left the reserves when\nGuylos invaded. The wizard of the\nbattlefield."

msgctxt "character-guide/223/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/223/0x4"
msgstr "Raven{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}Raised by Prozen. He hates Zoids, but\npilots like a genius. With Shadow and his\nGeno Saurer, he fights Van to the death."

msgctxt "character-guide/224/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/224/0x4"
msgstr "Shadow{window:3}Organoid{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Raven's black Organoid. Hiltz destroyed\nit, but it came back; it attacked Raven,\nand Raven's tears reawakened it."

msgctxt "character-guide/225/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/225/0x4"
msgstr "Gunter Prozen{window:3}Marshal-Regent{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}Marshal and regent of Guylos. He plots\nto kill Rudolf and revive the Death\nSaurer to rule the world."

msgctxt "character-guide/226/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/226/0x4"
msgstr "Rudolf III{window:3}Emperor{window:4}M, 10{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}The Emperor's grandson. Kidnapped by\nRosso and hunted by Prozen, he reaches\nGuygalos with Van and brings peace."

msgctxt "character-guide/243/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/243/0x4"
msgstr "Van Flyheight{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M, 14{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}A Wind Colony boy who loves Zoids. He\nfinds Fiona and the Organoid Zeke in\nruins and travels with them in a Liger."

msgctxt "character-guide/244/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/244/0x4"
msgstr "Fiona{window:3}Ancient Zoidian{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}A descendant of the ancient Zoidians.\nShe sought Zoid Eve with Van, then helped\nDr. D. Still as scatterbrained as ever."

msgctxt "character-guide/245/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/245/0x4"
msgstr "Irvine{window:3}Hunter{window:4}M, 22{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}He hunted Zeke, but became Van's friend.\nPilots a Command Wolf. His eyepatch is a\ncamera."

msgctxt "character-guide/246/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/246/0x4"
msgstr "Moonbay{window:3}Transporter{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Part 1{window:6}A desert transporter who travels with\nVan; tough yet tender, like a big\nsister."

msgctxt "character-guide/247/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/247/0x4"
msgstr "Zeke{window:3}Organoid{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Van's white Organoid, awakened along\nwith Fiona. Always at Van's side, he backs\nhis Shield Liger and his Blade Liger."

msgctxt "character-guide/248/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/248/0x4"
msgstr "Dr. D{window:3}Zoid Researcher{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Helic scientist who retired to study how\nto make it snow. He returns to help\nVan. Drinks his coffee with salt."

msgctxt "character-guide/249/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/249/0x4"
msgstr "Rosso{window:3}Arcobaleno{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Boss of the Desalto Arcobaleno bandits,\nex-Imperial commando. He breaks out of\nprison and ends up protecting Rudolf."

msgctxt "character-guide/250/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/250/0x4"
msgstr "Viola{window:3}Arcobaleno{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}A member of Desalto Arcobaleno. She\nbroke Rosso out of jail and helped him\nkidnap Rudolf."

msgctxt "character-guide/251/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/251/0x4"
msgstr "Masked Man{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M{window:5}Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Mysterious Storm Sworder pilot who\nhelps Van. He looks like Rosso, leader\nof Desalto Arcobaleno."

msgctxt "character-guide/252/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/252/0x4"
msgstr "Masked Woman{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}F{window:5}Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Mysterious Storm Sworder pilot who\nhelps Van. She looks like Viola. Her\nline: \"Catch you later!\""

msgctxt "character-guide/253/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/253/0x4"
msgstr "Stinger{window:3}Hunter{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Handsome outside, cruel and vile inside.\nUses poison gas and enjoys others' pain.\nAt the bar he orders milk, for his health."

msgctxt "character-guide/403/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/403/0x4"
msgstr "Van Flyheight{window:3}Guardian Force{window:4}M, 16{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Two years after the Death Saurer, he's\na great pilot and a member of the\nGuardian Force."

msgctxt "character-guide/423/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/423/0x4"
msgstr "Karl Schubaltz{window:3}Imperial Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Parts 1 & 2{window:6}Imperial colonel leading the 1st\nArmored Division. A veteran from an\nillustrious family, and unlucky."

msgctxt "character-guide/424/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/424/0x4"
msgstr "Thomas Schubaltz{window:3}Guardian Force{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Imperial lieutenant in the Guardian Force,\nKarl's brother. His AI Beak beats any\nOrganoid, he says. Smitten with Fiona."

msgctxt "character-guide/443/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/443/0x4"
msgstr "Fiona{window:3}Ancient Zoidian{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}She regained her Zoidian memory and\nhelped Dr. D until she joined the Guardian\nForce with Van. Still as scatterbrained."

msgctxt "character-guide/444/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/444/0x4"
msgstr "Irvine{window:3}Hunter{window:4}M, 24{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}After the Death Saurer he kept bounty\nhunting and ended up in the Guardian\nForce. Friend and rival of Van and Thomas."

msgctxt "character-guide/445/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/445/0x4"
msgstr "Moonbay{window:3}Hunter{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}A transporter who ends up in the Guardian\nForce. Herman lends her the Ultrasaurus\nand she keeps it. Never got a new song."

msgctxt "character-guide/446/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/446/0x4"
msgstr "Raven{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Beaten by Van, he lost his memory and\nwandered. Hiltz recruits him; he pilots\nthe Geno Breaker, but it's hard to tame."

msgctxt "character-guide/447/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/447/0x4"
msgstr "Reese{window:3}Ancient Zoidian{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}An ancient Zoidian with the blue Organoid\nSpecular. An expert in mental attacks.\nAfter Hiltz's betrayal, she joins Raven."

msgctxt "character-guide/448/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/448/0x4"
msgstr "Hiltz{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}An ancient Zoidian with the Organoid\nAmbient. He revived the Death Stinger and\nsought to destroy the world."

msgctxt "character-guide/449/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/449/0x4"
msgstr "Specular{window:3}Organoid{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Reese's blue Organoid. It pushes the Zoid\nit fuses with beyond its limits."

msgctxt "character-guide/450/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/450/0x4"
msgstr "Dark Kaiser{window:3}Unknown{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Prozen, fused with the Death Saurer. He\nused Hiltz and Reese to be reborn, but\nwas part of Hiltz's plan all along."

msgctxt "character-guide/451/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/451/0x4"
msgstr "Ambient{window:3}Organoid{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids, Part 2{window:6}Hiltz's red Organoid. It has strange\npowers, like fusing the Death Stinger's\ncores."

msgctxt "character-guide/452/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/452/0x4"
msgstr "Hiltz{window:3}Ancient Zoidian{window:4}M{window:5}Part 2{window:6}Hiltz after absorbing the Dark Kaiser\nand fusing with the Death Saurer."

msgctxt "character-guide/603/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/603/0x4"
msgstr "Bit Cloud{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M, 16{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}A drifting junk dealer who met the Liger\nZero and joined Team Blitz as a Zoid\nwarrior."

msgctxt "character-guide/604/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/604/0x4"
msgstr "Leena Toros{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}F, 16{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Dr. Toros's daughter, a Blitz warrior.\nPretty but rough, reckless and\nwillful."

msgctxt "character-guide/605/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/605/0x4"
msgstr "Brad Hunter{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M, 17{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}A freelance warrior hired by the Blitz,\nvery tight with money. He traded his\nCommand Wolf for the Shadow Fox."

msgctxt "character-guide/606/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/606/0x4"
msgstr "Jamie Hemeros{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M, 14{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}The Blitz's strategist and mechanic. Calm\nand kind, he changes completely when\nflying the Raynos."

msgctxt "character-guide/607/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/607/0x4"
msgstr "Leon Toros{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Former Blitz warrior. He came back with a\nred Blade Liger and teamed up with Naomi.\nLeena's brother."

msgctxt "character-guide/608/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/608/0x4"
msgstr "Dr. Toros{window:3}Boss & Mechanic{window:4}M, 38{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Head and mechanic of the Blitz. No one\nknows what he's thinking; maybe he's\njust a Zoid fan."

msgctxt "character-guide/623/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/623/0x4"
msgstr "Volta{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}A member of the Backdraft, which runs\nrigged dark battles and hijacks Zoid\nbattles."

msgctxt "character-guide/624/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/624/0x4"
msgstr "Dr. Laon{window:3}Boss & Mechanic{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Dr. Toros's rival since university. He\nloses to the Blitz again and again, until\nthe Backdraft recruits him."

msgctxt "character-guide/625/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/625/0x4"
msgstr "Dark Judgeman{window:3}Zoid Referee{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}The AI referee of dark battles. It crushes\nthe Judgeman and hijacks the battle, but\nthe Judgeman sometimes fights back."

msgctxt "character-guide/626/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/626/0x4"
msgstr "Vega{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}A boy who pilots the legendary Berserk\nFury of the Backdraft. He foresees his\nfoe's moves."

msgctxt "character-guide/643/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/643/0x4"
msgstr "Naomi Fluegel{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}F{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}The \"Red Lightning\", a peerless sniper\nand a loner. Leon saved her in a dark\nbattle, and they've been a team since."

msgctxt "character-guide/644/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/644/0x4"
msgstr "Harry Champ{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Born to be king. His money buys the best\nZoids for his Team Champ. He loves Leena\nand sees Bit as his rival."

msgctxt "character-guide/645/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/645/0x4"
msgstr "Kirkland{window:3}Zoid Warrior{window:4}M{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Leader of Team Tigers. Since losing to\nthe Blitz he hasn't won, even with Dr.\nLaon's help."

msgctxt "character-guide/646/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/646/0x4"
msgstr "Benjamin{window:3}Autonomous AI{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Team Champ's robot, in love with the\nJudgeman. She attacked league HQ just\nto see him."

msgctxt "character-guide/647/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/647/0x4"
msgstr "Sebastian{window:3}Autonomous AI{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Harry's Team Champ robot. A rare case\nof common sense."

msgctxt "character-guide/648/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/648/0x4"
msgstr "Judgeman{window:3}Zoid Referee{window:4}?{window:5}Zoids Zero{window:6}Impartial referee and the law of Zoid\nbattles, sent by the league. While he's\nhere, justice will prevail!"

msgctxt "character-guide/803/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/803/0x4"
msgstr "Alster{window:3}Zoid Pilot{window:4}M{window:5}Liger Zero (Game Boy){window:6}Hero of the Game Boy's \"Liger Zero\". A\nyear after his underground adventure,\nhe guards his village from wild Zoids."

msgctxt "character-guide/804/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/804/0x4"
msgstr "Palty{window:3}Subterranean{window:4}F{window:5}Liger Zero (Game Boy){window:6}Heroine of the Game Boy's \"Liger Zero\".\nA year after the underground adventure,\nshe lives in peace in Alster's village."

msgctxt "character-guide/805/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/805/0x4"
msgstr "Solid{window:3}Imperial Officer{window:4}M{window:5}Liger Zero (Game Boy){window:6}Rival of the hero of the Game Boy's\n\"Liger Zero\". A year later, he hunts the\nwild Zoids that are sowing chaos."

msgctxt "character-guide/806/0x4"
msgid "character-guide/806/0x4"
msgstr "Blue Gem{window:3}Zoid Engineer{window:4}M{window:5}Liger Zero (Game Boy){window:6}A mechanic who helps the hero of the\nGame Boy's \"Liger Zero\". Now he repairs\nZoids in Alster's village."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/42/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince?\nWhat is it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x3d"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x3d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x5e"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x5e"
msgstr "Jack\n...Hm?\nRight now you should be..."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x89"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x89"
msgstr "Jack\n...I see. You've slipped out\nof your lesson again."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0xcb"
msgid "dialogue/42/0xcb"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0xec"
msgid "dialogue/42/0xec"
msgstr "Jack\n...Oh dear...\nI can already picture\nRegina's face."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x12b"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x12b"
msgstr "Jack\nPlease don't give Regina\nsuch grief, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x161"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x161"
msgstr "Jack\nThinking of her position is\nalso part of your duties as\nprince. Please don't forget\nthat."

msgctxt "dialogue/42/0x1c2"
msgid "dialogue/42/0x1c2"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/43/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nPrince."

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x2a"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x2a"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x4b"
msgstr "Arth\nOdd to see you here."

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x81"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x81"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x9b"
msgstr "Arth\n...Slacking off again...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0xd5"
msgid "dialogue/43/0xd5"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0xf6"
msgid "dialogue/43/0xf6"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x110"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x110"
msgstr "Arth\nThe King was looking for you.\nGo see him."

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x142"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x142"
msgstr "Arth\nOr would you rather I put\nyou through my training?"

msgctxt "dialogue/43/0x180"
msgid "dialogue/43/0x180"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/45/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/45/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nHis Majesty is making his\nrounds of the castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/45/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/45/0x3e"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nI believe he's in the back\nroom right now."

msgctxt "dialogue/45/0x70"
msgid "dialogue/45/0x70"
msgstr "Royal Guard\n...By the way, he seemed to\nbe looking for Prince\n{name}."

msgctxt "dialogue/46/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/46/0x3"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n...{name}..."

msgctxt "dialogue/46/0x34"
msgid "dialogue/46/0x34"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/46/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/46/0x4c"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nHow are your studies going?"

msgctxt "dialogue/46/0x74"
msgid "dialogue/46/0x74"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nAre you properly following\nwhat the Three Warriors\nteach you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/47/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/47/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/47/0x24"
msgid "dialogue/47/0x24"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nYou will be the one to\nsucceed me..."

msgctxt "dialogue/47/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/47/0x5b"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince!\nWhere have you gotten to?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/47/0x9a"
msgid "dialogue/47/0x9a"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/48/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/48/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/48/0x24"
msgid "dialogue/48/0x24"
msgstr "Regina\nSkipping your lesson to come\nhere again!"

msgctxt "dialogue/48/0x62"
msgid "dialogue/48/0x62"
msgstr "Regina\n!!! Y-Your Majesty!\nForgive me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/48/0xa3"
msgid "dialogue/48/0xa3"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/49/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nAs the prince's tutor, this\nfailure is mine alone!"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x5f"
msgstr "Regina\nI'll accept any punishment..."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x84"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x84"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nIt doesn't matter. The fault\nisn't yours."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0xc2"
msgid "dialogue/49/0xc2"
msgstr "Regina\nBut...!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0xe1"
msgid "dialogue/49/0xe1"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nI said it's all right.\n{name}..."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x10d"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x10d"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nNo. Future King of Arcadia."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x13d"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x13d"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nWhat is your duty?\nTo run around playing?"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x186"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x186"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x19e"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x19e"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nNo. It is to protect the\npeace of this kingdom and\nthis land."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x1e5"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x1e5"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nAnd the ancient legacy that\nsleeps deep in the castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x22e"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x22e"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nYour duty is to guard its\nsecret."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x266"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x266"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n...Today's peace is nothing\nmore than a passing thing."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x2a2"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x2a2"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nIt rests on a fragile\nbalance of power between\nthe Republic and the Empire,\na very precarious balance."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x2fd"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x2fd"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nIf one of the two, or\nperhaps... perhaps some\nother power..."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x348"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x348"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n...were to appear, that alone\nwould be enough to end it."

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x388"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x388"
msgstr "Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x3b0"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x3b0"
msgstr "Jack\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/49/0x3d8"
msgid "dialogue/49/0x3d8"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/50/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/50/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/50/0x2a"
msgid "dialogue/50/0x2a"
msgstr "Jack\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/50/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/50/0x48"
msgstr "Arth\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/50/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/50/0x5b"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n! What's happening?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/51/0x3"
msgstr "Soldier\nWe're under attack!\nIt's a surprise attack!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0x5a"
msgid "dialogue/51/0x5a"
msgstr "Arth\nReport the situation!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0x87"
msgid "dialogue/51/0x87"
msgstr "Soldier\nThey're attacking from the\nsouth! They're breaking\nthrough the walls!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0xd7"
msgid "dialogue/51/0xd7"
msgstr "Soldier\nThey're Republic\ntroops!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0x107"
msgid "dialogue/51/0x107"
msgstr "Jack\n! Impossible?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/51/0x133"
msgid "dialogue/51/0x133"
msgstr "Arth\nWhat's the meaning of this,\nJack?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/52/0x3"
msgstr "Soldier\nThey've breached the\nwall!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0x35"
msgid "dialogue/52/0x35"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0x4e"
msgid "dialogue/52/0x4e"
msgstr "Soldier\nIt's the Imperial army!!\nAdvancing from the north!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/52/0x97"
msgstr "Arth\nWhat?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0xb9"
msgid "dialogue/52/0xb9"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Empire too?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0xe3"
msgid "dialogue/52/0xe3"
msgstr "Arth\nDamn it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/52/0xf9"
msgid "dialogue/52/0xf9"
msgstr "Arth\nJack, Regina, move out!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x3"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nWait! Three Warriors!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x3d"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x3d"
msgstr "Arth\nBut...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x58"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x58"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nTake {name} and flee."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x8d"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x8d"
msgstr "Jack\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0xab"
msgid "dialogue/53/0xab"
msgstr "Arth\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0xc7"
msgid "dialogue/53/0xc7"
msgstr "Regina\nYour Majesty!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/53/0xe4"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nThe Empire and the Republic...\nwe don't stand a chance."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x121"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x121"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n...What they seek is the\nancient legacy..."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x15d"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x15d"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nThree Warriors, protect the\nancient legacy together with\n{name}!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x1a2"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x1a2"
msgstr "Regina, Jack & Arth\nAs you command!"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x1cd"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x1cd"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\n...{name}..."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x1f0"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x1f0"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nThe Three Warriors' mission\nis to protect you, but you,\nas prince, must protect\nthem too.\nNever forget that..."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x276"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x276"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x28e"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x28e"
msgstr "King of Arcadia\nNow go... Go, now!!\nForgive your father for\nburdening you with something\nso hard. Forgive me..."

msgctxt "dialogue/53/0x2f3"
msgid "dialogue/53/0x2f3"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/54/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/54/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince, quickly, to the\nunderground!"

msgctxt "dialogue/54/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/54/0x3c"
msgstr "{name}\n......."

msgctxt "dialogue/55/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/55/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat is it, Prince...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/55/0x42"
msgid "dialogue/55/0x42"
msgstr "Regina\nEnemies?"

msgctxt "dialogue/55/0x62"
msgid "dialogue/55/0x62"
msgstr "Arth\nI don't know."

msgctxt "dialogue/56/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/56/0xc"
msgstr "Mysterious Knight\nJust keep the castle\nsurrounded!"

msgctxt "dialogue/56/0x44"
msgid "dialogue/56/0x44"
msgstr "Mysterious Leader\nFirst we must take the\nunderground..."

msgctxt "dialogue/56/0x86"
msgid "dialogue/56/0x86"
msgstr "Mysterious Knight\n!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/57/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/57/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nWho are they? They're not\nImperial or Republic..."

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0x72"
msgid "dialogue/57/0x72"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's save the chat for\nlater."

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/57/0x9e"
msgstr "Jack\nRight now we must think about\nescaping as soon as we can."

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0xf1"
msgid "dialogue/57/0xf1"
msgstr "Regina\nYou're right.\nCome on, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/57/0x128"
msgid "dialogue/57/0x128"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/58/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/58/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/59/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...These are..."

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/59/0x38"
msgstr "Jack\nZoids...\nRather old ones, though."

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0x7b"
msgid "dialogue/59/0x7b"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0x9c"
msgid "dialogue/59/0x9c"
msgstr "Regina\nThis is no time to be\npicky."

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0xcc"
msgid "dialogue/59/0xcc"
msgstr "Arth\nAnyway, let's take a look..."

msgctxt "dialogue/59/0x102"
msgid "dialogue/59/0x102"
msgstr "Jack\nAgreed."

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/60/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince, I already told you\nabout the Zoid Commander,\nright?"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x5d"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x5d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x7e"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x7e"
msgstr "Regina\nI asked you to wear it at\nall times so it could record\nyour thought patterns,\nremember?"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0xeb"
msgid "dialogue/60/0xeb"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x10c"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x10c\n"
msgstr "Regina\nYes, that thing on your\nhead!\n"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x13f"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x13f"
msgstr "Regina\nIt sends your thoughts to the\nZoid and helps you pilot it."

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x19e"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x19e"
msgstr "Regina\nWith it, even at your level,\nyou should manage..."

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x1ed"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x1ed"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x20e"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x20e"
msgstr "Regina\nPut up with it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x234"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x234"
msgstr "Regina\nThis is what happens when\n{name} always skips\npractice!"

msgctxt "dialogue/60/0x27a"
msgid "dialogue/60/0x27a"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/61/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/61/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nNow all that's left is the\nZoid the prince will pilot..."

msgctxt "dialogue/61/0x4e"
msgid "dialogue/61/0x4e\n"
msgstr "Arth\nNo problem. Looks like they\nall work.\n"

msgctxt "dialogue/61/0x83"
msgid "dialogue/61/0x83"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, there's no time."

msgctxt "dialogue/61/0xab"
msgid "dialogue/61/0xab"
msgstr "Jack\nChoose the Zoid you will\npilot."

msgctxt "dialogue/62/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/62/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nThis is the Shield Liger. A\nfast Zoid with great defense."

msgctxt "dialogue/62/0x5d"
msgid "dialogue/62/0x5d"
msgstr "Regina\nIts special trait is the\nE-Shield, which blocks damage."

msgctxt "dialogue/62/0xa0"
msgid "dialogue/62/0xa0"
msgstr "Regina\nWill you pilot this Zoid?"

msgctxt "dialogue/63/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/63/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nThis is the Sabre Tiger. A\nfast Zoid with great attack."

msgctxt "dialogue/63/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/63/0x5b"
msgstr "Arth\nAn excellent Zoid, the\nbackbone of the Imperial army."

msgctxt "dialogue/63/0xa4"
msgid "dialogue/63/0xa4"
msgstr "Arth\nWill you pilot this Zoid?"

msgctxt "dialogue/64/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/64/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nThis is the Raynos. A very\nfast aerial combat Zoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/64/0x49"
msgid "dialogue/64/0x49"
msgstr "Jack\nFlying Zoids only carry\ntheir fixed armaments,"

msgctxt "dialogue/64/0x8e"
msgid "dialogue/64/0x8e"
msgstr "Jack\nbut they're hard to hit\nwithout anti-air weapons."

msgctxt "dialogue/64/0xd1"
msgid "dialogue/64/0xd1"
msgstr "Jack\nWill you pilot this Zoid?"

msgctxt "dialogue/65/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/65/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...No problems. Our Zoids\nare on board too."

msgctxt "dialogue/65/0x59"
msgid "dialogue/65/0x59"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Zoid Commander will help\nyou pilot the Zoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/65/0xaa"
msgid "dialogue/65/0xaa"
msgstr "Jack\nStay calm. Let's go."

msgctxt "dialogue/66/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/66/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nUgh! They've already made\nit this far?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/66/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/66/0x48"
msgstr "Arth\nNo time to load the other\nZoids..."

msgctxt "dialogue/66/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/66/0x97"
msgstr "Regina\nLet's go, Prince!"

msgctxt "dialogue/66/0xc7"
msgid "dialogue/66/0xc7"
msgstr "Jack\nCome, give the order,\nPrince."

msgctxt "dialogue/66/0xf7"
msgid "dialogue/66/0xf7"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/67/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n...But who could those\npeople earlier have been?"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x55"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x55"
msgstr "Arth\nNo idea. But they're enemies."

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x81"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x81"
msgstr "Jack\n...Blunt as ever.\nWhat do you think, Regina?"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/67/0xd0"
msgstr "Regina\nI'd never seen them either.\nBut more important than that..."

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x11d"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x11d"
msgstr "Jack\nRight. First, escape safe\nand sound, regroup..."

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x174"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x174"
msgstr "Arth\nAnd retake the castle!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x1a0"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x1a0"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x1c1"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x1c1"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd the royal legacy..."

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x1f5"
msgid "dialogue/67/0x1f5"
msgstr "Jack\nThe King mentioned it too,\nbut what is the royal legacy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/67/0x254"
