msgctxt "dialogue/68/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/68/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nAnyway, let's head to the\ntown of Arcana nearby."

msgctxt "dialogue/73/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/73/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nIn any case, let's split up\nand see how the town is doing."

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/74/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/74/0x2d"
msgstr "Jack\nThere are guards everywhere."

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0x69"
msgid "dialogue/74/0x69"
msgstr "Arth\n...And out in plain sight..."

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0x9f"
msgid "dialogue/74/0x9f"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat do you mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0xc9"
msgid "dialogue/74/0xc9"
msgstr "Jack\nThe town has new masters.\nThey want everyone to know it."

msgctxt "dialogue/74/0x11e"
msgid "dialogue/74/0x11e"
msgstr "Regina\nGrr!"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x3"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nHey! You there!\nDon't you know there's\na curfew?"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x6c"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x6c"
msgstr "Arth\nNo."

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x83"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x83"
msgstr "Soldier 1\nWhat did you say?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x9b"
msgstr "Soldier 2\nYou lot! You're under arrest!"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0xd7"
msgid "dialogue/75/0xd7"
msgstr "Jack\nExcuse me, Mr. Soldier."

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0xfb"
msgid "dialogue/75/0xfb"
msgstr "Jack\nWe only just arrived from\nthe countryside..."

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x141"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x141"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nThe countryside? What\ncountryside? What brings\nyou to Arcadia?"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x19a"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x19a"
msgstr "Jack\nWell, you see... Up north,\npast the mountains..."

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x1ee"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x1ee"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nHmm, I'm not buying it!\nHey! Take them away!"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x23d"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x23d"
msgstr "Jack\nW-wait, please! We really\nare just travelers!"

msgctxt "dialogue/75/0x28f"
msgid "dialogue/75/0x28f"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nSilence!"

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/76/0x3"
msgstr "Old Man\nWell, well, if it isn't\nT-Thomas! I've been\nwaiting for you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0x52"
msgid "dialogue/76/0x52"
msgstr "Jack\n?! Oh! U-Uncle! It's been\nages! I just got here!"

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/76/0xa6"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nOh? And who are you?\nYou know these people?"

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0xec"
msgid "dialogue/76/0xec"
msgstr "Old Man\nI'm Roman, the head of\nthis town."

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0x131"
msgid "dialogue/76/0x131"
msgstr "Roman\nThey're my relatives. This is\nmy nephew, T-Thomas."

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0x17d"
msgid "dialogue/76/0x17d"
msgstr "Jack\nY-yes, that's right. I'm\nThomas."

msgctxt "dialogue/76/0x1ae"
msgid "dialogue/76/0x1ae"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nVery suspicious. Is that true?"

msgctxt "dialogue/77/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/77/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nIt's the truth, I assure you.\nHere, here, take this."

msgctxt "dialogue/77/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/77/0x36"
msgstr "Soldier (Captain)\nHmph! Be more careful\nfrom now on."

msgctxt "dialogue/78/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/78/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nYou're Prince {name},\naren't you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/78/0x32"
msgid "dialogue/78/0x32"
msgstr "{name}\n!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/78/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/78/0x4b"
msgstr "Jack\nSir, who are you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/78/0x70"
msgid "dialogue/78/0x70"
msgstr "Roman\nWe can't talk here. Come to\nmy house, just up ahead."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/79/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nSo, sir, you used to be...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x3b"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x3b"
msgstr "Roman\nYes. I served the King of\nArcadia. Though that was a\nlong time ago now."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x9e"
msgstr "Regina\nDo you know anything about\nthe enemy? Or how the castle\nis doing?"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0xf3"
msgid "dialogue/79/0xf3"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x10b"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x10b"
msgstr "Roman\nI know nothing of the enemy."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x137"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x137"
msgstr "Roman\nI saw fire at the castle,\nand in the blink of an eye,\nthey'd taken it."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x19e"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x19e"
msgstr "Roman\nAnd there's no word of the\nKing of Arcadia either..."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x1e6"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x1e6"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x207"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x207"
msgstr "Regina\n...I see..."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x239"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x239"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x25f"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x25f"
msgstr "Jack\n...What a mess. We have\nvery little to go on."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x29e"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x29e"
msgstr "Jack\nIf we don't know what the\nenemy is after, retaking\nthe castle..."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x2e4"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x2e4"
msgstr "Roman\n...I don't know if it's what\nthey're after, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x324"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x324"
msgstr "Regina\nYou know something?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x34b"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x34b"
msgstr "Roman\nYes. I heard them talking\nabout a sealed room in\nthe castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x3a8"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x3a8"
msgstr "Regina\nA sealed room?! Then\nthey're after the ancient\nlegacy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x3f5"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x3f5"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x416"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x416"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's too early to say\nthey're after the legacy\njust from that."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x465"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x465"
msgstr "Arth\nIt's the only lead we have."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x493"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x493"
msgstr "Jack\n......True. We don't have\ntime to hesitate."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x4ec"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x4ec"
msgstr "Arth\nRight. All that's left is\nto go after them."

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x522"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x522"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince!"

msgctxt "dialogue/79/0x544"
msgid "dialogue/79/0x544"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/80/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/80/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n...My, what an impatient\nbunch."

msgctxt "dialogue/80/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/80/0x4c"
msgstr "Arth\nHeh... They make a good\npair."

msgctxt "dialogue/80/0x7e"
msgid "dialogue/80/0x7e"
msgstr "Jack\nIndeed. Let's go too. Sir,\nthank you so much for\neverything."

msgctxt "dialogue/80/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/80/0xd0"
msgstr "Roman\nTake care."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/705/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nExcuse me, could you take\na look at this Zi data?"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x50"
msgstr "Dr. T\nThis is incredible! It's the\nZi data for the Trinity Liger!"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0xa5"
msgid "dialogue/705/0xa5"
msgstr "Regina\nHow do you know about the\nTrinity Liger?"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0xf6"
msgid "dialogue/705/0xf6"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI'm Dr. T, head of the Zoid\nlab here in the town of\nArcana."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x137"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x137"
msgstr "Dr. T\nThe King of Arcadia asked me\nto research the Arcadian\nlegacy."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x18e"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x18e"
msgstr "Dr. T\nThe Trinity Liger is the\ncentral subject of our\nlegacy research."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x1d1"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x1d1"
msgstr "Dr. T\nBut no one knew where it\nwas... Where did you find\nit?"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x23e"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x23e"
msgstr "Regina\nAt the end of the secret\npassage in Arcadia's castle..."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x27e"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x27e"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI see... Without that, it\nwould never have been found."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x2d7"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x2d7"
msgstr "Dr. T\nIs His Majesty all right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x30d"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x30d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x32e"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x32e"
msgstr "Regina\nU-um... Could you build the\nTrinity Liger with this data?"

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x391"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x391"
msgstr "Dr. T\nHmm, with any other Zoid it'd\nbe simple... But the Trinity\nLiger's core is special."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x3f0"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x3f0"
msgstr "Dr. T\n...There's probably only one\nin the whole world."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x437"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x437"
msgstr "Dr. T\nWithout it, the Trinity\nLiger can't be built."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x482"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x482"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI'm terribly sorry..."

msgctxt "dialogue/705/0x4b0"
msgid "dialogue/705/0x4b0"
msgstr "Regina\nI see..."

msgctxt "dialogue/706/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/706/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nOh, if only I had the\nTrinity Liger's Zoid core..."

msgctxt "dialogue/713/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/713/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nUse the Trinity Liger and\nwin, please!"

msgctxt "dialogue/714/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/714/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI want to travel and gather\nZi data too."

msgctxt "dialogue/715/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/715/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nHave you used deck commands\nyet? They're tactics and\nmaneuvers of every kind."

msgctxt "dialogue/715/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/715/0x76"
msgstr "Researcher\nBefore battle, you can pick\nup to 6 when setting your\ncommands."

msgctxt "dialogue/715/0xc3"
msgid "dialogue/715/0xc3"
msgstr "Researcher\nIn battle you can use one per\nturn, and once used, it won't\nbe available again until\nthe next battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/715/0x130"
msgid "dialogue/715/0x130"
msgstr "Researcher\nMaster them, and battles\nwill go your way."

msgctxt "dialogue/715/0x17d"
msgid "dialogue/715/0x17d"
msgstr "Researcher\nUse this command we\ndeveloped here."

msgctxt "dialogue/716/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/716/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nHave you used deck commands\nyet? They're all sorts of\ntactics and maneuvers."

msgctxt "dialogue/716/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/716/0x76"
msgstr "Researcher\nBefore battle, you can pick\nup to 6 when you set your\ncommands."

msgctxt "dialogue/716/0xc3"
msgid "dialogue/716/0xc3"
msgstr "Researcher\nIn battle you can use one per\nturn, and once used, it won't\nbe available again until the\nnext battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/716/0x130"
msgid "dialogue/716/0x130"
msgstr "Researcher\nMaster them, and battles\nwill go your way."

msgctxt "dialogue/742/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/742/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe Zoid hangar is down\nhere. It's dangerous, so\nplease don't go in."

msgctxt "dialogue/743/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/743/0x3\n"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nPrince, please don't leave\nthe castle.\n"

msgctxt "dialogue/744/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/744/0x3"
msgstr "Queen of Arcadia\n{name}... what are you\ndoing here? Shouldn't you\nbe studying?"

msgctxt "dialogue/745/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/745/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nTons of Zoids just went into\nthe castle! When I grow up,\nI'm gonna be a Zoid pilot!"

msgctxt "dialogue/746/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/746/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nUntil yesterday I thought\npeace would last forever...\nWhat will become of us now?"

msgctxt "dialogue/747/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/747/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nDamn it! Look at them strut\naround! ...Not that I can\ndo anything about it..."

msgctxt "dialogue/748/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/748/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nThere's a curfew across the\nwhole kingdom! Civilians with\nno business here, go home!"

msgctxt "dialogue/749/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/749/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nArcadia is under the Emperor's\narmy now. We'll arrest anyone\nwho opposes us!"

msgctxt "dialogue/750/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/750/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nCivilians are not allowed\nout on the streets!"

msgctxt "dialogue/751/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/751/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWho'd have thought the kingdom\nwould fall so easily... And a\ncurfew on top of it. So much\nfor business."

msgctxt "dialogue/752/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/752/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAnother war. An old man like\nme hasn't got long left,\nbut... will there be peace\nwhen my grandkids grow up?"

msgctxt "dialogue/753/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/753/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nThe Emperor's men took the\ncastle while the Republic and\nthe Empire watched each\nother..."

msgctxt "dialogue/754/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/754/0x3\n"
msgstr "Roman\nPrince, survive,\nwhatever happens...\n"

msgctxt "dialogue/755/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/755/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Ah, that's right!\nI'll teach you this tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/760/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/760/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Ah, that's right!\nI'll teach you this tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/764/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/764/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWhat Zoid should I develop\nnext?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/775/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/775/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWhat Zoid should I develop\nnext?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/886/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/886/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWhat Zoid should I develop\nnext?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/897/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/897/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nAaah, aaah, aaah!\nD-don't kill me!\nI don't know anything!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/898/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/898/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWho are you people?!\nDon't get in the way of\nmy research!"

msgctxt "dialogue/952/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/952/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nKing {name}, here to\ntrain? No wonder you're the\nbest Zoid pilot in the\nkingdom."

msgctxt "dialogue/953/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/953/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nYour Majesty, please don't\nleave the castle, I beg you..."

msgctxt "dialogue/954/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/954/0x3\n"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe Zoid hangar is\ndown there.\n"

msgctxt "dialogue/955/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/955/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nNow that there's a new king,\nwill new Three Warriors\nbe chosen?"

msgctxt "dialogue/956/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/956/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe Emperor's army has fallen,\nbut the Empire or the\nRepublic may still have\ndesigns on our kingdom..."

msgctxt "dialogue/957/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/957/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nI'd love to be one of the\nnext Three Warriors!"

msgctxt "dialogue/958/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/958/0x3"
msgstr "Queen Mother of Arcadia\n{name}... what are you\ndoing here? Shouldn't you\nbe working?"

msgctxt "dialogue/959/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/959/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe conflicts on the Central\nContinent have died down.\nIf only the whole planet\ncould live in peace..."

msgctxt "dialogue/960/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/960/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nArcadia's royal family has\nguarded a secret treasure\nfor generations. Who'd have\nthought it was the space-time\ntransport device!"

msgctxt "dialogue/961/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/961/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nAre you going out?"

msgctxt "dialogue/962/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/962/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWalking around freely\nagain... It's all thanks to\nPrince {name}... Oops,\nKing, I mean!"

msgctxt "dialogue/963/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/963/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nOnly yesterday he seemed a\nchild, and now he's a fine\nking. Now he just needs to\nfind a good wife soon."

msgctxt "dialogue/964/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/964/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWith all this peace, you get\nbored... A little excitement\nwouldn't hurt."

msgctxt "dialogue/965/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/965/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nMaybe I'll learn to pilot\nZoids like Regina. A woman\nwants to protect what she\nloves with her own hands too."

msgctxt "dialogue/966/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/966/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI'm gonna be a Zoid pilot\nlike Sir {name}! And I'll\nbeat up all the bad guys!"

msgctxt "dialogue/967/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/967/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWe can play outside the town\nagain! Mommy says we can\nplay forever now!"

msgctxt "dialogue/968/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/968/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nYour Majesty! Let's do our\nbest so this country never\nsuffers war again!"

msgctxt "dialogue/969/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/969/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nYour Majesty! I'm deeply\nmoved! Fighting at your side\nhas made me the happiest\nman alive!"

msgctxt "dialogue/970/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/970/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nBeen waiting for you.\nThat's your seat. I'll always\nkeep it free."

msgctxt "dialogue/971/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/971/0x3"
msgstr "Waitress\nWelcome! Even if you're the\nking, no alcohol until\nyou're twenty."

msgctxt "dialogue/972/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/972/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nWhen my service is over,\nI think I'll go home. I want\nto be of some use to my\nhometown."

msgctxt "dialogue/973/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/973/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nWith all this peace, business\nis dead. It's comfy here, but\nit's about time I hit\nthe road."

msgctxt "dialogue/974/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/974/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nYour Majesty, have you seen\nthe town? This is the town\nYour Majesty protected, and\nwill go on protecting."

msgctxt "dialogue/975/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/975/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nYour Majesty, have you seen\nthe town? This is the town\nYour Majesty protected, and\nwill go on protecting."

msgctxt "dialogue/975/0x6e"
msgid "dialogue/975/0x6e"
msgstr "Roman\nWell then, lastly, I shall\nteach you every tactic."

msgctxt "dialogue/976/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/976/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI'll teach you a tactic\nI know."

msgctxt "dialogue/997/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/997/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nUse it well."

