msgid "dialogue/82/0x4e"
msgstr "Arth\nYou know a lot, Regina..."

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x88"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x88"
msgstr "Regina\nMy family's duty is to study\nthe ancient legacy..."

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0xc0"
msgid "dialogue/82/0xc0"
msgstr "Regina\nThough my father's barely\ntold me what's inside."

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x10d"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x10d"
msgstr "Jack\nThen how is it that his\ndaughter ended up in the\nWarriors corps?"

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x145"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x145"
msgstr "Regina\n........."

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x173"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x173"
msgstr "Regina\nE-everyone's good at some\nthings and not others!"

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x1b7"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x1b7"
msgstr "Arth\nI see."

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x1db"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x1db"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/82/0x1fc"
msgid "dialogue/82/0x1fc"
msgstr "Regina\nOh, forgive me, Prince...\nCome on, let's go."

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/83/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/83/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nIs this the sealed chamber...?\nWhere's the royal legacy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0x78"
msgid "dialogue/83/0x78"
msgstr "Arth\n...We're too late..."

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0xa8"
msgid "dialogue/83/0xa8"
msgstr "Jack\n...So it seems..."

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0xde"
msgid "dialogue/83/0xde"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat's the meaning of this?!\nDon't tell me the enemy...?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/83/0x116"
msgid "dialogue/83/0x116"
msgstr "Male Voice\nYou've figured it out too\nlate! You rats!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/84/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nThe royal legacy, the\nspace-time transporter, was\nmoved elsewhere long ago!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x67"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x67"
msgstr "Jack\nSpace-time transporter?!\nThat's the royal legacy?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0xac"
msgid "dialogue/84/0xac"
msgstr "Blood\nWhat, you didn't know? No\nmatter, you're all going to\ndie here anyway."

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x109"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x109"
msgstr "Regina\nUgh! What do you plan to do\nwith the royal legacy?! And\nHis Majesty, the King of\nArcadia?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x174"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x174"
msgstr "Blood\nI don't have to tell you\nanything! Enough talk!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x1d7"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x1d7"
msgstr "Jack\nWe'll fight our way out!\nRegina, the prince!\nArth, go!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x22a"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x22a"
msgstr "Arth\nUnderstood."

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x248"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x248"
msgstr "Regina\nLeave it to me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/84/0x270"
msgid "dialogue/84/0x270"
msgstr "Blood\nDon't underestimate me!\nCommand Wolf squad,\nattack!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/85/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/85/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/85/0x31"
msgid "dialogue/85/0x31"
msgstr "Jack\nThe impact of the fight\nopened a hole in the wall?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/85/0x73"
msgid "dialogue/85/0x73"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince! Everyone, through\nthat hole!"

msgctxt "dialogue/85/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/85/0xa7"
msgstr "Blood\n!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/86/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/86/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nWhat?! Damn it! Why is\nthere a passage here?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/86/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/86/0x4f"
msgstr "Blood\n! Could these be ruins?!\nBlast it, my plan..."

msgctxt "dialogue/86/0x8c"
msgid "dialogue/86/0x8c"
msgstr "Blood\nAfter them! Follow me!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/87/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nHey! Where are we going?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/87/0x50"
msgstr "Regina\nI don't know! We'll just\nhave to follow the path!"

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/87/0x91"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0xb2"
msgid "dialogue/87/0xb2"
msgstr "Arth\nIt's them from before.\nThey're following us."

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0xe6"
msgid "dialogue/87/0xe6"
msgstr "Regina\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/87/0x104"
msgid "dialogue/87/0x104"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's hurry!"

msgctxt "dialogue/88/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/88/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nIt's too dangerous to go\nback now!"

msgctxt "dialogue/88/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/88/0x3c"
msgstr "Jack\nFor now, let's keep going\ndown this passage."

msgctxt "dialogue/89/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/89/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n...Where are we?"

msgctxt "dialogue/89/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/89/0x36"
msgstr "Regina\n...?... Ruins?"

msgctxt "dialogue/89/0x66"
msgid "dialogue/89/0x66"
msgstr "Arth\nIs this the end?"

msgctxt "dialogue/89/0x88"
msgid "dialogue/89/0x88"
msgstr "Jack\n...If only it were...\nLet's keep going."

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/90/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/90/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat was that?!\nAnd this place...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0x6f"
msgid "dialogue/90/0x6f"
msgstr "Arth\nIt's the same."

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/90/0x91"
msgstr "Jack\n...That's true. It feels\njust like the sealed\nchamber..."

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0xda"
msgid "dialogue/90/0xda"
msgstr "Regina\nDon't tell me this is...?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/90/0x108"
msgid "dialogue/90/0x108"
msgstr "Blood\nExactly! The space-time\ntransporter!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/91/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nThe one in the castle was a\ncopy of this one."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x3c"
msgstr "Blood\nThough that one's better\npreserved..."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x93"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x93"
msgstr "Regina\nYou're the one from before...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0xc7"
msgid "dialogue/91/0xc7"
msgstr "Blood\nThe transporter is one of the\nsuper-technologies left by\nthe ancient Zoidians."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x114"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x114"
msgstr "Blood\nWith it, you can travel\nfreely to the past and the\nfuture..."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x171"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x171"
msgstr "Regina\nSomething like that in the\nKingdom of Arcadia?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x1b3"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x1b3"
msgstr "Blood\nThe Kingdom of Arcadia was\nfounded precisely to protect\nthe transporter."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x210"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x210"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x231"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x231"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat did you say?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x25b"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x25b"
msgstr "Blood\nThink about it. Why else\nwould such a weak country\nsurvive until now between\nthe Empire and the Republic?"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x2c6"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x2c6"
msgstr "Jack\n...A neutral zone, so that\nneither side would open the\nPandora's box that is the\ntransporter..."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x32b"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x32b"
msgstr "Blood\nExactly. But that role is\nover. From now on, the\ntransporter is ours."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x390"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x390"
msgstr "Blood\nThough what it brings won't\nbe peace, but chaos."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x3f1"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x3f1"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x412"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x412"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat do you mean?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x43e"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x43e"
msgstr "Blood\nHeh heh heh. With the\ntransporter, we'll create...\nthe most powerful Zoid army!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x497"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x497"
msgstr "Blood\nWe'll gather the strongest\nZoids of the past and the\nfuture!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x4cb"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x4cb"
msgstr "Blood\nAnd plunge the world into\nchaos so we can rule it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x508"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x508"
msgstr "Blood\nTo that end..."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x524"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x524"
msgstr "Blood\n...we'll get rid of that\nnuisance, the King of\nArcadia, and take his\nkingdom."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x56d"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x56d"
msgstr "Blood\nThat's my emperor's script.\nAnd so far, everything's\ngoing according to plan."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x5d0"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x5d0"
msgstr "Regina\nI won't...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x5fa"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x5fa"
msgstr "Blood\n...allow it? Hmph,\nit's already too late."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x62b"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x62b"
msgstr "Blood\nUsing the transporter in the\ncastle, the Four Generals\nhave already left to hunt\nZoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x672"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x672"
msgstr "Blood\nRight about now, someone\nmust have jumped through time\nfrom that one over there."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x6b5"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x6b5"
msgstr "Blood\nThe most powerful Zoid army\nis only a matter of time."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x6f9"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x6f9"
msgstr "Jack\nWe'll stop it. We'll stop\nyour ambition."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x735"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x735"
msgstr "Blood\nCan you? And let me be\nclear: it's not my ambition.\nIt's the emperor's."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x78c"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x78c"
msgstr "Arth\n...And what's your ambition?"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x7c0"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x7c0"
msgstr "Blood\nHeh heh heh... I don't have\nto answer that."

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x7fc"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x7fc"
msgstr "Blood\nYou got away before, but\nnot this time!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x839"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x839"
msgstr "Blood\nThis place will be your\ngrave!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x884"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x884"
msgstr "Regina\nIt won't be that easy! I'll\nprotect Prince {name}!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x8ce"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x8ce"
msgstr "Blood\nNice attitude...\nThen come at me!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x915"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x915"
msgstr "Blood\nI am one of the Four\nGenerals, Blood Keel!\nHere I come!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/91/0x95e"
msgid "dialogue/91/0x95e"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/92/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/92/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nTsk, the control system isn't\ntuned! That Opis and his\nshoddy work!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/92/0x73"
msgid "dialogue/92/0x73"
msgstr "Blood\n...Then again, a machine\nthis cheap can't keep up\nwith my skill..."

msgctxt "dialogue/92/0xd2"
msgid "dialogue/92/0xd2"
msgstr "Blood\nYou'll pay for this!\n{name}... I won't forget\nthis!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/92/0x11c"
msgid "dialogue/92/0x11c"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/93/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nThe transporter... what a\ndisaster! We have to do\nsomething!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x5b"
msgstr "Arth\nWe go after him."

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x7f"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x7f"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0xa0"
msgid "dialogue/93/0xa0"
msgstr "Jack\nBut how are we supposed to\nfollow him?"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/93/0xe4"
msgstr "Regina\nOf course! The transporter\nwas just used."

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x11a"
msgstr "Regina\nThe destination data might\nstill be there..."

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x15e"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x15e"
msgstr "Jack\nThat's right!"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x184"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x184"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince, if we use the\ntransporter right now, we\ncan follow the enemy."

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x1cd"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x1cd"
msgstr "Regina\n...Though there's no\nguarantee we can come back."

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x216"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x216"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat shall we do, Prince?"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x244"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x244"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/93/0x265"
msgid "dialogue/93/0x265"
msgstr "Regina\nW-wait, {name}!!\nWait for me!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/94/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/94/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nWell, well... How\nreckless."

msgctxt "dialogue/94/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/94/0x46"
msgstr "Arth\nAren't you coming?"

msgctxt "dialogue/94/0x6e"
msgid "dialogue/94/0x6e"
msgstr "Jack\nOf course I'm coming!"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x3"
msgstr "A few hours earlier. Arcadia\nCastle, the Emperor's hall"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x36"
msgstr "Fran\nArcadia Castle is under our\ncontrol, sir."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x79"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x79"
msgstr "Fran\nWe also control the village\nand the city. We've declared\na curfew."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0xc2"
msgid "dialogue/95/0xc2"
msgstr "Fran\nBoth the Republic and the\nEmpire noticed the attack\nand, to avoid destroying\neach other, pulled back to\nthe border."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x12b"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x12b"
msgstr "Emperor\nAll they had to do was serve\nas the spark for our attack,"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x168"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x168"
msgstr "Emperor\nand now stay put..."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x198"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x198"
msgstr "Emperor\n...What a plain castle,\nthough. Of course, it was\nhis, after all..."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x1f7"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x1f7"
msgstr "Fran\n?... His, sir?"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x22d"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x22d"
msgstr "Emperor\nThat's none of your concern.\nForget it."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x25d"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x25d"
msgstr "Fran\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x27d"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x27d"
msgstr "Emperor\nBy the way, Fran."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x295"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x295"
msgstr "Emperor\nWhich Zoids are worthy of\nleading my army?"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x2e8"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x2e8"
msgstr "Fran\n...Of leading it, sir?"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x31e"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x31e"
msgstr "Emperor\nIndeed...\nAnd I don't mean\nmass-produced scrap."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x35b"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x35b"
msgstr "Emperor\nI want two imposing beasts\nat the head of my ranks."

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x3aa"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x3aa"
msgstr "Fran\nThe Shield Liger and the\nSaber Tiger... and an\nOrganoid, correct?"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x40d"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x40d"
msgstr "Emperor\nThen go! Cross time and\nfind those two Zoids!"

msgctxt "dialogue/95/0x45a"
msgid "dialogue/95/0x45a"
msgstr "Fran\nAt once!"

msgctxt "dialogue/96/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/96/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\n...Heh heh heh. Arcadia\nCastle, I have returned!"

msgctxt "dialogue/96/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/96/0x4b"
msgstr "Emperor\nThey say his son escaped,\nbut what can he possibly\ndo?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/96/0x88"
msgid "dialogue/96/0x88"
msgstr "Emperor\nNo one, absolutely no one,\nwill stop my ambition!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/96/0xc9"
msgid "dialogue/96/0xc9"
msgstr "Emperor\nHeh heh heh... Ha ha ha,\nha ha ha!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/97/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\n{name}... I mean,\nPrince! Are you all right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x69"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x69"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd honestly! Rushing in\nlike that, all on your own..."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0xac"
msgid "dialogue/97/0xac"
msgstr "Jack\nNow, now, Regina.\nThat's enough, isn't it?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0xfb"
msgid "dialogue/97/0xfb"
msgstr "Regina\nYou stay out of this!"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x12d"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x12d"
msgstr "Arth\n...What a temper."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x155"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x155"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat did you say?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x181"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x181"
msgstr "Jack\nNow, now, both of you!\nArth, don't provoke her."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x1c4"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x1c4"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd more importantly!"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x1e6"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x1e6"
msgstr "Jack\nFirst of all, we have to\nfollow the Zoids that\nvanished before us."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x237"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x237"
msgstr "Regina\n...Understood, Jack."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x26d"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x26d"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x293"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x293"
msgstr "Jack\n? What is it, Arth?\nSomething on your mind?"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x2e0"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x2e0"
msgstr "Arth\n...No, nothing."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x304"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x304"
msgstr "Arth\nMore importantly... given\nthe time that's passed, they\nmust still be close.\nLet's hurry."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x357"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x357"
msgstr "Jack\n...You're right."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x383"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x383"
msgstr "Regina\nSo which way do we go?"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x3b1"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x3b1"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x3d2"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x3d2"
msgstr "Jack\nIt seems we're on the\nRepublic's side, across the\nRed River."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x427"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x427"
msgstr "Jack\nIf I remember correctly, a\nlittle further north there's\na town called Sand Colony."

msgctxt "dialogue/97/0x476"
msgid "dialogue/97/0x476"
msgstr "Jack\nFor now, let's head there."

msgctxt "dialogue/98/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/98/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/98/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/98/0x2d"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat is it, Prince?"

msgctxt "dialogue/98/0x55"
msgid "dialogue/98/0x55"
msgstr "Regina\n...Since we've risked\ntraveling through time,"

msgctxt "dialogue/98/0xa8"
msgid "dialogue/98/0xa8"
msgstr "Regina\nwe should find out what\nthe enemy is up to."

msgctxt "dialogue/98/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/98/0xe4"
msgstr "Arth\nAgreed."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/99/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nTheir goal is to create the\nmost powerful Zoid army..."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x4b"
msgstr "Regina\nIs that really all there is?"

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x85"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x85"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/99/0xa6"
msgstr "Jack\nThere's no telling for now.\nBest to ask them in person."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0xfd"
msgid "dialogue/99/0xfd"
msgstr "Regina\nYou're awfully calm about it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x129"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x129"
msgstr "Jack\nThere's no use getting\nimpatient. Either way, we\nknow very little."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x176"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x176"
msgstr "Jack\nThe only thing we know is\ntheir goal."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x1ac"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x1ac"
msgstr "Jack\nBeyond that, we know\nnothing: not who they are,\nnor how strong they are."

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x1ff"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x1ff"
msgstr "Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x227"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x227"
msgstr "{name}\n!!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/99/0x244"
msgid "dialogue/99/0x244"
msgstr "Regina\nEnemies?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/100/0xc"
msgstr "Fran\n!\nArth! You!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x3f"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x3f"
msgstr "Arth\n......So it's you, Fran."

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x79"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x79"
msgstr "Fran\nAnd what if it is?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0xb1"
msgid "dialogue/100/0xb1"
msgstr "Arth\n...What are you doing?"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0xdd"
msgid "dialogue/100/0xdd"
msgstr "Fran\nI don't have to tell\na traitor like you!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x11d"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x11d"
msgstr "Arth\n...What are you doing?"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x149"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x149"
msgstr "Fran\nUgh! Always the same!\nThat know-it-all look.\nJust like back then!"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x1a8"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x1a8"
msgstr "Fran\nArth! Someday I'll...\nfor what you did back then,"

msgctxt "dialogue/100/0x1db"
msgid "dialogue/100/0x1db"
msgstr "Fran\nturning against us... I'll\nmake you regret it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/101/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...Regret..."

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/101/0x38"
msgstr "Regina\nArth! That woman...?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0x6a"
msgid "dialogue/101/0x6a"
msgstr "Arth\nShe got away."

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0x8a"
msgid "dialogue/101/0x8a"
msgstr "Regina\nShe got away...?\nWhat do you mean?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0xca"
msgid "dialogue/101/0xca"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0xeb"
msgid "dialogue/101/0xeb"
msgstr "Jack\nNow, now...\nWe know where she\nwent..."

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0x13e"
msgid "dialogue/101/0x13e"
msgstr "Arth\nLet's go..."

msgctxt "dialogue/101/0x164"
msgid "dialogue/101/0x164"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat's wrong with you?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/707/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/707/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI've helped the royal army\ntoo: I got the transporter\nready to use."

msgctxt "dialogue/707/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/707/0x5f"
msgstr "Dr. T\nBut the enemy's transporter\ninterferes with it a lot,\nand there's no way to reach\nthe era you want."

msgctxt "dialogue/708/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/708/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nIf only there were a\nTrinity Liger Zoid core\nin some other era..."

msgctxt "dialogue/709/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/709/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nTh-that's...! The Trinity\nLiger's Zoid core!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/709/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/709/0x4f"
msgstr "Dr. T\nBrilliant! With this, the\nTrinity Liger will live\nagain!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/709/0x9c"
msgid "dialogue/709/0x9c"
msgstr "Dr. T\nPlease, let me build it\nin my lab!"

msgctxt "dialogue/710/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/710/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nHow's the Trinity Liger\ndoing?"

msgctxt "dialogue/710/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/710/0x4c"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/710/0x6d"
msgid "dialogue/710/0x6d"
msgstr "Dr. T\nAh, I want to be a Zoid\npilot too. And race across\nthe land like the wind!"

msgctxt "dialogue/710/0xd4"
msgid "dialogue/710/0xd4"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI envy you all."

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/711/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nHello, welcome."

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/711/0x2e"
msgstr "Dr. T\nHow's the Trinity\nLiger doing...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0x5e"
msgid "dialogue/711/0x5e"
msgstr "Dr. T\nAaah!! Wh-what is\nthis?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/711/0x9b"
msgstr "Dr. T\nWhat have you done to my\nTrinity Liger?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0xd1"
msgid "dialogue/711/0xd1"
msgstr "Dr. T\nYou're ruining the Trinity\nLiger's original beauty!\nIts power! Its nobility!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/711/0x130"
msgid "dialogue/711/0x130"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI was supposed to be the\nfirst to modify the\nTrinity Liger~~!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/712/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/712/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. T\nI should have been the\nfirst to modify the\nTrinity Liger~~!!"

