msgctxt "dialogue/69/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/69/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince! First we need to\nfind out what the enemy is\nplotting on the other side\nof time."

msgctxt "dialogue/69/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/69/0x57"
msgstr "Regina\nThink about what we\nshould do now!"

msgctxt "dialogue/70/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/70/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nPrince, hold on for now!\nThe day will come when we\ntake back the castle!"

msgctxt "dialogue/71/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/71/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nIt seems the Imperial army\nis pouring all its forces\ninto defending the castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/71/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/71/0x4f"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, I'm certain we'll\ntake back the castle very\nsoon."

msgctxt "dialogue/72/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/72/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\n...... It seems the enemy\nhas blocked the escape\npassage."

msgctxt "dialogue/72/0x5a"
msgid "dialogue/72/0x5a"
msgstr "Regina\nThe enemy won't be naive\nenough to let us in this\nway..."

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/102/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nArth and that woman...\nDo they know each other...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x50"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x71"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x71"
msgstr "Jack\nWhy do you think so?"

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/102/0xa7"
msgstr "Regina\nI don't know, I just got the\nfeeling there was something\nbehind it."

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0xe7"
msgid "dialogue/102/0xe7"
msgstr "Jack\nPerhaps. But until Arth\ndecides to tell us\nhimself..."

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x144"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x144"
msgstr "Regina\nYou mean we shouldn't ask\nhim anything?"

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x176"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x176"
msgstr "Jack\nExactly. We all have a\nsecret or two."

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x1c5"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x1c5"
msgstr "Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/102/0x1ed"
msgid "dialogue/102/0x1ed"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x3"
msgstr "Regina and Jack\nPrince!"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x2f"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x2f"
msgstr "Arth\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x4b"
msgstr "Van\nOww, that hurts...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x6d"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x6d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x8e"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x8e"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince! Are you hurt?"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/103/0xbd"
msgstr "Jack\n...He seems to be fine.\nAnd you, kid, are you\nhurt?"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x110"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x110"
msgstr "Regina\n...An Organoid?"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x140"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x140"
msgstr "Van\nI'm not a kid!\nThe name's Van! And this\nis my partner, Zeke."

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x187"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x187"
msgstr "Van\nBut this is no time to be\nstanding around making\nintroductions!"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x1be"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x1be"
msgstr "Van\nI've got to go after\nthat woman!"

msgctxt "dialogue/103/0x1f0"
msgid "dialogue/103/0x1f0"
msgstr "Van\nSorry, I'm in a hurry!\nCome on, Zeke!"

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/104/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nThat woman? Does he mean\nFran...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x44"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x44"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat does this mean?\nWas that boy after that\nwoman too?"

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x9f"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x9f"
msgstr "Jack\nI can't say for sure..."

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0xe3"
msgid "dialogue/104/0xe3"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x109"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x109"
msgstr "Regina\nCould it have something to\ndo with that Organoid?"

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x154"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x154"
msgstr "Jack\nWho knows...\nIt's quite possible, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x19d"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x19d"
msgstr "Regina\n...I don't understand any\nof this..."

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x1d9"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x1d9"
msgstr "Arth\nWe'll have to look into it."

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x203"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x203"
msgstr "Jack\nIndeed. Let's gather\ninformation in the town.\nWe may learn something."

msgctxt "dialogue/104/0x262"
msgid "dialogue/104/0x262"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA suspicious woman?\nHmm, that alone doesn't\ntell me much."

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x51"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x51"
msgstr "Arth\nA tall woman with a\npiercing gaze."

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x76"
msgstr "Villager\nAh, you mean the young\nwoman who was with a\nblonde girl?"

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0xd5"
msgid "dialogue/105/0xd5"
msgstr "Jack\nA blonde girl?"

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0xf6"
msgid "dialogue/105/0xf6"
msgstr "Villager\nYeah, neither of them is\nfrom around here. That's\nwhy I remember them well."

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x14d"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x14d"
msgstr "Regina\nWho could that be? Or is\nit someone else?"

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x187"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x187"
msgstr "Jack\n...I don't know."

msgctxt "dialogue/105/0x1b7"
msgid "dialogue/105/0x1b7"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/106/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/106/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say the Republic\nrecently blew up the Fire\nBridge over the Red River."

msgctxt "dialogue/106/0x64"
msgid "dialogue/106/0x64"
msgstr "Villager\nThere were skirmishes on\nthe Red River too...\nIs a war going to break\nout?"

msgctxt "dialogue/106/0xc5"
msgid "dialogue/106/0xc5"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/107/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/107/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nIf war breaks out, it's all\nthe same to us. If anything,\nthere's business\neverywhere."

msgctxt "dialogue/108/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/108/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI don't know anything about\nthat woman, but I do know\nthe Organoid boy's friends.\nThey were at the tavern."

msgctxt "dialogue/108/0x77"
msgid "dialogue/108/0x77"
msgstr "Arth\nCompanions?"

msgctxt "dialogue/108/0x8e"
msgid "dialogue/108/0x8e"
msgstr "Villager\nA mean-looking guy, a\ngreedy-looking woman and\na blonde girl who seemed\na bit spacey."

msgctxt "dialogue/108/0xed"
msgid "dialogue/108/0xed"
msgstr "Villager\nA while ago, the scowling\none and the girl went\nshopping."

msgctxt "dialogue/109/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/109/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI don't know who did it,\nbut blowing up the Fire\nBridge really messed\nthings up for us."

msgctxt "dialogue/109/0x64"
msgid "dialogue/109/0x64"
msgstr "Villager\nNo goods come in from the\nEmpire anymore. Business\nhas hit rock bottom."

msgctxt "dialogue/110/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/110/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say thieves have\nshown up in Rock Colony,\nright next door. What\ndangerous times."

msgctxt "dialogue/111/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/111/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA boy and an Organoid?\nYeah, he was shouting that\nsomeone took the girl who\nwas with him."

msgctxt "dialogue/111/0x62"
msgid "dialogue/111/0x62"
msgstr "Villager\nShe must've gotten lost.\nHappens all the time in\nthis town..."

msgctxt "dialogue/112/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/112/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis is Sand Colony.\nAnyone traveling in the\narea passes through here."

msgctxt "dialogue/113/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/113/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nNot sure if she's the woman\nyou're after, but there was\none who kept asking about\nZoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/113/0x74"
msgid "dialogue/113/0x74"
msgstr "Jack\nAbout Zoids?"

msgctxt "dialogue/113/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/113/0x97"
msgstr "Villager\nYeah, Ligers, Tigers and\nthe like... As if a place\nthis remote would have\nsuch rare Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/113/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/113/0x11a"
msgstr "Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/114/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/114/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nLooking for a kid? Sorry,\nI don't know anything."

msgctxt "dialogue/115/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/115/0xc"
msgstr "Moonbay\nSorry, we're talking about\nsomething important."

msgctxt "dialogue/116/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/116/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nOh, what a cute little\nlady! Care to join me\nfor some tea?"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/117/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nHuh? What do you want?"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x3e"
msgstr "Jack\nDo you know a boy named\nVan?"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x78"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x78"
msgstr "Moonbay\nVan?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x9c"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x9c"
msgstr "Irvine\nWho are you people...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/117/0xd0"
msgstr "Arth\nWe're looking for a boy\nnamed Van. Where is he?"

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x113"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x113"
msgstr "Irvine\nI don't have to tell\nyou that."

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x157"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x157"
msgstr "Arth\n...What a nasty face."

msgctxt "dialogue/117/0x183"
msgid "dialogue/117/0x183"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat did you say?!\nLook who's talking!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/118/0xc"
msgstr "Moonbay\nThat's enough, Irvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x42"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x42"
msgstr "Regina\nThat's enough, Arth!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x7a"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x7a"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0xa0"
msgid "dialogue/118/0xa0"
msgstr "Irvine\nTch!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0xc4"
msgid "dialogue/118/0xc4"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWhat, it's over already?\nHow boring."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x107"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x107"
msgstr "Irvine\nYou shut up, old man!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x13b"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x13b"
msgstr "Moonbay\nYou too, Irvine.\nAnd who are you people?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x18a"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x18a"
msgstr "Jack\nYou see, we're chasing a\ncertain woman, and it\nseems Van is after her\ntoo..."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x1f5"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x1f5"
msgstr "Moonbay\nVan?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x21d"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x21d"
msgstr "Jack\nYes. He was with an\nOrganoid named Zeke."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x270"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x270"
msgstr "Irvine\nHe was only with Zeke?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x2b3"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x2b3"
msgstr "Arth\nI don't have to tell\nyou that."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x2e5"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x2e5"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat?! Why, you...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x317"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x317"
msgstr "Regina\nArth!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x33e"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x33e"
msgstr "Regina\nSorry. It was just him\nand the Organoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x37c"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x37c"
msgstr "Irvine and Moonbay\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x3b0"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x3b0"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe young lady wasn't\nwith him?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x3ea"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x3ea"
msgstr "Regina\nThe young lady?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x412"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x412"
msgstr "Moonbay\nA girl named Fiona.\nI thought she was with\nVan."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x46f"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x46f"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat does this mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x499"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x499"
msgstr "Regina\nThis Van is chasing Fran,\nand this Fiona, who should\nbe with him, isn't..."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x4fe"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x4fe"
msgstr "Arth\n...Fran took her."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x530"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x530"
msgstr "Jack\nCould be, but\nwhy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x56c"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x56c"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat's going on? Do you\nknow something? If you're\nhiding it, you'll regret it."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x5c7"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x5c7"
msgstr "Moonbay\nDrop it, Irvine."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x5ed"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x5ed"
msgstr "Moonbay\nThe woman you're chasing,\nand the reason Van is\nchasing her..."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x63c"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x63c"
msgstr "Moonbay\nSound like a good basis\nfor a deal?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x68f"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x68f"
msgstr "Jack\nYou mean we should join\nforces?"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x6bf"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x6bf"
msgstr "Moonbay\nRight. For now, the goal\nis to find that woman.\nUntil then, we stick\ntogether!"

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x71c"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x71c"
msgstr "Irvine\nI don't trust them."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x748"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x748"
msgstr "Moonbay\nBut finding Van and Fiona\non our own would be\nreally hard."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x79b"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x79b"
msgstr "Jack\nIndeed. With more people\nsearching, we'll be more\nefficient."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x7f0"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x7f0"
msgstr "Irvine\nTch! Guess there's no\nchoice. Truce, for now."

msgctxt "dialogue/118/0x832"
msgid "dialogue/118/0x832"
msgstr "Irvine and the others\njoin the party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/119/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nFine, we've joined forces,\nbut where do we start\nlooking?"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x50"
msgstr "Moonbay\nWell..."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x7a"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x7a"
msgstr "Arth\n...She must have\naccomplices."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0xaa"
msgid "dialogue/119/0xaa"
msgstr "Regina\nAccomplices?"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0xcc"
msgid "dialogue/119/0xcc"
msgstr "Arth\nFran hasn't been here\nlong."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x10b"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x10b"
msgstr "Arth\nCarrying off a person\nisn't easy."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x149"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x149"
msgstr "Jack\n...You mean someone is\nhelping her?"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x181"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x181"
msgstr "Moonbay\nAccomplices... Don't tell\nme it's them!"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x1b9"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x1b9"
msgstr "Irvine\nThose guys again..."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x1e7"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x1e7"
msgstr "Regina\nDo you know who it could\nbe?"

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x20f"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x20f"
msgstr "Moonbay\nDesert Arcobaleno. A band\nof desert thieves.\nI wouldn't put it past\nthem."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x26c"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x26c"
msgstr "Arth\nThat settles it."

msgctxt "dialogue/119/0x290"
msgid "dialogue/119/0x290"
msgstr "Irvine\nBy the way, if you want me\nto fight, put my Zoid in\nthe unit's formation."

msgctxt "dialogue/120/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/120/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI hear there are thieves\nin Rock Colony, right next\ndoor."

msgctxt "dialogue/120/0x43"
msgid "dialogue/120/0x43"
msgstr "Villager\nBy the way, a while ago a\nkid with an Organoid was\nasking the same thing..."

msgctxt "dialogue/121/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/121/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA band of thieves?\nNo idea."

msgctxt "dialogue/122/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/122/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThieves? With war about to\nbreak out, it's less and\nless safe around here."

msgctxt "dialogue/123/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/123/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nDesert Arco-what? Never\nheard of it in this town."

msgctxt "dialogue/124/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/124/0xc"
msgstr "Moonbay\nVan?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/124/0x32"
msgid "dialogue/124/0x32"
msgstr "Irvine\nRushing off on his own\nagain!"

msgctxt "dialogue/124/0x6e"
msgid "dialogue/124/0x6e"
msgstr "Van\nMoonbay! And Irvine\ntoo!"

msgctxt "dialogue/124/0xa4"
msgid "dialogue/124/0xa4"
msgstr "Irvine\nYou're in a hurry, right?\nLet's get these guys out\nof the way!"

msgctxt "dialogue/124/0xef"
msgid "dialogue/124/0xef"
msgstr "Van\nThanks, Irvine!\nI'll leave them to you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/125/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/125/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nHey! Wait!!\nI told you not to charge\nin alone!"

msgctxt "dialogue/125/0x69"
msgid "dialogue/125/0x69"
msgstr "Moonbay\nIrvine! First we deal with\nthe enemy in front of us!"

msgctxt "dialogue/125/0xac"
msgid "dialogue/125/0xac"
msgstr "Moonbay\nYou too, please!"

msgctxt "dialogue/125/0xdc"
msgid "dialogue/125/0xdc"
msgstr "{name}\n......!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/126/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nThat Van...\nHe took off. He's got no\npatience at all."

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0x59"
msgid "dialogue/126/0x59"
msgstr "Moonbay\nJust like someone else I\nknow."

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0x85"
msgid "dialogue/126/0x85"
msgstr "Irvine\nOh yeah? And who might\nthat be?"

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0xc1"
msgid "dialogue/126/0xc1"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHo ho ho ho!"

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0xeb"
msgid "dialogue/126/0xeb"
msgstr "Irvine\nShut up, old man!"

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0x11b"
msgid "dialogue/126/0x11b"
msgstr "Jack\nEnough of that. Let's go\nafter him!"

msgctxt "dialogue/126/0x164"
msgid "dialogue/126/0x164"
msgstr "Irvine\nI know.\nLet's go!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/127/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/127/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\n...What happened here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/127/0x5f"
msgstr "Jack\n...Looks like there's been\na battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/127/0x97"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/127/0xbd"
msgstr "Irvine\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/127/0xe7"
msgid "dialogue/127/0xe7"
msgstr "Moonbay\nEither way, let's ask\nsomeone."

msgctxt "dialogue/128/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/128/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhat happened?!\nA Redler suddenly attacked\nus!"

msgctxt "dialogue/128/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/128/0x54"
msgstr "Villager\nI bet it was the thieves\nwho've been prowling\naround here lately!"

msgctxt "dialogue/129/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/129/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA band of thieves?\nI don't know... So far it\nwas just a Redler."

msgctxt "dialogue/130/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/130/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThieves? They say their\nhideout is in the cave to\nthe north."

msgctxt "dialogue/131/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/131/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI didn't get a good look at\nwho was piloting the\nRedler..., but it looked\nlike a woman."

msgctxt "dialogue/131/0x5c"
msgid "dialogue/131/0x5c"
msgstr "Villager\nThere are some fearsome\nwomen in this world. Mine's\nan angel by comparison."

msgctxt "dialogue/132/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/132/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nA blonde girl...?\nI think I saw her for a\nsecond..."

msgctxt "dialogue/132/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/132/0x4c"
msgstr "Boy\nBut she was there and gone\nin a flash..."

msgctxt "dialogue/133/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/133/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA blonde girl? Yeah, she\nwas in the Redler's\ncockpit. I saw her with\nmy own eyes!"

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/134/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nA Redler... That settles\nit."

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x40"
msgstr "Moonbay\n...Yeah..."

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x6e"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x6e"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat's up, Moonbay?"

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x9e"
msgstr "Moonbay\nSomething doesn't add up."

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0xc8"
msgid "dialogue/134/0xc8"
msgstr "Moonbay\nBrutes or not, would they\nattack a town with just\none Zoid...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x125"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x125"
msgstr "Irvine\nBut it was a Redler.\nAnd they say Fiona was\nin it."

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x174"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x174"
msgstr "Moonbay\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/134/0x19c"
msgid "dialogue/134/0x19c"
msgstr "Irvine\nMulling it over won't get\nus anywhere. We'll ask\nthem. Let's go!"

msgctxt "dialogue/135/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/135/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nSince the thieves attacked\nus, I can't sleep a wink\nfor fear they'll be back..."

msgctxt "dialogue/136/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/136/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nBefore they deal with the\nthieves, couldn't someone\ndeal with my missus...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/137/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/137/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nLately, what with all the\nthieves and such, things\nhave gotten really hectic."

msgctxt "dialogue/138/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/138/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis is Rock Colony. A\ncountry town with nothing\nin it."

msgctxt "dialogue/139/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/139/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nThey say it's still\ndangerous to play outside...\nSo boring..."

msgctxt "dialogue/140/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/140/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI'm worried about the\nthieves, but I just wish\nthe war would end soon..."

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/141/0xc"
msgstr "Rosso\nSo it's you lot...\nJust as that woman said."

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x4c"
msgstr "Van\nYou're late, Irvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x7c"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x7c"
msgstr "Irvine\nThe star always shows up\nlast."

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0xb6"
msgid "dialogue/141/0xb6"
msgstr "Rosso\nEnough of your big talk!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0xda"
msgid "dialogue/141/0xda"
msgstr "Rosso\nBut you've saved me some\nwork by bringing the\nOrganoid right to me."

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x127"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x127"
msgstr "Rosso\nIf I offer the Organoid\nto that person,"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x166"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x166"
msgstr "Rosso\nI can get back into the\narmy..."

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x1a5"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x1a5"
msgstr "Rosso\nLet's go, Viola!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x1d3"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x1d3"
msgstr "Viola\nRight!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x1f9"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x1f9"
msgstr "Van\nYou're not getting Zeke!\nAnd you're giving Fiona\nback to me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x252"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x252"
msgstr "Rosso\nFiona?"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x27a"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x27a"
msgstr "Van\nDon't play dumb!\nLet's go, Zeke!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x2b3"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x2b3"
msgstr "Jack\nVan! Please join our\nformation and fight\nproperly!"

msgctxt "dialogue/141/0x303"
msgid "dialogue/141/0x303"
msgstr "Van joins the party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/142/0xc"
msgstr "Rosso\nWhat?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x20"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x20"
msgstr "Rosso\nHow could they pierce the\narmor of this Red Horn?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x6f"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x6f"
msgstr "Viola\nRosso!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x97"
msgstr "Van\nCome on!\nWhere's Fiona?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0xc9"
msgid "dialogue/142/0xc9"
msgstr "Rosso\nFiona? What are you\ntalking about?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0xf9"
msgid "dialogue/142/0xf9"
msgstr "Irvine\nDon't play dumb.\nYou took her off in the\nRedler, didn't you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x14a"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x14a"
msgstr "Viola\nThe Redler?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x176"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x176"
msgstr "Irvine\nIt's your Redler, right?\nThe same one that\nattacked Rock Colony."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x1c5"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x1c5"
msgstr "Rosso\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x1eb"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x1eb"
msgstr "Viola\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x215"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x215"
msgstr "Moonbay\nIt's not your Redler?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x24d"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x24d"
msgstr "Viola\nThat's......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x27d"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x27d"
msgstr "Rosso\nIt's not Viola's Redler."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x2b3"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x2b3"
msgstr "Irvine\nThen whose is it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x2ed"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x2ed"
msgstr "Rosso\nA woman's, named Fran."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x314"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x314"
msgstr "{name}/Regina/Jack/Arth\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x347"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x347"
msgstr "Viola\nRosso!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x36f"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x36f"
msgstr "Rosso\nDoesn't matter. We lost.\nIt's my fault for\nbelieving that woman's\nwords."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x3c6"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x3c6"
msgstr "Viola\n...Rosso."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x3f0"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x3f0"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat do you mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x41e"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x41e"
msgstr "Rosso\nAll we wanted was that\nOrganoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x45b"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x45b"
msgstr "Rosso\nThat Fran said she'd bring\nthe Organoid, so we worked\nwith her..."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x4ae"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x4ae"
msgstr "Rosso\nI don't know anything\nabout some brat called\nFiona."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x4f7"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x4f7"
msgstr "Van\nHow am I supposed to\nbelieve that?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x527"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x527"
msgstr "Rosso\nBelieve it or not, that's\nup to you. That woman\nused us."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x574"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x574"
msgstr "Rosso\nShe probably wanted to use\nus to hold you up here."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x5c9"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x5c9"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd we fell into the trap\nand wasted our time here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x628"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x628"
msgstr "Irvine\nI don't trust it."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x654"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x654"
msgstr "Arth\nI wouldn't put it past\nFran."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x684"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x684"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, what do you think?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x6b6"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x6b6"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x6d7"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x6d7"
msgstr "Jack\nThen do you know where\nFran and Miss Fiona have\ngone?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x72e"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x72e"
msgstr "Rosso\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x754"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x754"
msgstr "Viola\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x77e"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x77e"
msgstr "Viola\n...Probably to the Red\nRiver, to the west. On the\nImperial side, past the\nFire Bridge."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x7e9"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x7e9"
msgstr "Van\nThe Fire Bridge?\nWe brought it down in the\nlast battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x82c"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x82c"
msgstr "Van\nSo what do we do now?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x858"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x858"
msgstr "Rosso\n...Somewhere on the Red\nRiver there should be a\ncave that goes around it."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x8a9"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x8a9"
msgstr "Moonbay\nAnd where's this cave?"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x8df"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x8df"
msgstr "Rosso\nHmph, I don't have to tell\nyou that much.\nFind it yourselves."

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x92e"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x92e"
msgstr "Van\nThen let's get moving!\nWait for me, Fiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/142/0x971"
msgid "dialogue/142/0x971"
msgstr "Van\nIrvine, Moonbay...\nand, uh, whoever you guys\nare, hurry up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/143/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/143/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nHey, I told you not to go\nalone! Listen to the rest\nof us for once!"

msgctxt "dialogue/143/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/143/0x5b"
msgstr "Moonbay\nHey! Wait up, Van!"

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/144/0xc"
msgstr "Rosso\nHeh heh heh... They really\ngave us a thrashing."

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x3e"
msgstr "Viola\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x68"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x68"
msgstr "Rosso\nWell, we're clearing out\ntoo."

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x9c"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x9c"
msgstr "Viola\nRosso?"

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0xc2"
msgid "dialogue/144/0xc2"
msgstr "Rosso\nKnowing that woman, she\nhasn't just pulled strings\nin town, but in the Empire\nand the Republic too."

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x11b"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x11b"
msgstr "Rosso\nNow even the Empire sees\nus as a band of thieves."

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x168"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x168"
msgstr "Viola\nIt can't be!"

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x190"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x190"
msgstr "Rosso\nBut I'm not about to let\nthat woman get away with\nit just like that!"

msgctxt "dialogue/144/0x1c9"
msgid "dialogue/144/0x1c9"
msgstr "Rosso\nLet's go, Viola!"

msgctxt "dialogue/145/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/145/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe thieves have been dealt\nwith. Finally, some peace\nand quiet."

msgctxt "dialogue/146/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/146/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWell, no more thieves, so\ntime to reopen the shop!"

msgctxt "dialogue/147/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/147/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nTaking out the thieves...\nWhat brave people!"

msgctxt "dialogue/148/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/148/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nThey already took out the\nthieves...? And here I\nwanted the reward..."

msgctxt "dialogue/149/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/149/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nEven with the thieves gone,\nthe war won't end, will it?\nI hope it's over before my\ngrandson grows up..."

msgctxt "dialogue/150/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/150/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThieves or no thieves, the\nwar will kill us anyway.\nThen I'd rather die on my\nown land..."

msgctxt "dialogue/151/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/151/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhen push comes to shove,\nmen are useless! It's\nobvious, the future\nbelongs to women!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/152/0xc"
msgstr "Van\nRaven?!\nWhat are you doing here?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x45"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x45"
msgstr "Van\nWeren't you with the\nImperial army?! Or do you\nwant to fight me again?"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x92"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x92"
msgstr "Van\nThis time won't be like\nlast time!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0xcd"
msgid "dialogue/152/0xcd"
msgstr "Raven\nYou're still all talk,\nVan."

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0xff"
msgid "dialogue/152/0xff"
msgstr "Raven\nYou're trash who can't\npilot a Zoid without his\nOrganoid..."

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x156"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x156"
msgstr "Raven\nWant me to beat you like\nlast time?"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x194"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x194"
msgstr "Van\nWhat did you say?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x1b4"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x1b4"
msgstr "Raven\nYou pilot Zoids badly,\nand you fight even worse."

msgctxt "dialogue/152/0x1f7"
msgid "dialogue/152/0x1f7"
msgstr "Raven\nI'll show you what real\nZoid fighting looks like."

msgctxt "dialogue/153/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/153/0xc"
msgstr "Raven\nHeh. That was rather\nentertaining."

msgctxt "dialogue/153/0x32"
msgid "dialogue/153/0x32"
msgstr "Raven\nBut it seems this battle\nwas set up by that\nwoman..."

msgctxt "dialogue/153/0x85"
msgid "dialogue/153/0x85"
msgstr "Van\nWhat did you say?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/153/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/153/0xa7"
msgstr "Raven\nAnd I don't like that...\nI'm done for today..."

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/154/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\n...Did we win?"

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/154/0x38"
msgstr "Irvine\n...No way. He didn't even\nfuse with his Organoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/154/0x8b"
msgstr "Moonbay\nYou mean he let us get\naway?"

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0xc1"
msgid "dialogue/154/0xc1"
msgstr "Van\nDammit!"

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0xd8"
msgid "dialogue/154/0xd8"
msgstr "Girl's Voice\nVaaan!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/154/0x102"
msgid "dialogue/154/0x102"
msgstr "Van\nFiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/155/0xc"
msgstr "Van\nAre you okay, Fiona?!\nAre you hurt?"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x40"
msgstr "Fiona\nNo, I'm fine."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x68"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x68"
msgstr "Moonbay\nHoney, you gave us\nquite a scare."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x9e"
msgstr "Van\nBy the way, where'd that\nwoman who took Fiona go?"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0xed"
msgid "dialogue/155/0xed"
msgstr "Fiona\n? I don't know."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x115"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x115"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat does this mean?\nDid she run away?"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x147"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x147"
msgstr "Jack\n...What do you think, Arth?"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x181"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x181"
msgstr "Arth\nNo idea.\nBut this isn't over."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x1c4"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x1c4"
msgstr "Regina\n...Right."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x1ec"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x1ec"
msgstr "Jack\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x214"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x214"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x235"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x235"
msgstr "Moonbay\nWell, this isn't a place\nto hang around.\nLet's get out of here."

msgctxt "dialogue/155/0x28e"
msgid "dialogue/155/0x28e"
msgstr "Irvine\nYeah, after all that\nracket, the Imperial army\nmight show up."

msgctxt "dialogue/156/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/156/0xc"
msgstr "Van\nThanks, you saved us."

msgctxt "dialogue/156/0x3a"
msgid "dialogue/156/0x3a"
msgstr "Moonbay\nAnd what are you guys\ngoing to do now?"

msgctxt "dialogue/156/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/156/0x76"
msgstr "Jack\n...We'll investigate this\narea a little more."

msgctxt "dialogue/156/0xb8"
msgid "dialogue/156/0xb8"
msgstr "Moonbay\n...I see."

msgctxt "dialogue/156/0xde"
msgid "dialogue/156/0xde"
msgstr "Irvine\nDon't overdo it."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/157/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x51"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x51"
msgstr "Arth\n...Fran!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x79"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x79"
msgstr "Jack\nJust as I thought, you\nwere hiding..."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0xb3"
msgid "dialogue/157/0xb3"
msgstr "Fran\n...So you knew."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0xe7"
msgid "dialogue/157/0xe7"
msgstr "Jack\nNo. We still don't know\nwhat your goal is."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x129"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x129"
msgstr "Fran\nIsn't it obvious? To pit\nthe Shield Liger against\nthe Saber Tiger."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x170"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x170"
msgstr "Fran\nIf both fell, fine. And if\none was left, it wouldn't\ncome out unscathed."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x1c5"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x1c5"
msgstr "Fran\nCapturing it then would\nbe child's play."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x1f7"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x1f7"
msgstr "Fran\nGetting Raven here took\nquite some effort, you\nknow?"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x242"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x242"
msgstr "Jack\nThat's not what I mean.\nWhy didn't you run when\nthe plan failed?"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x2a1"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x2a1"
msgstr "Jack\nThere was no need to show\nyourself to us, was there?"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x2ee"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x2ee"
msgstr "Fran\nWell, because...\nheh heh heh..."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x324"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x324"
msgstr "Fran\nBecause YOU are here!!\nArth!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x363"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x363"
msgstr "Regina\nHuh?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x385"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x385"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x3a6"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x3a6"
msgstr "Jack\nSo... that's what\nthis is."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x3d4"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x3d4"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x3fa"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x3fa"
msgstr "Fran\nYou betrayed us!\nAnd he was your best\nfriend...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x455"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x455"
msgstr "Fran\nAnd to me... he was...\nhe was my...!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x4a0"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x4a0"
msgstr "Fran\nAnd still, why...?!\nWhy did you let him\ndie?!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x4ed"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x4ed"
msgstr "Regina\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x50b"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x50b"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x52c"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x52c"
msgstr "Arth\n...Is that all you have\nto say?"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x566"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x566"
msgstr "Fran\n...What?"

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x58a"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x58a"
msgstr "Arth\nI asked if that's all\nyou have to say."

msgctxt "dialogue/157/0x5c8"
msgid "dialogue/157/0x5c8"
msgstr "Fran\nI'll make you regret\nkilling him!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/158/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/158/0xc"
msgstr "Fran\nWhy?! Why can't I\nbeat him?!\nRemember this!\nArth...!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/159/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...I remember. Even if I\nlived a thousand years,\nI could never forget..."

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0x69"
msgid "dialogue/159/0x69"
msgstr "Regina\nArth?"

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0x8d"
msgid "dialogue/159/0x8d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0xae"
msgid "dialogue/159/0xae"
msgstr "Arth\n...I'm sorry, Prince.\n...Someday... I'll tell\nyou."

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0xf9"
msgid "dialogue/159/0xf9"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/159/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/159/0x11a"
msgstr "Jack\n...Let's go back.\nTo Arcadia..."

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/160/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\n{name} and the others\nfollowed Fran through the\ntransporter in the\nruins?"

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x58"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x58"
msgstr "Blood\nYes, Your Majesty!\nMy deepest apologies."

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x8c"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x8c"
msgstr "Emperor\nWho would have thought the\ntransporter in the ruins\nwould work..."

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0xc4"
msgid "dialogue/160/0xc4"
msgstr "Blood\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0xec"
msgid "dialogue/160/0xec"
msgstr "Emperor\nWell, no matter.\nDestroy the ruins. I have\nno need for two\ntransporters."

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x137"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x137"
msgstr "Blood\n! But what if the\ncastle's transporter\nshould happen to fail...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x184"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x184"
msgstr "Emperor\nYou would have me keep the\ntransporter in the\nruins?"

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x1ae"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x1ae"
msgstr "Emperor\nOne trump card is enough.\nAnd that card is mine."

msgctxt "dialogue/160/0x1f7"
msgid "dialogue/160/0x1f7"
msgstr "Blood\nYes, Your Majesty!"

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/161/0xc"
msgstr "Gale\nA report has arrived\nfrom Fran."

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/161/0x40"
msgstr "Emperor\nHm?"

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0x5a"
msgid "dialogue/161/0x5a"
msgstr "Gale\nShe says she failed to\ncapture the Shield Liger,\nthe Saber Tiger and the\nOrganoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/161/0xbd"
msgstr "Emperor\n...I see. I thought that\nwoman would be of more\nuse..."

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0xfc"
msgid "dialogue/161/0xfc"
msgstr "Emperor\nTell Fran to destroy the\ntransporter in the ruins."

msgctxt "dialogue/161/0x141"
msgid "dialogue/161/0x141"
msgstr "Gale\nYes, Your Majesty!"

msgctxt "dialogue/162/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/162/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\nI shall seal {name} and\nthe others beyond\ntime... Bwahahahaha!"

msgctxt "dialogue/162/0x5e"
msgid "dialogue/162/0x5e"
msgstr "Blood\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/163/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/163/0xc"
msgstr "Fran\nDestroy the transporter?\nAre you serious, Gale?"

msgctxt "dialogue/163/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/163/0x46"
msgstr "Gale\nHis Majesty orders us to\nseal the prince and his\nfriends beyond time."

msgctxt "dialogue/163/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/163/0x91"
msgstr "Fran\n...Ugh! Understood!"

msgctxt "dialogue/163/0xbf"
msgid "dialogue/163/0xbf"
msgstr "Fran\nArth!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/164/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/164/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nHuh! That's strange...\nThe gate is becoming\nunstable."

msgctxt "dialogue/164/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/164/0x5f"
msgstr "{name}\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/164/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/164/0x76"
msgstr "Arth\nIt can't be... Fran!"

msgctxt "dialogue/164/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/164/0xa6"
msgstr "Jack\nLet us hurry, Prince!"

msgctxt "dialogue/165/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/165/0xc"
msgstr "Fran\n...Arth!\nI'll be the one to finish\nyou with my own hands...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/165/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/165/0x57"
msgstr "Fran\nBut if I destroy\nthis device..."

msgctxt "dialogue/165/0x9a"
msgid "dialogue/165/0x9a"
msgstr "Fran\nI'll never get my\nrevenge on you...!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/165/0xe3"
msgid "dialogue/165/0xe3"
msgstr "Fran\nAre you okay with that,\nFran!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/166/0xc"
msgstr "Fran\n! Who's there?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0x2b"
msgid "dialogue/166/0x2b"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nWe are the army of the\nKingdom of Arcadia!\nWe've taken the ruins!"

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0x7d"
msgid "dialogue/166/0x7d"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nStep away from that\ntransporter!"

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/166/0xbd"
msgstr "Fran\n...The Kingdom army.\nThey're here sooner than\nI expected."

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/166/0xe9"
msgstr "Fran\nDid someone hold back\nwhen crushing the Kingdom\narmy...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0x132"
msgid "dialogue/166/0x132"
msgstr "Fran\n...Heh heh heh. Very well.\nWhoever it is, I'll play\nalong."

msgctxt "dialogue/166/0x181"
msgid "dialogue/166/0x181"
msgstr "Fran\nArth! If it lets me finish\nyou, I'll sell my soul to\nthe devil...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/167/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x2e"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat's going on?"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x4f"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nWelcome back, Prince!\nAnd the Three Warriors\ntoo!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0xa2"
msgid "dialogue/167/0xa2"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd you are...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0xc3"
msgid "dialogue/167/0xc3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nWe're the Arcadian army.\nWe escaped the purges in\nall that chaos and have\nfinally regrouped."

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x12a"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x12a"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nWe heard you were headed\nto the ruins and came to\nyour aid, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x189"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x189"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nBut it was a close call.\nAn enemy soldier was about\nto destroy the transporter\nand we stopped them just\nin time..."

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x1fc"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x1fc"
msgstr "Regina\nWait a moment. Then what\nabout these ruins?"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x231"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x231"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nYes, we've taken them."

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x267"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x267"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x27f"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x27f"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nPrince, your orders!"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x2af"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x2af"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x2d0"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x2d0"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince..."

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x2f6"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x2f6"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x31c"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x31c"
msgstr "Regina\n{name}... Chin up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x34b"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x34b"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/167/0x363"
msgid "dialogue/167/0x363"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nLong live Prince\n{name}!"

msgctxt "dialogue/168/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/168/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\nYou failed to destroy the\ntransporter in the ruins?"

msgctxt "dialogue/168/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/168/0x4c"
msgstr "Fran\n...Yes, sir.\nI'm terribly sorry..."

msgctxt "dialogue/168/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/168/0x8b"
msgstr "Emperor\nAnd on top of that, you let\nthe Arcadian survivors\noccupy the ruins...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/168/0xe2"
msgid "dialogue/168/0xe2"
msgstr "Fran\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/168/0x108"
msgid "dialogue/168/0x108"
msgstr "Emperor\nFool!!\nOut of my sight!!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/169/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/169/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\nDamn them all...!\nThey're nothing but\nuseless!"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/170/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\nMy, my, Your Majesty.\nI see you're in a very\ngood mood today..."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x61"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x61"
msgstr "Emperor\nHmph. Is that a jab,\nOpis?"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x91"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh, not at all."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0xc1"
msgid "dialogue/170/0xc1"
msgstr "Opis\nI merely bring news that\nwill improve your mood,\nYour Majesty."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x11a"
msgstr "Emperor\nIs it finished?\nThe Rare Hertz\namplifier?"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x161"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x161"
msgstr "Opis\nIt only needs a combat\ntest."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x191"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x191"
msgstr "Blood\nThen I'll..."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x1b9"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x1b9"
msgstr "Opis\nNonsense! I created it!\nI'll lead the operation!"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x20e"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x20e"
msgstr "Opis\nI'm not handing something\nthis fun over to anyone!"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x24e"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x24e"
msgstr "Blood\nWith all due respect,\nDoctor, tactical command\nis not your specialty."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x299"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x299"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh, what are you\nscheming, Blood?"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x2dd"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x2dd"
msgstr "Blood\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x305"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x305"
msgstr "Emperor\nEnough!\nOpis will lead this\noperation."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x348"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x348"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh, as it should be."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x376"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x376"
msgstr "Emperor\nBlood, Gale, reinforce the\ncastle's defenses in case\nthe Kingdom attacks."

msgctxt "dialogue/170/0x3b6"
msgid "dialogue/170/0x3b6"
msgstr "Blood and Gale\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/171/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/171/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\nWith the Rare Hertz\namplifier, even the\nmightiest Zoid will fall\nin an instant..."

msgctxt "dialogue/171/0x6f"
msgid "dialogue/171/0x6f"
msgstr "Emperor\nI'm counting on you, Opis."

msgctxt "dialogue/171/0x9f"
msgid "dialogue/171/0x9f"
msgstr "Opis\nLeave it to me..."

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/172/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nThe Kingdom army has\nregrouped very quickly..."

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/172/0x54"
msgstr "Gale\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0x7a"
msgid "dialogue/172/0x7a"
msgstr "Blood\nRumor has it..."

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/172/0x9e"
msgstr "Blood\nsomeone deliberately let\nthe Arcadian survivors\nescape."

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0xf9"
msgid "dialogue/172/0xf9"
msgstr "Gale\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/172/0x11f"
msgid "dialogue/172/0x11f"
msgstr "Blood\nDon't you think that's\na betrayal of us?"

msgctxt "dialogue/173/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/173/0xc"
msgstr "Gale\nIt seems you prefer\nconspiracies to battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/173/0x53"
msgid "dialogue/173/0x53"
msgstr "Blood\nTrue. I'd rather stab in\nthe back than be stabbed\nin the back."

msgctxt "dialogue/173/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/173/0xa6"
msgstr "Gale\nI see. Then I'll be sure\nnever to turn my back\non you."

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/174/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\n...! A space-time tremor!\nSomeone used the castle's\ntransporter."

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0x6a"
msgid "dialogue/174/0x6a"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/174/0x8b"
msgstr "Regina\nDo we know to what era?"

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0xb8"
msgid "dialogue/174/0xb8"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nThat we don't know...\nBut if we catch the\ntremor's wave, we can\nfollow them."

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0x111"
msgid "dialogue/174/0x111"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince! Let's go after\nthem right now."

msgctxt "dialogue/174/0x14b"
msgid "dialogue/174/0x14b"
msgstr "Jack\nWait. It costs us nothing\nto prepare our equipment\nproperly first."

msgctxt "dialogue/175/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/175/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\nLooks like the enemy\nburied these underground\nruins as they retreated."

msgctxt "dialogue/176/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/176/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 2\nThe gate is active.\nPlease be careful!"

msgctxt "dialogue/177/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/177/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/177/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/177/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nWhere are we...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/177/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/177/0x57"
msgstr "Jack\n...Who knows.\nLet us explore the\nsurroundings a little."

msgctxt "dialogue/177/0x8e"
msgid "dialogue/177/0x8e"
msgstr "Jack\nIf there's a town, we\nmight be able to gather\ninformation."

msgctxt "dialogue/177/0xd9"
msgid "dialogue/177/0xd9"
msgstr "Regina\nRight... Let's go, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/178/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nWh-what's going on!?\nMy Zoid won't obey me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x72"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x72"
msgstr "Arth\n?! Rare Hertz!"

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x9e"
msgstr "Jack\nRegina!\nActivate the Pulse Guard!"

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/178/0xe9"
msgstr "Regina\nJack, what was that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x117"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x117"
msgstr "Jack\nApparently, this is a\nRare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x160"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x160"
msgstr "Regina\nRare Hertz..."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x18c"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x18c"
msgstr "Jack\nA mysterious frequency\nthat drives Zoids mad."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x1ba"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x1ba"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Pulse Guard holds it\nback to a degree, but\nnot completely."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x20b"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x20b"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's dangerous to venture\ninto this region."

msgctxt "dialogue/178/0x24d"
msgid "dialogue/178/0x24d"
msgstr "Regina\n...You're right.\nLet's find another route,\nPrince."

msgctxt "dialogue/179/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/179/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nPrince! We've entered\nthe Rare Hertz zone.\nIt's dangerous. Let's\nchange course."

msgctxt "dialogue/180/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/180/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhat do you want? I'm\nbusy getting ready to\nflee!"

msgctxt "dialogue/180/0x41"
msgid "dialogue/180/0x41"
msgstr "Villager\nAsk someone else!"

msgctxt "dialogue/181/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/181/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAnd here I thought we'd\nfinally have peace...\nYet another war..."

msgctxt "dialogue/182/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/182/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nPast here, in the desert,\nis Fort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/182/0x3d"
msgid "dialogue/182/0x3d"
msgstr "Villager\nThough if it weren't\nthere, we wouldn't have\nany wars here..."

msgctxt "dialogue/183/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/183/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis desert has become\na Rare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/183/0x3f"
msgid "dialogue/183/0x3f"
msgstr "Villager\nThough a Zoid's own Pulse\nGuard holds it back to a\ndegree..."

msgctxt "dialogue/183/0x8a"
msgid "dialogue/183/0x8a"
msgstr "Villager\nWho knows what's become\nof Fort Kronos, out in\nthe middle of the desert."

msgctxt "dialogue/184/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/184/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWill the Imperial army\ncome back?"

msgctxt "dialogue/185/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/185/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nFlee the town, sure...\nbut where do we go...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/186/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/186/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Republic army?"

msgctxt "dialogue/186/0x1b"
msgid "dialogue/186/0x1b"
msgstr "Villager\nThey should be camped at\nthe Mount Ossa fortress,\nto the south."

msgctxt "dialogue/187/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/187/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nNot even the Imperial\narmy can cross the desert."

msgctxt "dialogue/187/0x37"
msgid "dialogue/187/0x37"
msgstr "Villager\nAll they can do is watch\neach other from outside\nthe Rare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/188/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/188/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nCross the desert?\nIt's not impossible..."

msgctxt "dialogue/188/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/188/0x40"
msgstr "Villager\nThere's a detour. The\nroute through the eastern\nmountains."

msgctxt "dialogue/189/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/189/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhere will we flee to?\nNot the desert, no way.\nIt's a Rare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/189/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/189/0x50"
msgstr "Villager\nSkirting the desert to\nthe east, there's a\ndetour through the\nmountains."

msgctxt "dialogue/189/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/189/0x9b"
msgstr "Villager\nThe path is narrow and\nthe army avoids it: it'd\nbe like begging for an\nambush."

msgctxt "dialogue/189/0xf8"
msgid "dialogue/189/0xf8"
msgstr "Villager\nSo for us, it's a safe\nroute."

msgctxt "dialogue/190/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/190/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/191/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nEnemies!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/191/0x2e"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Imperial army!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/191/0x54"
msgstr "Arth\n...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/191/0x76"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat do you think you're\ndoing!? Attacking us out\nof nowhere!"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0xc1"
msgid "dialogue/191/0xc1"
msgstr "Jack\nSo there's nothing to\ntalk about, eh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/191/0xf5"
msgid "dialogue/191/0xf5"
msgstr "Arth\nThen no holding back.\nLet's go!"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/192/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nWas that the last one?"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x34"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x34"
msgstr "Jack\n...So it seems.\nBut..."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x71"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x71"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat? Is there more?"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0xa3"
msgid "dialogue/192/0xa3"
msgstr "Jack\nThat's not exactly it..."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0xe1"
msgid "dialogue/192/0xe1"
msgstr "Arth\nThey had no tactics."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x105"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x105"
msgstr "Regina\nExplain it properly!"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x137"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x137"
msgstr "Jack\nNow, now. Regina, didn't\nyou notice anything?"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x17e"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x17e"
msgstr "Jack\nWell... something odd,\nfor instance."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x1ae"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x1ae"
msgstr "Regina\nHmm... It's true I didn't\nnotice any strategy or\nanything like that..."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x211"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x211"
msgstr "Jack\nExactly."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x229"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x229"
msgstr "Jack\nA piloted Zoid shows the\nhabits of whoever is\ncontrolling it."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x280"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x280"
msgstr "Jack\nEven more so with a Zoid\nof the Imperial army."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x2a6"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x2a6"
msgstr "Jack\nTheir pilots should be\nwell trained."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x2e5"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x2e5"
msgstr "Jack\nBut there was no sign of\nthat. And the answer is..."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x33a"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x33a"
msgstr "Regina\nZoids without pilots...\nWild Zoids, right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x381"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x381"
msgstr "Arth\nNo. Wild Zoids don't\nusually attack in groups\nlike this."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x3d6"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x3d6"
msgstr "Jack\nIn other words, someone\nwas controlling them..."

msgctxt "dialogue/192/0x413"
msgid "dialogue/192/0x413"
msgstr "Opis\nPrecisely!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/193/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\nPrince {name},\ndear Three Warriors."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x3c"
msgstr "Opis\nHow did you like my army\nof rampaging Zoids?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x8b"
msgstr "Jack\n...Who are you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0xb7"
msgid "dialogue/193/0xb7"
msgstr "Opis\nIn the service of the\nEmperor of the New Empire\nof Arcadia: Opis, one of\nthe Four Kings."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0xfe"
msgid "dialogue/193/0xfe"
msgstr "Opis\nA scientist who studies\nZoids. A pleasure to\nmeet you."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x14c"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x14c"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x16d"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x16d"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat New Empire of\nArcadia!? Don't you\nmock us!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x1ba"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x1ba"
msgstr "Opis\nA young lady yapping like\na puppy, how vulgar.\nShall I modify you\nmyself?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x21f"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x21f"
msgstr "Regina\n!\nWh-what did you say!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x254"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x254"
msgstr "Jack\nRegina! Calm down."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x286"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x286"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh, that's it.\nGet angry and you'll get\nwrinkles."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x2ca"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x2ca"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd what does Dr. Opis\nwant with us?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x30a"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x30a"
msgstr "Opis\nI wanted to show off the\nRare Hertz amplifier I\njust created."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x35f"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x35f"
msgstr "Arth\nRare Hertz amplifier...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x393"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x393"
msgstr "Opis\nThat's right! It amplifies\nnatural Rare Hertz by\nmechanical means and\nmakes Zoids run wild."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x3fc"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x3fc"
msgstr "Opis\nMagnificent!\nThe invention of a\ntrue genius!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x433"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x433"
msgstr "Opis\nDon't you agree, children?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x467"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x467"
msgstr "Jack\n...And what do you want\nsomething like that for?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x49b"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x49b"
msgstr "Opis\nWhy? You ask me WHY!?\nVery well, I'll explain\njust this once, you poor\nignorant fools!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x4f4"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x4f4"
msgstr "Opis\nMy great Rare Hertz\namplifier brings any Zoid\nunder its influence."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x54f"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x54f"
msgstr "Opis\nEven one using a Pulse\nGuard!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x581"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x581"
msgstr "Opis\nThe Zoids run wild and\nescape human control.\nCollecting them afterward\nis a piece of cake."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x5e2"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x5e2"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh. Now do you\nsee how great I am?"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x624"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x624"
msgstr "Opis\nBut sadly, my dear Rare\nHertz amplifier is still\nin the experimental\nstage."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x66f"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x66f"
msgstr "Opis\nIts range is limited.\nBut a genius never stops!\nAnd neeever retreats!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x6cc"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x6cc"
msgstr "Opis\nIn this experiment, I've\ntaken complete control\nof Fort Kronos and its\nsurroundings."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x71f"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x71f"
msgstr "Opis\nI'll expand its range.\nFirst, the Mount Ossa\nfortress! And then,\nNew Helic City!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x77a"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x77a"
msgstr "Opis\nA fine chance for the\nRepublic army to learn\nhow great I am."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x7bd"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x7bd"
msgstr "Opis\nSomeday I'll complete a\ndevice that can control\nthis entire planet."

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x81a"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x81a"
msgstr "Opis\nSudden inspiration,\nconstant research...\nMagnificent! I truly am\na genius! Heh heh heh!"

msgctxt "dialogue/193/0x881"
msgid "dialogue/193/0x881"
msgstr "Opis\nWell then, gentlemen.\nUntil next time!"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/194/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nWait!"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x36"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Mount Ossa fortress...\nThis is bad. It's the\nRepublic's last line of\ndefense."

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x99"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x99"
msgstr "Jack\nThere must be many Zoids\ngathered there. Among\nthem, naturally, the\nRepublic's strongest..."

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0xf8"
msgid "dialogue/194/0xf8"
msgstr "Arth\nDo we follow her?"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x11a"
msgstr "Regina\nOf course! We can't let\nsomeone that dangerous\nrun loose!"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x169"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x169"
msgstr "Regina\n...I'm going to teach her\na lesson she won't forget!"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x1cb"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x1cb"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x1ec"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x1ec"
msgstr "Arth\n...Wouldn't it be better\nif YOU got reprogrammed?"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x233"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x233"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat did you say!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/194/0x25d"
msgid "dialogue/194/0x25d"
msgstr "Jack\nIn any case, let us hurry\nto the Mount Ossa\nfortress!"

msgctxt "dialogue/195/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/195/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nHalt! Halt!!\nWho goes there!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/195/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/195/0x38"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThis is the Mount Ossa\nfortress! Civilians are\nnot allowed in."

msgctxt "dialogue/196/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/196/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nBack! No entry!\nIf you have business here,\ngo to the main entrance,\nto the south."

msgctxt "dialogue/197/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/197/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nDue to an old eruption and\nthe Rare Hertz, there are\nstill many wild Zoids\nunderground here."

msgctxt "dialogue/197/0x74"
msgid "dialogue/197/0x74"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nNo one passes without the\ncommander's permission.\nPlease step back."

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/198/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n....."

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0x22"
msgid "dialogue/198/0x22"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nHalt! Halt!!\nWho goes there!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/198/0x57"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nBeyond here lies the\nMount Ossa fortress!\nCivilians are not\nallowed in."

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0xbc"
msgid "dialogue/198/0xbc"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's an emergency."

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0xec"
msgid "dialogue/198/0xec"
msgstr "Jack\nWe must inform the\ncommander of something."

msgctxt "dialogue/198/0x130"
msgid "dialogue/198/0x130"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nNo, no. Not happening."

msgctxt "dialogue/199/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/199/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nIt seems they won't let us\nthrough empty-handed...\nWe'll have to think of\nsomething."

msgctxt "dialogue/199/0x61"
msgid "dialogue/199/0x61"
msgstr "Arth\nWhat now? Back to the\ntown to rethink the plan?"

msgctxt "dialogue/199/0xac"
msgid "dialogue/199/0xac"
msgstr "Regina\n...Yeah. Insisting here\nwon't get us anywhere."

msgctxt "dialogue/200/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/200/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nOh, this little lass, so\ncute even when she's\nangry... and so soft..."

msgctxt "dialogue/200/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/200/0x5b"
msgstr "Regina\nEek! Wh-wh-what is this!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/201/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n! You're...!?\nThe one who was with Van\nand the others..."

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x57"
msgstr "Regina\nDr. D! What are you doing\nin a place like this?"

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0xa8"
msgid "dialogue/201/0xa8"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIsn't it obvious?\nGetting acquainted."

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0xf5"
msgid "dialogue/201/0xf5"
msgstr "Regina\nThat's not what I meant!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x123"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x123"
msgstr "Arth\nA thief?"

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x140"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x140"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nHow dare you! Calling\nDr. D a thief!"

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x185"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x185"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThis gentleman is an\neminent scientist of our\nRepublic."

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x1d9"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x1d9"
msgstr "Jack\nAh, then please hear us\nout. You see, in the\ndesert out there..."

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x22e"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x22e"
msgstr "Dr. D\nRare Hertz, right? And an\nartificial one at that..."

msgctxt "dialogue/201/0x274"
msgid "dialogue/201/0x274"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/202/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/202/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nSay, pardon me, would you\nlet me see the commander?"

msgctxt "dialogue/202/0x4a"
msgid "dialogue/202/0x4a"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nYes, sir! Go right ahead!"

msgctxt "dialogue/203/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/203/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nCome, come, would you\ntake this poor, helpless\nold man to the command\nroom...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/203/0x78"
msgid "dialogue/203/0x78"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/204/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/204/0xc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nDr. D! You've come at a\ngood time!"

msgctxt "dialogue/204/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/204/0x50"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's about Fort Kronos,\nisn't it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/204/0x82"
msgid "dialogue/204/0x82"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nSo you already knew..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/205/0xc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n! ...And them?\nWho are they?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x4b"
msgstr "Dr. D\nLet's just say they're\nacquaintances of mine."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x86"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x86"
msgstr "Dr. D\nMore importantly, what's\nthe situation?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0xbc"
msgid "dialogue/205/0xbc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nYes. For the past few\nhours, around Fort\nKronos..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0xf3"
msgid "dialogue/205/0xf3"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n...we've detected an\nabnormal amount of\nRare Hertz."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x138"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x138"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nAt the same time, we lost\ncontact with Fort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x187"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x187"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThere also seems to be no\ncontact with the Imperial\nvanguard that was\nattacking Fort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x1e6"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x1e6"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nAccording to intercepted\nImperial transmissions\nand aerial recon..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x23d"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x23d"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n...the bulk of the Imperial\narmy has withdrawn from\nthe desert for now."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x296"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x296"
msgstr "Dr. D\nDid you send troops to\nFort Kronos?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x2d0"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x2d0"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nYes. But the Rare Hertz\nsends the Zoids haywire\nand we can't get close."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x33b"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x33b"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThe Pulse Guard is\nuseless."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x37b"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x37b"
msgstr "Dr. D\nNaturally. This Rare Hertz\nisn't natural."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x3ca"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x3ca"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nYou mean it's man-made!?\nThen, is it a new Imperial\nweapon...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x41d"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x41d"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's not the Empire's.\nIt seems someone these\nfolks know brought it."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x476"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x476"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nWho are these folks...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x4b4"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x4b4"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWho knows."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x4d8"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x4d8"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n...Can they be trusted?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x512"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x512"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWe've no choice but to\ntrust them."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x538"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x538"
msgstr "Dr. D\nFor now, we must deal\nwith the device that's\ngenerating that Rare\nHertz."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x589"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x589"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n...You see, Dr. D. We've\nhad no word from Colonel\nKrueger either..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x5f6"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x5f6"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWhat? Was he at Fort\nKronos?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x630"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x630"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nNo, he was testing the\nGojulas ZG near Fort\nKronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x677"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x677"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThe last thing he told us\nwas that he'd received a\ndistress signal and was\nheading to the fort..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x6e2"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x6e2"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWho else knows?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x718"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x718"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nBesides me, only a few:\nCaptain Herman and his\naide, Lieutenant\nO'Connell."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x777"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x777"
msgstr "Dr. D\nCaptain Herman!?\nRob is here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x7bb"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x7bb"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nHe returned last night\nfrom New Helic City..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x7fe"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x7fe"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nHe came for the Gojulas ZG.\nHe argued with Colonel\nKrueger over who would\npilot it..."

msgctxt "dialogue/205/0x867"
msgid "dialogue/205/0x867"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...Same as always..."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/206/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWhat are you saying, Dr. D?\nThe Gojulas ZG is worthy\nof being piloted by me."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x71"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x71"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHere we go..."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/206/0xa7"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nI asked the old man to\ntake a break,"

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0xea"
msgid "dialogue/206/0xea"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nbut he's a very stubborn\nman..."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x12e"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x12e"
msgstr "Dr. D\nAnyway. Keep Krueger's\ndisappearance secret for\nnow. It would hurt\nmorale."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x197"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x197"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nUnderstood."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x1c3"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x1c3"
msgstr "Dr. D\nI'm asking you to help me\ninvestigate. After all,\nI'm just a poor sick old\nman."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x222"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x222"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x243"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x243"
msgstr "Dr. D\nFor now, we'll figure out\nwhat to do about the\nRare Hertz amplifiers."

msgctxt "dialogue/206/0x2a8"
msgid "dialogue/206/0x2a8"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/207/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nDr. D, so what do we do?"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x48"
msgstr "Dr. D\nListen well. To locate\nthe devices generating\nthe Rare Hertz..."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x93"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x93"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...I've installed a meter\nin your Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0xe2"
msgid "dialogue/207/0xe2"
msgstr "{name}\n......."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x105"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x105"
msgstr "Dr. D\nTo generate Rare Hertz\nthis powerful..."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x146"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x146"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...one device alone won't\nbe enough."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x17a"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x17a"
msgstr "Jack\nSo you mean we should\nsearch around Fort Kronos\nwith the meter to locate\nthe devices?"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x1dd"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x1dd"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThat's it. You sure catch\non quick."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x21e"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x21e"
msgstr "Dr. D\nUnlike some others..."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x252"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x252"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x278"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x278"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x299"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x299"
msgstr "Regina\nL-let's go quickly, then."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x2cf"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x2cf"
msgstr "Jack\nY-yes. And how is it done?"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x30b"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x30b"
msgstr "Dr. D\nBah, it's easy. You go into\nthe Rare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x346"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x346"
msgstr "Dr. D\nAnd you stay there until\nthe device gives the\nall-clear."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x384"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x384"
msgstr "Regina\nIf we go into the Rare\nHertz zone, won't it\naffect us?"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x3cd"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x3cd"
msgstr "Dr. D\nDon't worry. The meter\nhas a powerful Pulse\nGuard built in."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x424"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x424"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou'll be fine until the\nmeasurement is done."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x460"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x460"
msgstr "Arth\nThe rampaging Zoids will\nattack us."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x492"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x492"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou can handle them.\nOr are you scared?"

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x4e7"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x4e7"
msgstr "Arth\n...Hmph. Blasted old man."

msgctxt "dialogue/207/0x519"
msgid "dialogue/207/0x519"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHo ho ho. Go give it\nyour all!"

msgctxt "dialogue/208/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/208/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHo ho ho ho. Go on and\ngive it your all!"

msgctxt "dialogue/209/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/209/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nI wonder if the Gojulas ZG\nthat went to Fort Kronos\nis safe."

msgctxt "dialogue/210/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/210/0xc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nI wonder if Colonel\nKrueger is safe at\nFort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/211/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/211/0xc"
msgstr "Lieutenant O'Connell\n...Trusting a mission to\ncivilians again..."

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/212/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nYour Highness, the Rare\nHertz zone begins here."

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/212/0x4b"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0x6c"
msgid "dialogue/212/0x6c"
msgstr "Regina\n...Your Highness, don't\ntake too many risks."

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0xac"
msgid "dialogue/212/0xac"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's go, then. Keep\nfighting until the\nmeasurement is done."

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0x103"
msgid "dialogue/212/0x103"
msgstr "Arth\nRight."

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0x121"
msgid "dialogue/212/0x121"
msgstr "Regina\nGot it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/212/0x144"
msgid "dialogue/212/0x144"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/213/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/213/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nThat should be enough.\nYour Highness, we're\npulling out. Regina!"

msgctxt "dialogue/213/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/213/0x5f"
msgstr "Regina\nGot it. Let's go,\nYour Highness."

msgctxt "dialogue/213/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/213/0x8b"
msgstr "Regina\nNow Dr. D just has to\nanalyze it and we're done."

msgctxt "dialogue/213/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/213/0xd0"
msgstr "Regina\nYour Highness, let's head\nback to Mount Ossa\nFortress."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/214/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nFine work, fine work indeed."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x3e"
msgstr "Jack\nWell, Doctor, what are\nthe results?"

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x76"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x76"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHmm. It seems there are\nfive Rare Hertz\namplifiers."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0xbf"
msgid "dialogue/214/0xbf"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nFive..."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/214/0xe9"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe main one's at Fort\nKronos; the other four\nare auxiliaries."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x126"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x126"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThey're placed around the\nRare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x166"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x166"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nThen it's simple: we\njust destroy them all\nat once."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x1a3"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x1a3"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nI'll bomb them with the\nPteras and wipe them out\nin one go!"

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x1ee"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x1ee"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's not that simple. The\nRare Hertz will affect you\neven from the air."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x243"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x243"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nDr. D is right, Captain\nHerman. We couldn't bomb\nwith any precision."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x2ac"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x2ac"
msgstr "Jack\nBesides, an air strike\ndraws too much attention.\nThe enemy would be on\nguard."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x301"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x301"
msgstr "Captain Herman\n...Very well. We'll form\nan elite special team\nand approach by land."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x366"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x366"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYes, something like that."

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x39e"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x39e"
msgstr "Regina\nBut, Doctor, what do we\ndo about the Rare Hertz?"

msgctxt "dialogue/214/0x3da"
msgid "dialogue/214/0x3da"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHmm... We'll talk about\nthat in the hangar."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/215/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat an idiot!\nRunning off on his own\nlike that!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x5b"
msgstr "Moonbay\nSure, Irvine, but that\ndoesn't mean you have to\nrun off too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0xb4"
msgid "dialogue/215/0xb4"
msgstr "Moonbay\nBesides, you saw it!\nThat herd of berserk\nZoids!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0xf1"
msgid "dialogue/215/0xf1"
msgstr "Moonbay\nYou'd be wrecked before\nyou ever got to Fort\nKronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x13c"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x13c"
msgstr "Jack\nWhy, it's... Moonbay and\nthe others. What\nhappened?"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x19b"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x19b"
msgstr "Arth\nJust some sour-faced guy\nmaking a fuss."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x1d7"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x1d7"
msgstr "Irvine\nHuh? Look who's talking!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x21b"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x21b"
msgstr "Regina\nArth!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x241"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x241"
msgstr "Regina\nSorry about that. Did\nsomething happen?"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x27d"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x27d"
msgstr "Moonbay\nWell..."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x2a5"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x2a5"
msgstr "Irvine\nThat idiot Van said he'd\ngo take a look at Fort\nKronos and took off."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x30a"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x30a"
msgstr "Moonbay\nAnd Fiona, sweet as ever,\nwent with him. Zeke\nstayed here, though."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x371"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x371"
msgstr "Jack\nIt can't be... Van and\nthe others too...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x3ab"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x3ab"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHo ho ho. That's just\nlike the boy."

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x3dd"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x3dd"
msgstr "Irvine\nOld man!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x403"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x403"
msgstr "Moonbay\nDr. D!"

msgctxt "dialogue/215/0x42b"
msgid "dialogue/215/0x42b"
msgstr "Dr. D\nBut if the kids aren't\nhere, you'll have to\nhandle it yourselves."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/216/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nOut of the question. We\ncan't rely on civilians!"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x59"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x59"
msgstr "Dr. D\nNow, now. It seems this\nenemy is an old\nacquaintance of yours.\nAm I right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0xb7"
msgid "dialogue/216/0xb7"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0xd8"
msgid "dialogue/216/0xd8"
msgstr "Moonbay\nHey, what's all this\nabout?"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x110"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x110"
msgstr "Dr. D\nSince you're here, you\nmay as well listen too."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x140"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x140"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe enemy's amplifier has\nturned Fort Kronos into a\npowerful Rare Hertz zone."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x1a9"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x1a9"
msgstr "Irvine\nRare Hertz amplifier?\nWhat's that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x1eb"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x1eb"
msgstr "Moonbay\nShut up and listen,\nIrvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x223"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x223"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThere are five Rare Hertz\namplifiers in all."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x257"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x257"
msgstr "Dr. D\nAll you have to do is\ndestroy them all."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x295"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x295"
msgstr "Moonbay\nBut nobody can get near\nthem with the Rare Hertz,\nright?"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x2d9"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x2d9"
msgstr "Dr. D\nTrue. That's why I made a\nshield that protects\nagainst that strong\nRare Hertz."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x322"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x322"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's already installed in\nyour Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x366"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x366"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nHold on. I can't leave\nthis in civilian hands.\nI'm going with them."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x3b9"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x3b9"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nCaptain Herman!"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x3e7"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x3e7"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nFort Kronos is a military\nfacility. They could use\na Republic soldier along."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x44c"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x44c"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nTrue... All right, I'll\ngo too. Lieutenant\nO'Connell, sorry, but\nyou're coming as well."

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x4af"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x4af"
msgstr "Lieutenant O'Connell\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x4d7"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x4d7"
msgstr "Jack\n...Doctor?"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x501"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x501"
msgstr "Dr. D\nEveryone doing whatever\nthey please... Fine, do\nas you like!"

msgctxt "dialogue/216/0x54f"
msgid "dialogue/216/0x54f"
msgstr "Herman and the others\njoined the party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/217/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/217/0xc"
msgstr "Lieutenant O'Connell\nRare Hertz amplifier\nlocated!"

msgctxt "dialogue/217/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/217/0x46"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nDestroy it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/218/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/218/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nThat Van! When he gets\nback, I'm gonna give him\nan earful he won't forget."

msgctxt "dialogue/219/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/219/0xc"
msgstr "Moonbay\nWith all this Rare Hertz,\nthere's no way to do\nbusiness!"

msgctxt "dialogue/220/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/220/0xc"
msgstr "Zeke\nKuuuuun!"

msgctxt "dialogue/221/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/221/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nInside the fort the Rare\nHertz is too strong, and\nthe shield doesn't work."

msgctxt "dialogue/221/0x55"
msgid "dialogue/221/0x55"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's dangerous!\nLet's fall back!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/222/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/222/0xc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThis is Fort Kronos,\nbut..."

msgctxt "dialogue/222/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/222/0x46"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nAround the fort the Rare\nHertz is too strong. The\nshield won't hold."

msgctxt "dialogue/222/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/222/0x9b"
msgstr "Jack\nWe'll have to destroy the\nauxiliary devices around\nit first, won't we?"

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/223/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWe've finally made it\nthis far."

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/223/0x48"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThis far, yes. But now\ncomes the main Rare Hertz\namplifier."

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0x9d"
msgid "dialogue/223/0x9d"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThe enemy will be well\nprepared..."

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0xe6"
msgid "dialogue/223/0xe6"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nOtherwise it'd be no fun."

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0x12a"
msgid "dialogue/223/0x12a"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nYou never change, huh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/223/0x15e"
msgid "dialogue/223/0x15e"
msgstr "Lieutenant O'Connell\nFirst, let's search this\narea."

msgctxt "dialogue/224/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/224/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/224/0x25"
msgid "dialogue/224/0x25"
msgstr "Arth\n! Who goes there?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/224/0x42"
msgid "dialogue/224/0x42"
msgstr "Van\nWhoa, wait, wait!\nIt's me, me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/225/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nI don't know anyone\nnamed \"Me.\""

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x4e"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x4e"
msgstr "Van\nYou're doing that on\npurpose! You're as\nannoying as Irvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0xa5"
msgid "dialogue/225/0xa5"
msgstr "Fiona\nHee hee, Van's flustered."

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0xd7"
msgid "dialogue/225/0xd7"
msgstr "Van\nQuiet! I'm not flustered.\nI just got startled!"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x124"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x124"
msgstr "Jack\nVan. You're all right,\nI see."

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x156"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x156"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nAlways giving us a scare,\nyou brat."

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x18a"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x18a"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nBy the way, you haven't\nseen Colonel Krueger,\nhave you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x1d0"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x1d0"
msgstr "Van\nColonel Krueger?\nIs that the old man,\nFiona?"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x21b"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x21b"
msgstr "Fiona\nThe old man is Colonel\nKrueger?"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x255"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x255"
msgstr "Van\nThat's what I'm asking\nyou, Fiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x291"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x291"
msgstr "Fiona\nOh, really? I don't know."

msgctxt "dialogue/225/0x2c1"
msgid "dialogue/225/0x2c1"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nEnough nonsense!\nWhere's that old man?"

msgctxt "dialogue/226/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/226/0xc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWho'd have thought a\ngreen little brat would\ncall me an old man."

msgctxt "dialogue/226/0x63"
msgid "dialogue/226/0x63"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nColonel Krueger!\nYou're all right!"

msgctxt "dialogue/226/0x9f"
msgid "dialogue/226/0x9f"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nYes, more or less."

msgctxt "dialogue/226/0xc3"
msgid "dialogue/226/0xc3"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWell, this is no place\nto stand and talk.\nCome with me."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/227/0xc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBy the way, who are\nthese people?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x4a"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x4a"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nAcquaintances of Dr. D,\nit seems."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x7e"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x7e"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nWe've tasked them with\ndestroying the Rare Hertz\namplifiers."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/227/0xd0"
msgstr "Van\nRare Hertz amplifiers?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0xfc"
msgid "dialogue/227/0xfc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nI see. So that's what's\ndriving them berserk."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x147"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x147"
msgstr "Fiona\nWhat's that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x16d"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x16d"
msgstr "Jack\nA device that artificially\namplifies Rare Hertz and\ndrives Zoids berserk."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x1c0"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x1c0"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's the work of that\nwoman's cronies."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x1fe"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x1fe"
msgstr "Van\nDammit! Those guys\nagain?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x234"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x234"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nAnd they say the main\nRare Hertz amplifier is\nhere in Fort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x299"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x299"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\n...Hmm. It must be the\nunderground hangar."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x2d5"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x2d5"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nThe underground hangar?\nAre you sure, sir?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x317"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x317"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nIt was packed with\nberserk Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x353"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x353"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nI don't know if they have\na will of their own, but\nit must be very important."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x3bc"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x3bc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nI see..."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x3ea"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x3ea"
msgstr "Jack\nLooks like we'll have to\ncheck it out."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x422"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x422"
msgstr "Arth\nRight."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x440"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x440"
msgstr "Regina\nLooks that way...,\nYour Highness?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x471"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x471"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x492"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x492"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nCaptain Herman, I leave\nthings here to you."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x4ce"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x4ce"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nColonel, leave it to me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x508"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x508"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nNow that I know what's\ngoing on, I can't sit\nstill. What Zoid pilot\nwouldn't save the Zoids?"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x577"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x577"
msgstr "Van\nWell said, old man!\nI'm going too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x5ba"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x5ba"
msgstr "Captain Herman\n...When it comes to not\nlistening to reason, the\ncolonel beats me by far."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x609"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x609"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nUnderstood. We'll focus\non defending the fort."

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x650"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x650"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nSorry...\nLet's go, kids!"

msgctxt "dialogue/227/0x686"
msgid "dialogue/227/0x686"
msgstr "Van and Krueger joined\nthe party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/228/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/228/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nLook after Colonel\nKrueger. He's very\nimportant to the\nRepublic..."

msgctxt "dialogue/229/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/229/0xc"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\n...Superiors and\nsubordinates alike, all\ndoing their own thing..."

msgctxt "dialogue/230/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/230/0xc"
msgstr "Lieutenant O'Connell\nGood luck. With your\nskills, I'm sure you'll\npull it off!"

msgctxt "dialogue/231/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/231/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/231/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/231/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nSo this is the main\namplifier."

msgctxt "dialogue/231/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/231/0x5f"
msgstr "Van\nBecause of this piece of\njunk, the Zoids...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/231/0x95"
msgid "dialogue/231/0x95"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBut this is where it ends!"

msgctxt "dialogue/232/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/232/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/232/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/232/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nIt can't be!\nWhat's going on?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/232/0x5f"
msgid "dialogue/232/0x5f"
msgstr "Jack\nI don't know!"

msgctxt "dialogue/232/0x89"
msgid "dialogue/232/0x89"
msgstr "Arth\nBad news. They're going\nto surround us."

msgctxt "dialogue/232/0xb5"
msgid "dialogue/232/0xb5"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's head back up for\nnow!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/233/0xc"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWhat's the meaning of\nthis?! The rampage\nhasn't stopped!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x54"
msgstr "Jack\nI don't know. We destroyed\nthe Rare Hertz amplifier,\nbut..."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0xa9"
msgid "dialogue/233/0xa9"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWell, the rampage goes on!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/233/0xe9"
msgstr "Arth\nNo idea."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x109"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x109"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWhat did you say?!\nWhy, you...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x13b"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x13b"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThat's enough, Captain\nHerman!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x177"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x177"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nI see...\nIt seems the enemy has\ntricked us..."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x1c8"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x1c8"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat do you mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x1f4"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x1f4"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x215"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x215"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThat the Rare Hertz\namplifier isn't only for\ndriving Zoids berserk."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x27e"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x27e"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nWhat do you mean,\nColonel Krueger?"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x2c4"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x2c4"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThat I don't know.\nFiguring it out is\nDr. D's job."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x31d"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x31d"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThe sensible thing is to\nreturn to Mount Ossa\nFortress."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x367"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x367"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nUnderstood."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x387"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x387"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nColonel Krueger, please\nreturn to Mount Ossa\nFortress with them."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x3da"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x3da"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nCaptain Herman,\nLieutenant O'Connell and\nI will stay at Fort\nKronos"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x423"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x423"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nand keep monitoring the\nsituation."

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x461"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x461"
msgstr "Captain Herman\n! But...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x48d"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x48d"
msgstr "Lt. Colonel Ford\nThat's an order, Captain\nHerman!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x4c9"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x4c9"
msgstr "Captain Herman\nTch! Understood!"

msgctxt "dialogue/233/0x4fd"
msgid "dialogue/233/0x4fd"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nI'm counting on you.\nNow, let's go."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nSo the rampage didn't\nstop..."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x46"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat does this mean,\nDoctor?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x84"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x84"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe enemy is cunning. The\nRare Hertz amplifier's\nreal aim isn't the\nrampage."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xe5"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xe5"
msgstr "Irvine\nHuh? What do you mean,\ngramps?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x123"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x123"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou don't get it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x14d"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x14d"
msgstr "Irvine\nHow am I supposed to get\nit?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x17f"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x17f"
msgstr "Dr. D\nAs immature as ever.\nVery well, I'll explain."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x1ce"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x1ce"
msgstr "Irvine\nDamn old fossil..."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x1fe"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x1fe"
msgstr "Moonbay\nIrvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x226"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x226"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe purpose of the Rare\nHertz amplifier is to\nbrainwash the Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x27f"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x27f"
msgstr "Regina\n! Brainwash them?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x2a7"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x2a7"
msgstr "Dr. D\nExactly. A Zoid isn't a\nmere weapon. It's a\nliving being with a will\nof its own."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x2f6"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x2f6"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThat's why it responds to\nits pilot's will."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x335"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x335"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou must have felt it\nyourselves at some point."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x375"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x375"
msgstr "Irvine\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x39f"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x39f"
msgstr "Dr. D\nDriving them berserk with\nRare Hertz wipes out that\nwill."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x3ea"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x3ea"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThey're probably imposing\na new will on them so\nthey'll obey orders."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x449"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x449"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThen, the way to stop the\nrampage..."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x489"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x489"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...Sadly, there isn't one."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x4b9"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x4b9"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWithout the Rare Hertz,\nthe Imperial army may use\nthis chaos to invade us\nagain."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x52a"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x52a"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBut we can't leave the\nberserk Zoids like this."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x569"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x569"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nTactically, they're far\ntoo dangerous an unknown."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x59d"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x59d"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nNot knowing whose side\nthe berserk Zoids will\ntake, we'll have to\neliminate them now..."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x60a"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x60a"
msgstr "Dr. D\nEven by force?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x642"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x642"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBetter that than letting\nthe patient die."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x682"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x682"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...Very well."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x6a2"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x6a2"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWe'll make the magma from\nMount Ossa's volcano flow\ntoward Fort Kronos."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x6eb"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x6eb"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's a shame, but that\nway we'll finish them all\nin one blow."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x731"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x731"
msgstr "Jack\nBut how are we going to\nchannel the magma there?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x77a"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x77a"
msgstr "Dr. D\nMount Ossa's volcano is\nstill very active."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x7bb"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x7bb"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIf we open a hole at the\npoint facing Fort Kronos,\nthe magma will all pour\nout that way."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x818"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x818"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt's far easier than\nmaking it snow."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x858"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x858"
msgstr "Regina\nDoctor, you make it sound\neasy, but how do we open\nthe hole?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x8a1"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x8a1"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIf memory serves, there\nwas a rock-boring laser\ncannon around here\nsomewhere, wasn't there?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x905"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x905"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThere's no getting past\nyou. Yes, it should be\nsomewhere in the fort's\nexpansion area."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x95e"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x95e"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThough after the recent\neruption and the berserk\nZoids, who knows what\nshape it's in."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0x9c5"
msgid "dialogue/234/0x9c5"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThat's all I need to know.\nThe rest is up to you."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xa11"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xa11"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xa32"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xa32"
msgstr "Jack\nUnderstood. Let's go\nretrieve it right away."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xa77"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xa77"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nHold on. You, boy, go\nwith them in my place."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xad2"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xad2"
msgstr "Irvine\nHey, wait!\nYou're not going?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xb15"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xb15"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWithout the Rare Hertz,\nthe Imperial army may\ncome."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xb64"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xb64"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nA good commander wouldn't\nlet this chance slip by."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xba7"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xba7"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nI can't leave this place."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xbe3"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xbe3"
msgstr "Irvine\nTch! And why me?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xc1f"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xc1f"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWho knows? Not even I\ndo..."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xc55"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xc55"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBut what do you say?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xc7b"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xc7b"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nDr. D has finished the\nweapon you used that\ntime."

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xccc"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xccc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nHow about trying it out\nagain?"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xd1a"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xd1a"
msgstr "Irvine\nHeh, challenge accepted!\nOld man, I'm borrowing\nit!"

msgctxt "dialogue/234/0xd70"
msgid "dialogue/234/0xd70"
msgstr "Irvine joined the party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/236/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/236/0xc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nThe rest is in your\nhands!"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/237/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x2d"
msgstr "Jack\nSo this is the rock-boring\nlaser cannon..."

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x71"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x71"
msgstr "Regina\nWith this, you could\nbore a hole even through\na volcano."

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0xb3"
msgid "dialogue/237/0xb3"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHave you recovered the\nlaser cannon?"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/237/0xe9"
msgstr "Jack\nYes, we just did."

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x115"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x115"
msgstr "Dr. D\nGood. The berserk Zoids\nare heading for the crater\nof Mount Ossa's volcano."

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x172"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x172"
msgstr "Arth\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x18e"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x18e"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat did you say?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x1ba"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x1ba"
msgstr "Dr. D\nIt seems someone is\ncontrolling them, as I\nthought. Hurry!"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x209"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x209"
msgstr "Jack\nYour Highness. Surely\nOpis is also..."

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x244"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x244"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/237/0x265"
msgid "dialogue/237/0x265"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's hurry, Your Highness."

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/238/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nGood work."

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/238/0x38"
msgstr "Jack\nHow are the berserk\nZoids?"

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0x68"
msgid "dialogue/238/0x68"
msgstr "Dr. D\nSame as before.\nHeading straight for the\ncrater."

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0xa9"
msgid "dialogue/238/0xa9"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou lot get to the\ncrater as soon as you can."

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0xe2"
msgid "dialogue/238/0xe2"
msgstr "Dr. D\nI'll tell you where to\ndrill."

msgctxt "dialogue/238/0x123"
msgid "dialogue/238/0x123"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/239/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh, how annoying\nto have a great scientific\nexperiment interrupted..."

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x60"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x60"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x81"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x81"
msgstr "Regina\nOpis!"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/239/0xa7"
msgstr "Opis\nCan't you see the\ngrandeur of this Rare\nHertz amplifier?"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0xf4"
msgid "dialogue/239/0xf4"
msgstr "Opis\nHow pitiful..."

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x126"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x126"
msgstr "Regina\nDon't talk nonsense!"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x15c"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x15c"
msgstr "Opis\nNonsense?! You're the\nfools here!"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x18e"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x18e"
msgstr "Opis\nI won't let you stand\nin my way!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x1c8"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x1c8"
msgstr "Arth\nAnd what do you plan to\ndo?"

msgctxt "dialogue/239/0x1fe"
msgid "dialogue/239/0x1fe"
msgstr "Opis\nFinish you off. With my\nown hands!\nHeh heh heh, ha ha ha!"

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/240/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nVan, Irvine,\nlet's split up."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x4b"
msgstr "Jack\nYou two go to the crater."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x89"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x89"
msgstr "Irvine\nWhat are you saying? I'm\nnot just gonna say \"okay\"\nlike that."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0xe2"
msgid "dialogue/240/0xe2"
msgstr "Van\nYeah! We're fighting too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x11a"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x11a"
msgstr "Jack\nNo. Right now the berserk\nZoids are heading for the\ncrater."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x161"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x161"
msgstr "Jack\nLeave this to us and\nhurry to the crater."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x1a8"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x1a8"
msgstr "Irvine\n......Understood.\nWe'll leave it to you."

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x1ed"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x1ed"
msgstr "Van\nIrvine!"

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x211"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x211"
msgstr "Irvine\nVan, don't dawdle!\nAnd don't forget the\ndrilling laser!"

msgctxt "dialogue/240/0x262"
msgid "dialogue/240/0x262"
msgstr "Van\nUh, y-yeah, leave it to\nme!"

msgctxt "dialogue/241/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/241/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\n! Hey, you! I'm not\ndone talking yet!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/241/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/241/0x5b"
msgstr "Jack\nIf you want to talk,\nwe'll listen."

msgctxt "dialogue/241/0x95"
msgid "dialogue/241/0x95"
msgstr "Opis\nSuch insolence..."

msgctxt "dialogue/241/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/241/0xbd"
msgstr "Opis\nI'll show you that great\nscience always triumphs\nin the end!\nHeh heh heh heh!"

msgctxt "dialogue/242/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/242/0xc"
msgstr "Opis\nImpossible! Great science,\nme, with my prodigious\nbrain...!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/242/0x61"
msgid "dialogue/242/0x61"
msgstr "Regina\n{name} won't lose to\nsome evil scientist!"

msgctxt "dialogue/242/0xa9"
msgid "dialogue/242/0xa9"
msgstr "Jack\nYou've lost, Dr. Opis.\nWon't you withdraw?"

msgctxt "dialogue/242/0x102"
msgid "dialogue/242/0x102"
msgstr "Opis\n........."

msgctxt "dialogue/242/0x130"
msgid "dialogue/242/0x130"
msgstr "Opis\nHeh heh heh... You'll\nregret that softness!"

msgctxt "dialogue/243/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/243/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n...I'm sorry, Your\nHighness. I acted on my\nown..."

msgctxt "dialogue/243/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/243/0x54"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/243/0x75"
msgid "dialogue/243/0x75"
msgstr "Arth\nDon't worry about it."

msgctxt "dialogue/243/0x99"
msgid "dialogue/243/0x99"
msgstr "Regina\n......Jack, you're such\na softie."

msgctxt "dialogue/243/0xd5"
msgid "dialogue/243/0xd5"
msgstr "Regina\nBy the way, I wonder what\nhappened to Van and the\nothers..."

msgctxt "dialogue/244/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/244/0xc"
msgstr "Irvine\nLooks like it's this way..."

msgctxt "dialogue/244/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/244/0x46"
msgstr "Van\nAll right, I'm gonna give\nit one big blast!"

msgctxt "dialogue/244/0x80"
msgid "dialogue/244/0x80"
msgstr "Irvine\nCareful, that laser isn't\nlike a weapon: it can only\nbe used once.\nDon't miss!"

msgctxt "dialogue/244/0xe2"
msgid "dialogue/244/0xe2"
msgstr "Van\nI know!"

msgctxt "dialogue/245/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/245/0xc"
msgstr "Van\nCome on, let's get out of\nhere!"

msgctxt "dialogue/245/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/245/0x3c"
msgstr "Irvine\nI don't want to burn to\ndeath in a place like\nthis!"

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/246/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\n...It seems the eruption\nhas died down."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0x51"
msgid "dialogue/246/0x51"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nBut using Rare Hertz as\na weapon... It's\nastonishing."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0xa8"
msgid "dialogue/246/0xa8"
msgstr "Dr. D\nBut it won't work twice."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0xd0"
msgid "dialogue/246/0xd0"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWe just need to mass-\nproduce shields against\nthe Rare Hertz."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0x11d"
msgid "dialogue/246/0x11d"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThough the Empire will\nsurely take measures too."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0x164"
msgid "dialogue/246/0x164"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\n...Surely."

msgctxt "dialogue/246/0x194"
msgid "dialogue/246/0x194"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYou did a great job too."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/247/0xc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nAllow me to thank you as\nwell."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/247/0x4c"
msgstr "Regina\nIt's nothing. This is\nour business too."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/247/0x91"
msgstr "Dr. D\nHo ho ho. Will you tell\nme the reason someday?"

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0xdb"
msgid "dialogue/247/0xdb"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0xfc"
msgid "dialogue/247/0xfc"
msgstr "Regina\nThat's..."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0x124"
msgid "dialogue/247/0x124"
msgstr "Dr. D\nWell, don't worry.\nYou'll tell me eventually."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0x166"
msgid "dialogue/247/0x166"
msgstr "Jack\nI'm sorry, Doctor. We'll\ntell you someday."

msgctxt "dialogue/247/0x1a4"
msgid "dialogue/247/0x1a4"
msgstr "Dr. D\nYes, I look forward to it.\nUntil next time."

msgctxt "dialogue/248/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/248/0xc"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\nWho are they?"

msgctxt "dialogue/248/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/248/0x3c"
msgstr "Dr. D\nAcquaintances of mine.\nWell, now they're yours\ntoo."

msgctxt "dialogue/248/0x99"
msgid "dialogue/248/0x99"
msgstr "Colonel Krueger\n...I see. We'll leave it\nat that, then."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/249/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\nFor all Opis's bragging...\nWhat a pitiful showing."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x57"
msgstr "Blood\nYes, sir! But couldn't we\nmake use of the Rare\nHertz amplifier?"

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/249/0xa6"
msgstr "Emperor\nIt's nothing but a weapon\nof surprise. Once they're\nshielded from the Rare\nHertz, it's useless."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x105"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x105"
msgstr "Blood\nIndeed... My apologies."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x13d"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x13d"
msgstr "Emperor\nSpare me the flattery.\nYou knew that already."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x186"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x186"
msgstr "Blood\n...Yes, sir."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x1ac"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x1ac"
msgstr "Emperor\nBy the way, how goes the\ncastle's defense?"

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x1e8"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x1e8"
msgstr "Blood\nYes, sir! We've\nreinforced the defenses\nacross the grounds."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x229"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x229"
msgstr "Blood\nEven if the Kingdom's\narmy attacks, the castle\ntroops will be enough to\nrepel it."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x284"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x284"
msgstr "Emperor\nGood, I trust you.\nYou may go."

msgctxt "dialogue/249/0x2be"
msgid "dialogue/249/0x2be"
msgstr "Blood\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/250/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/250/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\n{name}, you pesky fly...\nI won't tolerate your\ninterference..."

msgctxt "dialogue/250/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/250/0x48"
msgstr "Emperor\nGale! Summon Gale!"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nWelcome back, Your\nHighness!"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x35"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x35"
msgstr "Jack\nDid anything happen?"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x5c"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x5c"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nIt seems the enemy is\nreinforcing the defense\nof Arcadia Castle, but\nother than that, nothing."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0xb5"
msgid "dialogue/251/0xb5"
msgstr "Arth\nReinforcing the defense?"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0xe1"
msgid "dialogue/251/0xe1"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat could it mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x10b"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x10b"
msgstr "Jack\n...I don't know. But we'd\nbetter be cautious."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x154"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x154"
msgstr "Jack\nPlease keep watching\nArcadia Castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x194"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x194"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier\nUnderstood!"

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x1c0"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x1c0"
msgstr "Arth\nHowever the enemy\ncomes..."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x1f8"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x1f8"
msgstr "Jack\n...all we can do is face\nthem, of course."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x232"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x232"
msgstr "Regina\nYeah. Hang in there,\nYour Highness."

msgctxt "dialogue/251/0x26b"
msgid "dialogue/251/0x26b"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/252/0xc"
msgstr "Gale\n...You summoned me,\nYour Majesty?"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x3e"
msgstr "Emperor\nYes. Have you heard about\nOpis?"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x77"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x77"
msgstr "Gale\nI hear that Prince\n{name} destroyed the\nRare Hertz amplifier."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0xcd"
msgid "dialogue/252/0xcd"
msgstr "Emperor\nHe's no prince!\nI'm the one who rules\nthis country now!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x114"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x114"
msgstr "Gale\n...As you command."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x138"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x138"
msgstr "Emperor\nA plan! Give me a plan!\nLend me your wits as a\nformer Republic officer!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x193"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x193"
msgstr "Gale\nWe lack the troops for a\nterritory the size of the\nKingdom of Arcadia."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x1d8"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x1d8"
msgstr "Gale\nFortify Arcadia Castle,\nslow the enemy with a\nmobile defense, and hold\nout-"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x231"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x231"
msgstr "Emperor\nAbsolutely not!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x245"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x245"
msgstr "Emperor\nIf we let {name} run\nloose, it'll only\nembolden the Kingdom's\narmy!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x281"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x281"
msgstr "Emperor\nIf we lack troops, then\nquality must make up\nfor it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x2ad"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x2ad"
msgstr "Emperor\nYes, quality! Research\nthe Empire's Zoids from\nthe final stage of the\nwar!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x2f0"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x2f0"
msgstr "Emperor\nWith that data, we'll\nstrengthen our army's\nZoids!"

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x32b"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x32b"
msgstr "Emperor\nGale! Travel through\ntime and research the\nEmpire's Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x364"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x364"
msgstr "Emperor\n{name} will likely\npursue you, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x3a4"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x3a4"
msgstr "Gale\n{name} and his allies...\nI'll crush them, you'll\nsee."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x3ee"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x3ee"
msgstr "Emperor\nThat's reassuring.\nI trust you, Gale."

msgctxt "dialogue/252/0x424"
msgid "dialogue/252/0x424"
msgstr "Gale\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/253/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/253/0xc"
msgstr "Emperor\nI'll put your loyalty to\nthe test... Gale."

msgctxt "dialogue/254/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/254/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\n...! A space-time tremor!\nSomeone used the castle's\nspace-time transporter."

msgctxt "dialogue/254/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/254/0x54"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 2\nWhat?! Again!\nTell the prince and the\nothers right away!"

msgctxt "dialogue/254/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/254/0x8b"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/254/0xa3"
msgid "dialogue/254/0xa3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 2\nDamn them... What are\nthey plotting this time?"

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/255/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nYour Highness, a\nspace-time tremor has\nbeen detected."

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0x49"
msgid "dialogue/255/0x49"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0x6a"
msgid "dialogue/255/0x6a"
msgstr "Regina\nAgain?! Where to this\ntime?"

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0x9e"
msgid "dialogue/255/0x9e"
msgstr "Arth\nNo idea."

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0xc0"
msgid "dialogue/255/0xc0"
msgstr "Jack\nBut we can't ignore it."

msgctxt "dialogue/255/0xee"
msgid "dialogue/255/0xee"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's follow them as soon\nas we're ready!"

msgctxt "dialogue/256/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/256/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\nThe gate is active.\nBe careful!"

msgctxt "dialogue/257/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/257/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 2\nPlease defeat the enemy,\nno matter what!"

msgctxt "dialogue/258/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/258/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/258/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/258/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\n...Where are we?"

msgctxt "dialogue/258/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/258/0x57"
msgstr "Jack\nI don't know. Let's\nexplore the area a bit."

msgctxt "dialogue/259/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/259/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/259/0x28"
msgid "dialogue/259/0x28"
msgstr "Regina\nAn explosion?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/259/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/259/0x4c"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's go see!"

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/260/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/260/0x2d"
msgstr "Jack\n...What is this...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0x5b"
msgid "dialogue/260/0x5b"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0x81"
msgid "dialogue/260/0x81"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat on earth happened\nhere?"

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0xb5"
msgid "dialogue/260/0xb5"
msgstr "Jack\nI don't know."

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0xd1"
msgid "dialogue/260/0xd1"
msgstr "Jack\nBut there may be\nsurvivors."

msgctxt "dialogue/260/0x10d"
msgid "dialogue/260/0x10d"
msgstr "Regina\n...You're right.\nCome on, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/261/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/261/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\n...! Who's there?"

msgctxt "dialogue/261/0x30"
msgid "dialogue/261/0x30"
msgstr "Regina\nAn enemy!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/262/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nHalt!"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x34"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x34"
msgstr "Arth\nWho are you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x54"
msgstr "Jack\nSurrender without a\nfight, and we won't\nharm you."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x9b"
msgstr "Gale\n...So you won't harm me...\nYou haven't changed,\nJack."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0xec"
msgid "dialogue/262/0xec"
msgstr "Jack\n...!! Y-you're...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x124"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x124"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x14a"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x14a"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x16c"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x16c"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x18d"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x18d"
msgstr "Jack\nInstructor Gale! Wh-what\nare you doing here? Don't\ntell me this was you!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x1dc"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x1dc"
msgstr "Gale\nAnd if it was?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x20a"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x20a"
msgstr "Jack\nI-it can't be..."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x236"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x236"
msgstr "Gale\nYou won't harm me?\nHmph. How naive, Jack."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x277"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x277"
msgstr "Jack\n...Instructor Gale."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x2a3"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x2a3"
msgstr "Gale\nI taught you this.\nRepublic Combat\nRegulations, Chapter 1."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x2e4"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x2e4"
msgstr "Jack\n...Victory always goes\nto whoever stays one step\nahead of the enemy."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x333"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x333"
msgstr "Gale\nExactly. This is war,\nJack!"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x376"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x376"
msgstr "Jack\nWar... What are you\nfighting for, Instructor!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x3c3"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x3c3"
msgstr "Gale\n...That's none of your\nbusiness."

msgctxt "dialogue/262/0x3ef"
msgid "dialogue/262/0x3ef"
msgstr "Gale\nI won't let anyone\nstand in my way.\nNot even you, Jack."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/263/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x40"
msgstr "Arth\nYou all right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x62"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x62"
msgstr "Jack\nYes, forgive me..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x94"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x94"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, that was my\nfault."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0xc3"
msgid "dialogue/263/0xc3"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/263/0xe4"
msgstr "Arth\nWho was he?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x106"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x106"
msgstr "Regina\nHey, Arth!"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x134"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x134"
msgstr "Jack\nNo, it's all right.\n...Please listen as\nwell, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x17e"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x17e"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x19f"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x19f"
msgstr "Jack\nHis name is Gale. He was\nmy instructor in the\nRepublic when I was a\ncadet..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x1e6"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x1e6"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd when I was assigned\nto a combat unit, he was\nmy superior as well."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x22b"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x22b"
msgstr "Jack\nHe taught me everything\na Republic soldier must\nknow, from piloting Zoids\nto leading operations..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x284"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x284"
msgstr "Jack\nNo, he taught me many\nimportant things as a\nperson, too."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x2cb"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x2cb"
msgstr "Jack\n...This wound on my\narm..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x2f1"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x2f1"
msgstr "Jack\nI got it back when I was\nstill green, and the\nenemy surrounded me..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x338"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x338"
msgstr "Jack\nI was ready to die, and\nit was he who broke\nthrough the enemy lines\nsingle-handedly to save me."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x399"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x399"
msgstr "Regina\n......I see..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x3cc"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x3cc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x3ed"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x3ed"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd yet! Why is he one\nof them!?\nWhy!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x438"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x438"
msgstr "Arth\nThen ask him."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x46a"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x46a"
msgstr "Jack\n...Huh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x490"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x490"
msgstr "Arth\nYou'll run into him\nsooner or later. Why\nnot ask him then?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x4e1"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x4e1"
msgstr "Regina\nArth!"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x505"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x505"
msgstr "Jack\n......You're right.\nPerhaps I will."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x54d"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x54d"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x56e"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x56e"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince... Thank you,\nArth."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x5a9"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x5a9"
msgstr "Arth\nYou owe me one. Don't\nforget it."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x5d3"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x5d3"
msgstr "Jack\nYes, understood."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x602"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x602"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x623"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x623"
msgstr "Regina\n...What's with you guys?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x649"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x649"
msgstr "Regina\nBy the way, that enemy\nfrom before..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x677"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x677"
msgstr "Regina\nAh!"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x699"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x699"
msgstr "Jack\nYou can call him the enemy."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x6c3"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x6c3"
msgstr "Regina\n...That Gale guy, right?\nWhy would he attack\nthis place?"

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x71e"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x71e"
msgstr "Jack\nThat's..."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x73a"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x73a"
msgstr "Jack\nWe have very little\ninformation for now.\nLet's search the base."

msgctxt "dialogue/263/0x78b"
msgid "dialogue/263/0x78b"
msgstr "Regina\n...Okay.\nLet's go."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/264/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nHm! That girl is..."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x3c"
msgstr "Regina\nIsn't that Fiona, the\ngirl who was with that\nVan guy...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x8d"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x8d"
msgstr "Jack\nIt seems so, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0xbd"
msgid "dialogue/264/0xbd"
msgstr "Arth\nShe's grown."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0xe5"
msgid "dialogue/264/0xe5"
msgstr "Regina\nYeah. That means we're\nnot in the same time as\nlast time..."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x144"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x144"
msgstr "Jack\n...So it seems."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x168"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x168"
msgstr "Jack\nListen, about the\nspace-time jump..."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x1a4"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x1a4"
msgstr "Arth\nYeah. I don't want any\nmore trouble."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x1e0"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x1e0"
msgstr "Regina\n...Of course."

msgctxt "dialogue/264/0x209"
msgid "dialogue/264/0x209"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/265/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nHuh? O-oh, you're..."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x42"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x42"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's been a while, Fiona."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x7a"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x7a"
msgstr "Fiona\nIt has. Um...\nJack, right?"

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0xba"
msgid "dialogue/265/0xba"
msgstr "Jack\nYou've grown a lot."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0xf0"
msgid "dialogue/265/0xf0"
msgstr "Fiona\nOf course. It's been\nalmost two years since\nwe last met."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x12e"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x12e"
msgstr "Arth\n...Two years..."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x15a"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x15a"
msgstr "Fiona\nIt's been a while for\nyou too, Arth."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x190"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x190"
msgstr "Arth\nYeah."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x1ae"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x1ae"
msgstr "Fiona\nTee hee. You haven't\nchanged a bit."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x1d4"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x1d4"
msgstr "Fiona\nWhere have you all been\nsince then?"

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x202"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x202"
msgstr "Jack\nAh! Yes, well, you see,\num..."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x242"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x242"
msgstr "Arth\nHere and there."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x262"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x262"
msgstr "Fiona\nHere and there? That must\nbe exhausting."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x298"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x298"
msgstr "Jack\n...No, not really..."

msgctxt "dialogue/265/0x2d2"
msgid "dialogue/265/0x2d2"
msgstr "Fiona\n......Huh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/266/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\n{name} and Regina, you\nhaven't changed at all."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x4e"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x4e"
msgstr "Jack\n!"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x6c"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x6c"
msgstr "Arth\n!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x8a"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x8a"
msgstr "Fiona\n...It's as if time had\nstood still for you\nsince then..."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0xd8"
msgid "dialogue/266/0xd8"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0xf9"
msgid "dialogue/266/0xf9"
msgstr "Regina\nTh-that's not true!"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x11f"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x11f"
msgstr "Regina\nI've grown, and a lot,\neverywhere I needed\nto grow—"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x168"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x168"
msgstr "Arth\nExcept your chest."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x18a"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x18a"
msgstr "Regina\nUgh...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x1b2"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x1b2"
msgstr "Fiona\nTee hee hee.\nYou're the same as ever."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x1ed"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x1ed"
msgstr "Jack\nSorry for the scene.\nSo what brings you here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x236"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x236"
msgstr "Fiona\nWell, you see..."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x254"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x254"
msgstr "Fiona\nLately, the bases along\nthe border have been\nattacked one after\nanother..."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x2bb"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x2bb"
msgstr "Regina\nIt's not just this base?"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x2ef"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x2ef"
msgstr "Fiona\nNo. Lots and lots of\nbases have been hit..."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x321"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x321"
msgstr "Fiona\nI wanted to at least\nfind out who the enemy\nis, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x360"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x360"
msgstr "Fiona\nLooks like I was too\nlate again this time."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x394"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x394"
msgstr "Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x3bc"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x3bc"
msgstr "Jack\n......\nBut why are you mixed\nup in this, Fiona?"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x401"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x401"
msgstr "Fiona\nI help the Guardian\nForce on its missions."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x44e"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x44e"
msgstr "Regina\nThe Guardian Force?"

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x480"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x480"
msgstr "Fiona\nYes. Van and Zeke are\nwith me. And Lieutenant\nSchwarz, too."

msgctxt "dialogue/266/0x4d3"
msgid "dialogue/266/0x4d3"
msgstr "Arth\nI see. The Guardian\nForce. Impressive."

msgctxt "dialogue/267/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/267/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nHee hee. Amazing,\nright?"

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/268/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nHey, Arth, do you even\nknow what the Guardian\nForce is...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x63"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x63"
msgstr "Jack\nNot a chance! He just\nsaid it to say something."

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x9d"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x9d"
msgstr "Fiona\nAnd what are you all\ndoing here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0xcf"
msgid "dialogue/268/0xcf"
msgstr "Arth\nWe're chasing a man.\nWe saw him near here."

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x118"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x118"
msgstr "Fiona\n...Hmm. Could he be with\nthe gang that hit the base?"

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x161"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x161"
msgstr "Arth\nCould be."

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x189"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x189"
msgstr "Fiona\nWhy don't we look for\nhim together? The more,\nthe merrier!"

msgctxt "dialogue/268/0x1ea"
msgid "dialogue/268/0x1ea"
msgstr "Arth\nSure, no problem."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/269/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nHey! Arth!!\nWhat do you mean,\nno problem?"

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x4f"
msgstr "Jack\nNo, Arth may have a\npoint."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x98"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x98"
msgstr "Regina\nJack?"

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0xbe"
msgid "dialogue/269/0xbe"
msgstr "Jack\nShe has more information.\nWe've nothing to lose."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x117"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x117"
msgstr "Regina\n...Fine.\nLet's go together."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x158"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x158"
msgstr "Fiona\nYay!\nNow we can travel\ntogether again."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x19b"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x19b"
msgstr "Fiona\nThe next target is probably\nBego Base, to the west.\nLet's hurry!"

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x1f4"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x1f4"
msgstr "Fiona\nIt might already have\nbeen attacked."

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x233"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x233"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x254"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x254"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat!! Why didn't you\nsay so sooner!?\nCome on, hurry!"

msgctxt "dialogue/269/0x29a"
msgid "dialogue/269/0x29a"
msgstr "Fiona joined\nthe party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/270/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x2d"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's awfully quiet\nhere..."

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x61"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x61"
msgstr "Regina\nHas it already been\nattacked?"

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x8b"
msgstr "Jack\n...Who knows. It could\nbe the enemy.\nLet's proceed carefully—"

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0xdc"
msgid "dialogue/270/0xdc"
msgstr "Arth\nThat won't work."

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x10a"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x10a"
msgstr "Regina\n?\n...Hey, where's Fiona?"

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x145"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x145"
msgstr "Arth\nShe said she'd go into\nthe base alone and left."

msgctxt "dialogue/270/0x185"
msgid "dialogue/270/0x185"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd you just let her!?\nYou should've stopped her!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/271/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x2e"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat? Enemies!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x56"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x56"
msgstr "Arth\nWe're surrounded."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x82"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x82"
msgstr "Jack\n......I didn't even sense\nthe enemy... What am I\ndoing!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0xe9"
msgid "dialogue/271/0xe9"
msgstr "Arth\nBeat yourself up later."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x113"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x113"
msgstr "Regina\nRight. Right now we have\nto get out of this\nsomehow."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x155"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x155"
msgstr "Jack\n...You're right.\nHow do things look?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x18b"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x18b"
msgstr "Arth\nBad. They don't have a\nsingle weak spot. They're\nwell trained."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x1c8"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x1c8"
msgstr "Arth\nNo wonder. They're the\nEmpire's First Armored\nDivision."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x208"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x208"
msgstr "Regina\nThe First Armored\nDivision?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x232"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x232"
msgstr "Arth\nYeah. That banner leaves\nno room for doubt."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x26a"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x26a"
msgstr "Jack\nThe Empire... Then, are\nthey connected to the\nattackers—?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x2b3"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x2b3"
msgstr "Schwarz\nThis is the Empire's First\nArmored Division. I am\nits commander, Colonel\nSchwarz."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x2fa"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x2fa"
msgstr "Schwarz\nOffer no pointless\nresistance, and lay\ndown your arms."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x33b"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x33b"
msgstr "Schwarz\nYou are completely\nsurrounded."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x367"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x367"
msgstr "Schwarz\nI repeat: offer no\npointless resistance,\nand lay down your arms."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x3b6"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x3b6"
msgstr "Regina\nHow gentlemanly. Nothing\nlike a certain someone\nI know."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x3f2"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x3f2"
msgstr "Arth\nWith a modest lady, I'd\nbe a gentleman too."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x437"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x437"
msgstr "Regina\n...And what's that\nsupposed to mean...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x46d"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x46d"
msgstr "Jack\nArth, and you too,\nRegina, this is no time\nfor this."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x4bf"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x4bf"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x4e0"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x4e0"
msgstr "Jack\n? What is it, Prince?\nFiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x527"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x527"
msgstr "Fiona\nColonel! Colonel\nSchwarz!"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x55b"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x55b"
msgstr "Regina\nYou know each other?"

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x581"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x581"
msgstr "Jack\n...So it seems."

msgctxt "dialogue/271/0x5b9"
msgid "dialogue/271/0x5b9"
msgstr "Arth\nLooks like we're saved."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/272/0xc"
msgstr "Schwarz\nFiona has told me\neverything."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x34"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x34"
msgstr "Schwarz\nForgive me for being so\nbrusque."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x7d"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x7d"
msgstr "Jack\nNot at all, Colonel.\nYour maneuver was\nadmirable."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0xc6"
msgid "dialogue/272/0xc6"
msgstr "Schwarz\nHa ha ha. You're too kind."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0xf8"
msgid "dialogue/272/0xf8"
msgstr "Schwarz\nBut if you're with Fiona,\nare you with the Guardian\nForce too?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x15b"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x15b"
msgstr "Regina\nUm... well, we're—"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x18b"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x18b"
msgstr "Fiona\nYes. We're investigating\nthe attacks on the\nborder bases."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x1dc"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x1dc"
msgstr "Fiona\nAnd you, Colonel\nSchwarz?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x20a"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x20a"
msgstr "Schwarz\n...No. We got an\nemergency call from this\nbase and came, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x26b"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x26b"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd the attackers had\nalready left..."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x2a7"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x2a7"
msgstr "Schwarz\nExactly. And then you\nshowed up."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x2ed"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x2ed"
msgstr "Fiona\nSo you don't know who\nthe attackers are\neither, Colonel?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x344"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x344"
msgstr "Schwarz\nNo. The call only said\nit was a woman with blue\nhair."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x3a1"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x3a1"
msgstr "Fiona\nA woman with blue\nhair..."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x3cd"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x3cd"
msgstr "Arth\nNot the bearded man?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x407"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x407"
msgstr "Schwarz\nBearded man? They said\nnothing of the sort.\nWho is he?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x468"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x468"
msgstr "Jack\n...We believe he's\npart... of the gang\nattacking the bases."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x4af"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x4af"
msgstr "Schwarz\n...I see."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x4d9"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x4d9"
msgstr "Regina\n...Jack..."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x509"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x509"
msgstr "Schwarz\nWhat will you do now?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x541"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x541"
msgstr "Fiona\nIf all's well here, we'll\ngo farther west, to\nZeta Base."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x586"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x586"
msgstr "Fiona\nIt could be attacked\ntoo."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x5c4"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x5c4"
msgstr "Schwarz\nI see. Then I'll come\nwith you."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x5fc"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x5fc"
msgstr "Fiona\nReally? Thank you so\nmuch!"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x63c"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x63c"
msgstr "Schwarz\nThat blue-haired woman is\nvery likely someone I\nknow."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x695"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x695"
msgstr "Fiona\n...Yes, that's true."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x6c1"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x6c1"
msgstr "Schwarz\nDo you mind if I come\nalong?"

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x701"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x701"
msgstr "Arth\nNo problem."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x723"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x723"
msgstr "Regina\nWe're counting on you,\nColonel Schwarz."

msgctxt "dialogue/272/0x75a"
msgid "dialogue/272/0x75a"
msgstr "Schwarz joined\nthe party."

msgctxt "dialogue/273/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/273/0xc"
msgstr "Schwarz\n...It seems we didn't\nmake it in time."

msgctxt "dialogue/273/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/273/0x50"
msgstr "Jack\n......Even so, there\nmay be some clue."

msgctxt "dialogue/273/0x99"
msgid "dialogue/273/0x99"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's go in and take a\nlook."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/274/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nVan!"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x30"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x30"
msgstr "Van\nFiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x54"
msgstr "Schwarz\nYou look well, Van\nFlyheight."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x92"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x92"
msgstr "Van\nYou came too, Schwarz!\nYou're looking good\nyourself."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0xd1"
msgid "dialogue/274/0xd1"
msgstr "Van\nHey, it's you guys!"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0xfa"
msgid "dialogue/274/0xfa"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x11b"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x11b"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's been a while, Van."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x151"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x151"
msgstr "Van\nYou said it! What have\nyou been up to?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x18f"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x18f"
msgstr "Arth\nStuff."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x1af"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x1af"
msgstr "Van\nStuff! Well, you'll have\nto tell me all about it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x1e1"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x1e1"
msgstr "Van\n? {name}, you\nhaven't grown at all, huh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x21b"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x21b"
msgstr "Fiona\n{name} doesn't\nlike milk."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x243"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x243"
msgstr "Jack/Arth/Regina\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x27f"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x27f"
msgstr "Van\nYou gotta eat everything.\nOr you'll never be a\ngood Zoid pilot."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x2d9"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x2d9"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x2fa"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x2fa"
msgstr "Fiona\nDid you find anything\nout, Van?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x328"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x328"
msgstr "Van\nNo, it was already like\nthis when I got here."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x35c"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x35c"
msgstr "Van\nBut..."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x37e"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x37e"
msgstr "Fiona\nBut?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x3a0"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x3a0"
msgstr "Van\nThe survivors say the\nattacker was a man with\na red Organoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x3ff"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x3ff"
msgstr "Fiona\nA red Organoid...\nThen..."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x439"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x439"
msgstr "Van\nYeah, it was probably\nthat Hiltz guy."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x473"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x473"
msgstr "Jack\nHiltz? Who is he?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x4a5"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x4a5"
msgstr "Van\nNo idea. All I know is\nhe's a man with a red\nOrganoid."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x4e2"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x4e2"
msgstr "Van\nBut he's clearly after\nsomething."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x529"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x529"
msgstr "Jack\nEven so, this is a\nproblem."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x559"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x559"
msgstr "Arth\nWhy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x57b"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x57b"
msgstr "Jack\nEach base was attacked\nby someone different."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x5bf"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x5bf"
msgstr "Van\nSeriously?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x5e3"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x5e3"
msgstr "Fiona\nYes. It seems Colonel\nSchwarz ran into Reese.\nAnd Ark Base was\nattacked by..."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x64c"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x64c"
msgstr "Jack\n...A man named Gale."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x680"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x680"
msgstr "Van\nGale?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x6a0"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x6a0"
msgstr "Fiona\nApparently, he's the\nman with the beard."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x6d0"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x6d0"
msgstr "Van\nSo what does that mean?"

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x6f4"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x6f4"
msgstr "Schwarz\nWe still have very little\ninformation."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x72c"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x72c"
msgstr "Jack\nWe should sort out the\ninformation we have."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x76e"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x76e"
msgstr "Van\nOh! I think there was a\ntown near here."

msgctxt "dialogue/274/0x7a8"
msgid "dialogue/274/0x7a8"
msgstr "Schwarz\nGood. Let's regroup\nthere."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/275/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nIrvine! Moonbay!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x40"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x40"
msgstr "Moonbay\nHuh? ...Oh!\nFiona! How are you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x81"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x81"
msgstr "Van\nMoonbay!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0xa3"
msgid "dialogue/275/0xa3"
msgstr "Moonbay\nIs that you, Van?\nYou look even tougher\nthan before!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0xf0"
msgid "dialogue/275/0xf0"
msgstr "Van\nSame to you! What are\nyou doing out here?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x12f"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x12f"
msgstr "Irvine\n\"I'm the deeesert\ntranspoooorter...\"\nor something like that."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x16c"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x16c"
msgstr "Irvine\nAnd also the one who\npays my wages."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x1a8"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x1a8"
msgstr "Moonbay\nRight. The border's been\ndangerous lately. So I\nhired him as a\nbodyguard."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x203"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x203"
msgstr "Irvine\nAnd what are you guys\nup to?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x22f"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x22f"
msgstr "Irvine\nLots of familiar faces\ntogether, huh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x276"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x276"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's been a long time."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x2a0"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x2a0"
msgstr "Arth\nStill got that\nunfriendly glare."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x2d4"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x2d4"
msgstr "Irvine\nLook who's talking! You\nhaven't changed either!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x30e"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x30e"
msgstr "Moonbay\nKnock it off, Irvine."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x332"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x332"
msgstr "Moonbay\nSo what are you really\ndoing here? Is it about\nthe attacks on the\nborder bases?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x385"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x385"
msgstr "Van\nYeah. But all we know is\nwhat the culprits look\nlike."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x3c1"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x3c1"
msgstr "Fiona\nA girl with blue hair,\na man with a red\nOrganoid, and the man\nwith the beard."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x40f"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x40f"
msgstr "Irvine/Moonbay\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x443"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x443"
msgstr "Irvine\n...The ones from a\nwhile ago?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x479"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x479"
msgstr "Moonbay\nFrom the description,\nsounds like them, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x4b9"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x4b9"
msgstr "Van\nYou know something?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x4e3"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x4e3"
msgstr "Moonbay\nOn our way here,"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x519"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x519"
msgstr "Moonbay\nwe saw those three\nheading for Deme Base."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x56a"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x56a"
msgstr "Van\nSeriously, Moonbay!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x596"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x596"
msgstr "Moonbay\nNot that I'm sure."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x5c2"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x5c2"
msgstr "Irvine\nWell, they're hard to\nmiss. It was them, all\nright."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x604"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x604"
msgstr "Moonbay\nWell, we'd better get\ngoing. See you, Van,\nFiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x655"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x655"
msgstr "Fiona\nLeaving already?"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x683"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x683"
msgstr "Moonbay\nThis cargo has to\narrive on time,"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x6be"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x6be"
msgstr "Moonbay\nso we can't hang\naround too long."

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x6f0"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x6f0"
msgstr "Irvine\nHeh. Since it's you guys,\nhere's a present!"

msgctxt "dialogue/275/0x73b"
msgid "dialogue/275/0x73b"
msgstr "Irvine\nSee ya!"

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/276/0xc"
msgstr "Van\nSo next up is Deme\nBase. What are they\nafter?"

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0x4c"
msgid "dialogue/276/0x4c"
msgstr "Regina\nIf the three of them\nwere together..."

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0x86"
msgid "dialogue/276/0x86"
msgstr "Jack\nInstructor Gale, with\nthis Hiltz and Reese...\nBut why?"

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0xe1"
msgid "dialogue/276/0xe1"
msgstr "Fiona\nLet's go see. To the\nDeme research base!"

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0x11f"
msgid "dialogue/276/0x11f"
msgstr "Arth\nYeah. That's where\nwe'll get answers."

msgctxt "dialogue/276/0x160"
msgid "dialogue/276/0x160"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/277/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/277/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nCivilians are not\npermitted beyond\nthis point."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nCivilians are not\npermitted beyond\nthis point."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x45"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x45"
msgstr "Schwarz\nI am Colonel Schwarz,\nhead of the Empire's\nFirst Armored Division.\nLet me through!"

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0xa1"
msgid "dialogue/278/0xa1"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nWithout Commander Hiltz's\npermission, no one may\npass beyond here."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0xfc"
msgid "dialogue/278/0xfc"
msgstr "Schwarz\nCommander Hiltz!?\nThis base's commander\nhas no such name!"

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x147"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x147"
msgstr "Schwarz\nI'll get through, by\nforce if I must!"

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x178"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x178"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nEven if you say so,\nsir..."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x1b4"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x1b4"
msgstr "Jack\nColonel, we don't have\nclear proof yet."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x1f7"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x1f7"
msgstr "Jack\nLet's look around the\narea a bit more."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x235"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x235"
msgstr "Fiona\nRight, right. We should\ncalm down and have a\ncoffee with salt. I think\nthere was a big city\nto the south."

msgctxt "dialogue/278/0x2a0"
msgid "dialogue/278/0x2a0"
msgstr "Schwarz\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/279/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nHuh? That's..."

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x38"
msgstr "Schwarz\nA Dibison? Thomas!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x70"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x70"
msgstr "Thomas\nIt's you, brother... I'll\ndefeat you and prove I'm\na superb soldier..."

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0xd3"
msgid "dialogue/279/0xd3"
msgstr "Van\nHuh? What're you saying,\nThomas? Did the heat get\nto you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x11e"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x11e"
msgstr "Thomas\nI won't let you have\nMiss Fiona...\nDie, Van."

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x15b"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x15b"
msgstr "Thomas\nBeak! Megalomax!"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x197"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x197"
msgstr "Van\nH-hey!"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x1bb"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x1bb"
msgstr "Fiona\nVan! Something's wrong\nwith Lieutenant Schwarz!"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x1f5"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x1f5"
msgstr "Van\nAh! Is Reese\ncontrolling him!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x225"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x225"
msgstr "Van\nDammit, I'll punch\nThomas till he comes\nto his senses!"

msgctxt "dialogue/279/0x260"
msgid "dialogue/279/0x260"
msgstr "Van\nLet's go!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/280/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nLieutenant Schwarz!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x38"
msgstr "Thomas\nAh! M-Miss Fiona!\nWhat happened here?\n...I get it! This was\nyour doing, Van!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x97"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x97"
msgstr "Van\nWhy me!? Reese was\ncontrolling you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/280/0xe4"
msgstr "Thomas\nDon't talk nonsense!\nI'd never fall into\nenemy hands!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x13d"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x13d"
msgstr "Fiona\nIt's true, Lieutenant\nSchwarz. Reese was\ncontrolling you."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x190"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x190"
msgstr "Thomas\nYes, Miss Fiona is\nright. I was being\ncontrolled."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x1e3"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x1e3"
msgstr "Van\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x208"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x208"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x229"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x229"
msgstr "Jack\nHe's quite a peculiar\nfellow."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x25b"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x25b"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd he's handsome, too..."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x287"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x287"
msgstr "Jack\nOh? You like that kind\nof man? I thought you\npreferred someone like\nthe Prince..."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x2e4"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x2e4"
msgstr "Regina\nW-w-w-wait, Jack!\nWhat are you saying!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x337"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x337"
msgstr "Arth\nTough luck, Prince."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x364"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x364"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x385"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x385"
msgstr "Arth\n...Though it's Regina\nwho's got it tough."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x3c0"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x3c0"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x3e1"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x3e1"
msgstr "Van\nOkay, Thomas.\nWhat happened to Reese?"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x420"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x420"
msgstr "Thomas\nI don't have to tell\nyou anything."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x456"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x456"
msgstr "Van\nWhat'd you say!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x478"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x478"
msgstr "Fiona\nLieutenant Schwarz, where\nare Reese and the others?"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x4b8"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x4b8"
msgstr "Thomas\nYes, Miss Fiona."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x4d8"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x4d8"
msgstr "Thomas\nReese and Hiltz went\ndeeper into the base\nwith the bearded man."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x52f"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x52f"
msgstr "Van\n...You, I swear..."

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x55b"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x55b"
msgstr "Thomas\nDon't just stand there,\nVan! After them!"

msgctxt "dialogue/280/0x59a"
msgid "dialogue/280/0x59a"
msgstr "Thomas\nLet's go, Miss Fiona."

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/281/0xc"
msgstr "Hiltz\nYou certainly took your\ntime."

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x46"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x46"
msgstr "Reese\nWell, what do you expect\nfrom a bunch of chumps\nlike these?"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x91"
msgstr "Van\nHiltz..."

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0xb5"
msgid "dialogue/281/0xb5"
msgstr "Thomas\nHow dare you use me!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0xf7"
msgid "dialogue/281/0xf7"
msgstr "Van\nThomas, shut up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x12b"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x12b"
msgstr "Thomas\nWhat was that, Van!?\nI won't let you show\noff in front of Miss\nFiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x18e"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x18e"
msgstr "Van\nWhat are you talking\nabout!?"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x1b2"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x1b2"
msgstr "Thomas\nSomething important!\nVery important! I won't\nlet you have Miss Fiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x207"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x207"
msgstr "Reese\n...These guys..."

msgctxt "dialogue/281/0x235"
msgid "dialogue/281/0x235"
msgstr "Hiltz\nUnfortunately, we have\nno time for your\ncomedy routine."

msgctxt "dialogue/282/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/282/0xc"
msgstr "Fiona\nUm, they got away."

msgctxt "dialogue/282/0x3c"
msgid "dialogue/282/0x3c"
msgstr "Thomas\nWhat!?\nVan, after them!"

msgctxt "dialogue/283/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/283/0xc"
msgstr "Van\n...And whose fault is\nthat? Come on, Fiona!"

msgctxt "dialogue/283/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/283/0x48"
msgstr "Fiona\nRight!"

msgctxt "dialogue/284/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/284/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/284/0x24"
msgid "dialogue/284/0x24"
msgstr "Jack/Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/284/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/284/0x54"
msgstr "Regina\n...W-we have to go\nafter them too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/285/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/285/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/285/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/285/0x2d"
msgstr "Gale\nAs for us, let's have\nan important little\ntalk among ourselves..."

msgctxt "dialogue/285/0x78"
msgid "dialogue/285/0x78"
msgstr "Jack\n...Instructor Gale...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/286/0xc"
msgstr "Gale\nInstructor Gale... That\nis a thing of the past."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x38"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x38"
msgstr "Gale\nNow I am Gale, one of\nHis Majesty the Emperor's\nFour Kings."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x78"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x78"
msgstr "Arth\nWhat are you after? Why\nattack the bases?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0xba"
msgid "dialogue/286/0xba"
msgstr "Gale\nBlood must have told\nyou the Emperor's aim\nby now."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0xf0"
msgid "dialogue/286/0xf0"
msgstr "Gale\nI merely help him\nachieve it."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x12c"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x12c"
msgstr "Regina\nBuilding the most\npowerful Zoid army..."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x166"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x166"
msgstr "Gale\nIndeed. To that end, I\ngathered real combat data\non this era's Zoids.\nNothing more."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x1cb"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x1cb"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd who are they? Why\nwere you together?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x205"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x205"
msgstr "Gale\nHm? Ah, you mean Hiltz\nand Reese? I don't know\ntheir true aim."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x256"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x256"
msgstr "Gale\nOnly that the Empire's\nbases were in their way,\nso we joined forces."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x29f"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x29f"
msgstr "Gale\nThe bases hinder them; I\nstudy the Zoids.\nDestroying the bases is\nmerely one more step."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x2fa"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x2fa"
msgstr "Gale\nI have the data I needed.\nWith it, we'll strengthen\nour Zoids to make up for\nour small numbers."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x35b"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x35b"
msgstr "Jack\nWhy?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x383"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x383"
msgstr "Gale\nWhat?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x3a3"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x3a3"
msgstr "Jack\nWhy are you telling us\nall this?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x3d7"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x3d7"
msgstr "Jack\nWhy reveal your own\nsecrets to us?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x418"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x418"
msgstr "Jack\nInstructor Gale! What is\nit you're after?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x459"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x459"
msgstr "Jack\nWhat happened to you?\nPlease, tell me!"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x4a4"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x4a4"
msgstr "Gale\n......It seems I've said\ntoo much."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x4d8"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x4d8"
msgstr "Gale\nI have sworn loyalty to\nthe Emperor. No more,\nno less."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x52b"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x52b"
msgstr "Jack\nInstructor Gale!"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x553"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x553"
msgstr "Gale\nThe Gale you knew no\nlonger exists."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x583"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x583"
msgstr "Gale\nI am Gale of the Four\nKings. ...For now, that\nwill suffice."

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x5c6"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x5c6"
msgstr "Jack\nI'll stop you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x5e6"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x5e6"
msgstr "Jack\nI don't know what you\nhave in mind. But I\nintend to stop you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x649"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x649"
msgstr "Gale\n...Can you? Do you think\nsomeone as soft as you\ncan stop me?"

msgctxt "dialogue/286/0x696"
msgid "dialogue/286/0x696"
msgstr "Gale\nShow me your resolve,\nJack!"

msgctxt "dialogue/287/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/287/0xc"
msgstr "Gale\n...Hmm... I see. You've shown your\nresolve."

msgctxt "dialogue/287/0x4f"
msgid "dialogue/287/0x4f"
msgstr "Gale\nBut you still have a long way\nto go. Don't think you'll win\nnext time too."

msgctxt "dialogue/288/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/288/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nInstructor Gale!"

msgctxt "dialogue/288/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/288/0x36"
msgstr "Regina\n...Looks like he has his reasons."

msgctxt "dialogue/288/0x6c"
msgid "dialogue/288/0x6c"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/288/0x93"
msgid "dialogue/288/0x93"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/289/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nVan! How did it go for you\nguys?"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x44"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x44"
msgstr "Thomas\nThanks to this\ngood-for-nothing, he got away."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x82"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x82"
msgstr "Van\nWhat?! That's because you\nwouldn't stop firing with the\nMegalomax!"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0xd3"
msgid "dialogue/289/0xd3"
msgstr "Thomas\nFiring everything at once is\nsuch a thrill."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x105"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x105"
msgstr "Van\nHey! That's no excuse to lock\non to me as a target!"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x152"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x152"
msgstr "Fiona\nAnd the man with the beard?"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x18a"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x18a"
msgstr "Jack\n...He got away from us."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x1bc"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x1bc"
msgstr "Fiona\nOh. So we're back where we\nstarted..."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x1f8"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x1f8"
msgstr "Jack\nNo. We should be fine for a\nwhile. He said he'd already\naccomplished his objective."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x253"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x253"
msgstr "Fiona\nThe man with the beard told\nyou that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x291"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x291"
msgstr "Jack\nYes."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x2b1"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x2b1"
msgstr "Thomas\nWe can't trust that! You can't\nbelieve a word the enemy says."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x2fa"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x2fa"
msgstr "Fiona\nBut the man with the beard\ndoesn't seem like such a bad\nperson to me."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x33d"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x33d"
msgstr "Fiona\nAt Ark Base, for how badly it\nwas wrecked, hardly anyone got\nhurt..."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x392"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x392"
msgstr "Thomas\nYou're right, Miss Fiona! Even if\nhe's the enemy, trusting people\nis where it all begins."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x3f7"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x3f7"
msgstr "Jack\n...So he doesn't seem like such a\nbad person..."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x43b"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x43b"
msgstr "Arth\nThat's enough for now. Right,\nJack?"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x476"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x476"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x497"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x497"
msgstr "Jack\n...Yes."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x4bd"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x4bd"
msgstr "Van\nWe're heading out. What about\nyou guys?"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x502"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x502"
msgstr "Jack\nWe still have things to do."

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x540"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x540"
msgstr "Van\n...I see. Well, see you next time!"

msgctxt "dialogue/289/0x57a"
msgid "dialogue/289/0x57a"
msgstr "Fiona\nSee you soon!"

msgctxt "dialogue/290/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/290/0xc"
msgstr "Arth\nLet's head back too."

msgctxt "dialogue/290/0x34"
msgid "dialogue/290/0x34"
msgstr "Regina\nYeah. We still have a lot to do."

msgctxt "dialogue/290/0x82"
msgid "dialogue/290/0x82"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/290/0xa3"
msgid "dialogue/290/0xa3"
msgstr "Jack\nLet us return. To our own era!"

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/291/0xc"
msgstr "Blood\nAt your service, Your Majesty."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x3e"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x3e"
msgstr "Emperor\nWell done."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x50"
msgstr "Emperor\nBy the way, Blood, are you\nfamiliar with these so-called\nZoid battles?"

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x9b"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x9b"
msgstr "Blood\nA competition of\nZoid-versus-Zoid combat under\nfair rules..."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0xee"
msgid "dialogue/291/0xee"
msgstr "Blood\nIt's nothing but child's play."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x11e"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x11e"
msgstr "Emperor\nHow harsh, Blood."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x13e"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x13e"
msgstr "Emperor\nBut precisely because of that,\nit's also true that\nhigh-performance Zoids abound\nthere."

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x195"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x195"
msgstr "Blood\nUnderstood. I shall travel to\nthe era of Zoid battles and\ngather information!"

msgctxt "dialogue/291/0x1f4"
msgid "dialogue/291/0x1f4"
msgstr "Emperor\nHeh heh heh. I'm counting on\nyou, Blood."

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/292/0x3"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\n...! We've detected a space-time\ntremor! It seems someone has\nused the castle's space-time\ntransporter."

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0x54"
msgid "dialogue/292/0x54"
msgstr "Kingdom Commander\nWhat?!\nDo we know the destination?"

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0x83"
msgid "dialogue/292/0x83"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\n...Not exactly..."

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0xab"
msgid "dialogue/292/0xab"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 1\nBut the coordinates are very\ndifferent from the previous\ntimes."

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0xf6"
msgid "dialogue/292/0xf6"
msgstr "Kingdom Commander\n...The coordinates? Where are\nthey trying to go?"

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0x13d"
msgid "dialogue/292/0x13d"
msgstr "Kingdom Commander\nInform the Prince and the\nothers. Hurry!"

msgctxt "dialogue/292/0x171"
msgid "dialogue/292/0x171"
msgstr "Kingdom Soldier 2\nYes, sir!"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/293/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, a space-time tremor has\nbeen detected."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x49"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x49"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x6a"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x6a"
msgstr "Regina\nFinally!"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x92"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x92"
msgstr "Regina\nJack, don't we know anything\nelse?"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0xcc"
msgid "dialogue/293/0xcc"
msgstr "Jack\nI'm afraid not... But this time it\nseems to be a different place."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x125"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x125"
msgstr "Regina\nA different place?"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x153"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x153"
msgstr "Arth\nNeither the Republic nor the\nEmpire."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x191"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x191"
msgstr "Regina\nThen where is it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x1bf"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x1bf"
msgstr "Arth\nNo idea."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x1df"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x1df"
msgstr "Regina\nWell, that's some answer!"

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x209"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x209"
msgstr "Jack\nNow, now. In any case, we have\nto follow them."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x24b"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x24b"
msgstr "Jack\nPrince, let us depart as soon\nas we're ready."

msgctxt "dialogue/293/0x28b"
msgid "dialogue/293/0x28b"
msgstr "Jack\nAre you ready, Prince? Then let\nus be off."

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0xd"
msgid "dialogue/294/0xd"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/294/0x2e"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat a desolate place. Where\ncould we be?"

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0x7f"
msgid "dialogue/294/0x7f"
msgstr "Arth\n......Jack."

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0xb3"
msgid "dialogue/294/0xb3"
msgstr "Jack\nYes. It looks like a training\nground... or a battlefield."

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0x106"
msgid "dialogue/294/0x106"
msgstr "Regina\nA battlefield?"

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0x128"
msgid "dialogue/294/0x128"
msgstr "Jack\nI can't be certain, but most\nlikely..."

msgctxt "dialogue/294/0x15a"
msgid "dialogue/294/0x15a"
msgstr "Jack\nFor now, let's explore the area."

msgctxt "dialogue/295/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/295/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/295/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/295/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nEnemies? Where are they\nshooting from?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/295/0x69"
msgid "dialogue/295/0x69"
msgstr "Arth\nFrom everywhere..."

msgctxt "dialogue/295/0x91"
msgid "dialogue/295/0x91"
msgstr "Jack\nWe must get out of here,\nwhatever it takes!"

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/296/0xc"
msgstr "Judgeman\nThird-party intrusion onto the\nbattlefield confirmed!"

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0x4b"
msgid "dialogue/296/0x4b"
msgstr "Judgeman\nThird-party intrusion onto the\nbattlefield confirmed!"

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0x8a"
msgid "dialogue/296/0x8a"
msgstr "Judgeman\nUnder the Zoid battle\nregulations, this battle is\nsuspended."

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0xd5"
msgid "dialogue/296/0xd5"
msgstr "Judgeman\nNo contest!"

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0x108"
msgid "dialogue/296/0x108"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/296/0x129"
msgid "dialogue/296/0x129"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat on earth is going on?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/297/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/297/0xc"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/297/0x2d"
msgid "dialogue/297/0x2d"
msgstr "Regina\nWhat is it, {name}?"

msgctxt "dialogue/297/0x56"
msgid "dialogue/297/0x56"
msgstr "Regina\nOh! That's...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/297/0x7f"
msgid "dialogue/297/0x7f"
msgstr "Blood\nSo it was you lot who\ninterrupted the battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/297/0xca"
msgid "dialogue/297/0xca"
msgstr "Blood\nHeh heh. Perhaps now these\ndull battles will become a\nlittle more interesting."

msgctxt "dialogue/298/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/298/0xc"
msgstr "Jack\nThat's Blood, one of the Four\nKings, if I'm not mistaken..."

msgctxt "dialogue/298/0x50"
msgid "dialogue/298/0x50"
msgstr "Arth\n......Looks like we'll be meeting\nagain."

msgctxt "dialogue/298/0x86"
msgid "dialogue/298/0x86"
msgstr "Jack\nYes..."

msgctxt "dialogue/298/0xad"
msgid "dialogue/298/0xad"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/299/0xc"
msgstr "Leena\nHey! You guys!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x36"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x36"
msgstr "Leena\nWhat were you thinking,\nwandering in there looking all\nclueless?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x75"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x75"
msgstr "Leena\nWhere are your eyes?! Are your\nbrains rotten or what?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0xcc"
msgid "dialogue/299/0xcc"
msgstr "Jamie\nLeena, there's no need to go\nthat far..."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x10a"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x10a"
msgstr "Leon\nIt's understandable. We've been\nworking hard for a long time to\nfight them."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x169"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x169"
msgstr "Jamie\nThat's true, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x19f"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x19f"
msgstr "Leena\nExactly! With the Royal Cup\nover and Bit and Brad off\ntraveling!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x1f6"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x1f6"
msgstr "Leena\nAnd on top of that, my brother\nLeon came home to help us!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x25b"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x25b"
msgstr "Leon\nI was looking forward to\nteaming up with you all again,\ntoo..."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x2b0"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x2b0"
msgstr "Leena\nHey, you! Are you listening?\nStop grinning like an idiot!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x30c"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x30c"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x32d"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x32d"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd what about you?! Where do\nyou see {name} grinning\nlike an idiot?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x385"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x385"
msgstr "Leena\nWhat do you mean, \"you\"?! I\nhave a perfectly respectable\nname: Leena!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x3d8"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x3d8"
msgstr "Leena\nAnd who are you?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x406"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x406"
msgstr "Regina\nI'm Regina! And this is\n{name}!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x444"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x444"
msgstr "Leena\nHmph! You keep sticking up for\nhim! Are you two dating?"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x4ab"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x4ab"
msgstr "Regina\nWh-wh-wh-wh-wh-what are you\nsaying?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x4f6"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x4f6"
msgstr "Regina\n{name} and I aren't, w-we\naren't dating......"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x546"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x546"
msgstr "Leena\nOh? Oh? Come on, just admit it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x584"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x584"
msgstr "Jack\n...Should we stop them?"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x5c2"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x5c2"
msgstr "Arth\nLet them go at it till they've\nhad enough."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x5f5"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x5f5"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x616"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x616"
msgstr "Jamie\nHey! You should stop them too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x65d"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x65d"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nI could keep watching for a\nwhile..."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x6a1"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x6a1"
msgstr "Jamie\nYou too, Doctor! What are you\nsaying?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x6e6"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x6e6"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThere's no point staying here.\nLet's head back to the Tros\nFarm."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x731"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x731"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nWhile you're at it, come along\nwith us."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x765"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x765"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nHey, Leena! You too, young lady.\nCome with us."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x7b8"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x7b8"
msgstr "Leena\nOkay, Dad! Come on, Regina."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x7f0"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x7f0"
msgstr "Regina\nSure."

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x810"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x810"
msgstr "Jack\n...When did they become such\ngood friends?"

msgctxt "dialogue/299/0x857"
msgid "dialogue/299/0x857"
msgstr "Arth\nHow should I know?"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/300/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nSo, what were you doing in a\nplace like that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x53"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x53"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nSurely you know it's forbidden\nto enter a battlefield."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0xa8"
msgid "dialogue/300/0xa8"
msgstr "Jack\nOur apologies. We don't know\nthis area well..."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0xf7"
msgid "dialogue/300/0xf7"
msgstr "Regina\nWe're so sorry. We ruined your\nbattle..."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x14e"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x14e"
msgstr "Leena\nForget it! There'll be other\nchances. Don't worry about it,\nRegina."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x1a5"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x1a5"
msgstr "Regina\nThanks, Leena..."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x1d9"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x1d9"
msgstr "Jack\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x201"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x201"
msgstr "Arth\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x227"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x227"
msgstr "Jamie\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x24f"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x24f"
msgstr "Jack\nB-by the way, about the team\nyou were fighting..."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x29c"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x29c"
msgstr "Leon\nYou mean Team Blood?"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x2ce"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x2ce"
msgstr "Arth\nTeam Blood?"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x2f8"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x2f8"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThat's right."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x30e"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x30e"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThey came out of nowhere like\na comet and quickly became the\nundisputed champions of the\ncolosseum district."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x36f"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x36f"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThough they're a very\nmysterious bunch."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x39d"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x39d"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nApart from their leader being a\nman named Blood, nothing is\nknown about them."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x3ff"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x3ff"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x420"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x420"
msgstr "Regina\nBlood..."

msgctxt "dialogue/300/0x44a"
msgid "dialogue/300/0x44a"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nWell, let's continue our talk\nover here."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xc"
msgstr "Jamie\nBut, Doctor, speaking of\nstrange things, these Zoid\ndisappearances lately are\nstrange too."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x73"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x73"
msgstr "Jack\nZoid disappearances?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xa1"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xa1"
msgstr "Leena\nYeah. Lately, the top-ranked\nwarriors from all over have\nbeen disappearing one after\nanother."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xea"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xea"
msgstr "Leena\nAlong with their Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x118"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x118"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThe nerve!\nThey only go after rare Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x165"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x165"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nI want them too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x197"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x197"
msgstr "Jamie\nDoctor!\nDon't say things like that!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x1e0"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x1e0"
msgstr "Jack\nZoid disappearances and the\nmysterious Team Blood..."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x21e"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x21e"
msgstr "Jack\nAnd their leader is one of the\nFour Kings."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x256"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x256"
msgstr "Arth\nSomething smells fishy."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x278"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x278"
msgstr "Regina\nWhere is Team Blood?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x2b8"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x2b8"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nNo idea. Like I said, they're a\ngroup shrouded in mystery."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x305"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x305"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nYou think Team Blood has\nsomething to do with the\ndisappearances?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x35c"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x35c"
msgstr "Jack\nWe can't be sure."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x37c"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x37c"
msgstr "Jack\nBut if Team Blood's leader is\nwho we think he is..."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x3d5"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x3d5"
msgstr "Jack\nIt's quite possible."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x409"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x409"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nWell, well, this is getting\ninteresting."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x452"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x452"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThe best thing would be to ask\nTeam Blood directly."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x4a3"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x4a3"
msgstr "Jack\nBut a moment ago you said no\none knows where they are..."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x4e7"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x4e7"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nTrue! But there's one sure way\nto see them!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x531"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x531"
msgstr "{name}\n......"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x552"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x552"
msgstr "Regina\nAnd what's that?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x584"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x584"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nA Zoid battle.\nYou just have to take part."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x5c6"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x5c6"
msgstr "Leena\nBut, Dad, Team Blood are the\nundisputed champions of the\nZoid battle colosseum."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x617"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x617"
msgstr "Leena\nWe can't just challenge them\nourselves. They'll say no and\nthat'll be that."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x66c"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x66c"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nHow naive, Leena. In a title\nfinal, they can't refuse."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x6cb"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x6cb"
msgstr "Jamie\nTh-the colosseum champions?!\nYou expect us to make it all\nthe way to them?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x728"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x728"
msgstr "Jamie\nBesides, it's not like the usual\nZoid battles."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x76c"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x76c"
msgstr "Leon\nHonestly, this is getting\ninteresting."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x7a6"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x7a6"
msgstr "Jamie\nLeon, not you too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x7da"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x7da"
msgstr "Jack\nDr. Tros, what does one need to\ndo to enter a Zoid battle?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x835"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x835"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nYou just have to register a\nteam with the Zoid Battle\nFederation, but..."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x87c"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x87c"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nRegistering a team takes quite\na while."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x8b4"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x8b4"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nIn the meantime, Team Blood\nmight slip away."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x901"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x901"
msgstr "Regina\nOh no! Isn't there any way\naround it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x93f"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x93f"
msgstr "Leena\nDad! Isn't there anything we\ncan do?!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x977"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x977"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nSimple. Register as Zoid\nwarriors of Team Blitz."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0x9d0"
msgid "dialogue/301/0x9d0"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThat way you can take part in\nZoid battles starting tomorrow."

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xa11"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xa11"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nLeena, of course you'll help\nthem, won't you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xa57"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xa57"
msgstr "Leena\nYou bet! Let's give it all we've\ngot, Regina!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xa97"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xa97"
msgstr "Regina\nYeah!"

msgctxt "dialogue/301/0xab2"
msgid "dialogue/301/0xab2"
msgstr "Leon, Leena and Jamie joined\nthe party!"

msgctxt "dialogue/302/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/302/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nWhat curious Zoids you have!"

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/303/0xc"
msgstr "Regina\nLeena, so what do we have to\ndo to fight for the district\nchampion title?"

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x63"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x63"
msgstr "Leena\nEasy! You just have to keep\nwinning!"

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0xa6"
msgid "dialogue/303/0xa6"
msgstr "Jamie\nThat doesn't explain anything..."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0xe4"
msgid "dialogue/303/0xe4"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThis colosseum district has\nthree arenas."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x11e"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x11e"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nWhoever wins the third arena's\ntournament fights the district\nchampion for the title."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x171"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x171"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nBut there's a requirement to\nenter the third arena's\ntournament."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x1ce"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x1ce"
msgstr "Arth\nA requirement?"

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x1ee"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x1ee"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nThat's right. You have to win\nthe tournaments in the first\nand second arenas."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x247"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x247"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nYou can start with either the\nfirst or the second. Pick\nwhichever you like."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x2ae"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x2ae"
msgstr "Leena\nSo there you go. Got it?"

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x2e0"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x2e0"
msgstr "Jamie\nAnd she's not even the one who\nexplained it..."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x320"
msgid "dialogue/303/0x320"
msgstr "Dr. Tros\nOh, yes. There are several\nancient ruins around this area."

msgctxt "dialogue/303/0x365"
