msgstr "Leena\nTeam Flugel! Is our next\nopponent Naomi's team?"

msgctxt "dialogue/324/0x57"
msgid "dialogue/324/0x57"
msgstr "Jack\nNaomi? Who's she?"

msgctxt "dialogue/324/0x8b"
msgid "dialogue/324/0x8b"
msgstr "Leon\nA warrior who's undefeated in\none-on-one battles. She's a\ntough opponent."

msgctxt "dialogue/324/0xd4"
msgid "dialogue/324/0xd4"
msgstr "Leena\nBah! I don't care who shows up!\nWe'll crush 'em to a pulp and\ntear 'em to shreds and—"

msgctxt "dialogue/324/0x131"
msgid "dialogue/324/0x131"
msgstr "Naomi\nAnd which team will end up\ncrushed to a pulp and torn to\nshreds?"

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/325/0xc"
msgstr "Leena\nNaomi!"

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0x2e"
msgid "dialogue/325/0x2e"
msgstr "Naomi\nI hear Team Blitz has signed\nsome new people. Is that true?"

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0x7d"
msgid "dialogue/325/0x7d"
msgstr "Leon\nYes. There are reasons."

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0xa7"
msgid "dialogue/325/0xa7"
msgstr "Naomi\nOh? And will you tell me those\nreasons?"

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0xf2"
msgid "dialogue/325/0xf2"
msgstr "Leon\nWhen we're done. Right now,\nlet's focus on the Zoid battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/325/0x13d"
msgid "dialogue/325/0x13d"
msgstr "Naomi\nVery well. I'll be looking\nforward to it."

msgctxt "dialogue/326/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/326/0xc"
msgstr "Leena\nWhat?! I'll crush you to a pulp\nand tear you to shreds!"

msgctxt "dialogue/327/0xc"
