msgctxt "dialogue/727/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/727/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nI'm calculating the position.\nCan you keep fighting a little\nlonger...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/728/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/728/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nDestroy the auxiliary devices\nsurrounding Fort Kronos, to\nthe north."

msgctxt "dialogue/729/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/729/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nThe amplifier's core is in the\nunderground hangar of Fort\nKronos. Destroy it!"

msgctxt "dialogue/730/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/730/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nFirst, go to the underground\narsenal behind this fortress\nand bring back the laser."

msgctxt "dialogue/731/0xc"
msgid "dialogue/731/0xc"
msgstr "Dr. D\nDestroy the rock at the bottom\nof the volcano. It's our last\nresort. We're counting on you!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/756/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/756/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Ah, of course! I'll teach you\nthis tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/757/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/757/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Oh, that's it! I'll teach you\nthis tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/758/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/758/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Ah, yes, that's it! I'll teach\nyou this tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/759/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/759/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n...Ah, yes, that's it! I'll teach\nyou this tactic!"

msgctxt "dialogue/761/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/761/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWelcome! Oh, but kids aren't\nallowed in the tavern, even\nwith their parents."

msgctxt "dialogue/762/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/762/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWe stand up to the Empire, but\ntheir power is far greater. If\nwar breaks out, they'll abandon\nthis area."

msgctxt "dialogue/763/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/763/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis is the border between\nHelic and the Guylos Empire.\nBut there's a truce now, so life\nis peaceful."

msgctxt "dialogue/765/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/765/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis has always been Rare\nHertz territory. When I was\nyoung, Zoids went berserk all\nthe time."

msgctxt "dialogue/766/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/766/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nSee that volcano over there?\nThat's Mount Ossa. The\nRepublic's fortress is there."

msgctxt "dialogue/767/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/767/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Rare Hertz is a mysterious\nwave that drives Zoids mad.\nThough the Pulse Guard holds\nit back now."

msgctxt "dialogue/768/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/768/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe desert to the south is\nRare Hertz territory. The Pulse\nGuard doesn't fully protect\nyou. Stay away."

msgctxt "dialogue/769/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/769/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nMount Ossa is the Republic's\nlast line of defense. If it falls,\nthe capital is just a step away."

msgctxt "dialogue/770/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/770/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThere's no town like this one..."

msgctxt "dialogue/771/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/771/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nMount Ossa is an active\nvolcano; it still erupts now and\nthen. It's beautiful at night."

msgctxt "dialogue/772/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/772/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAre you travelers, young\nfolks? This town has nothing,\nbut rest easy."

msgctxt "dialogue/773/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/773/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say there were skirmishes\naround Red River... Will the war\nstart up again...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/774/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/774/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nBah, the Republic and the\nEmpire are shooting at each\nother again, and everyone\nhere's so relaxed."

msgctxt "dialogue/776/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/776/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas gathered the Kingdom's\narmy to rise up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/777/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/777/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas gathered the Kingdom's\narmy to rise up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/778/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/778/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name} is\nsafe. I hope the King and Queen\nare too."

msgctxt "dialogue/779/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/779/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name} is\nsafe. I hope the King and Queen\nare too."

msgctxt "dialogue/780/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/780/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas risen up against the\nEmperor. How brave!"

msgctxt "dialogue/781/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/781/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas risen up against the\nEmperor's army. Amazing!"

msgctxt "dialogue/782/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/782/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nPrince {name} has formed\nan army. Will this town become a\nbattlefield...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/783/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/783/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas formed the Kingdom's army.\nWill this town end up a\nbattlefield?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/784/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/784/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nI'm gonna fight with Prince\n{name} too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/785/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/785/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nI'm gonna fight with Prince\n{name} too!"

msgctxt "dialogue/786/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/786/0x3"
msgstr "Girl\nMy daddy was a soldier at the\ncastle, but he hasn't come\nhome. I hope he comes back\nsoon!"

msgctxt "dialogue/787/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/787/0x3"
msgstr "Girl\nMy daddy was a soldier at the\ncastle, but he hasn't come\nhome. I hope he comes back\nsoon!"

msgctxt "dialogue/788/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/788/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nPrince {name} has risen\nup! Drinks are on the house\ntoday! Drink all you want!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/789/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/789/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nThey say Prince {name}\nhas risen up. Drinks are on the\nhouse today! Drink all you want!"

msgctxt "dialogue/790/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/790/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nPrince {name}! I've heard\nthe news! This old man will\nsupport you from the shadows."

msgctxt "dialogue/791/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/791/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nPrince {name}! I've heard\nthe news! This old man will\nsupport you from the shadows."

msgctxt "dialogue/792/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/792/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nThey say Arcadia's prince has\nformed an army! And he's just a\nkid... Impressive!"

msgctxt "dialogue/793/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/793/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nThey say Arcadia's prince has\nformed the Kingdom's army! And\nhe's just a kid. Impressive!"

msgctxt "dialogue/794/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/794/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAll right, I'll join the Kingdom's\narmy! Then the girls will go\ncrazy for me."

msgctxt "dialogue/795/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/795/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAll right, I'll join the Kingdom's\narmy! Then the girls will go\ncrazy for me."

msgctxt "dialogue/796/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/796/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nThey say the border bases are\nbeing attacked one after\nanother. Just when we had\npeace... What a pain."

msgctxt "dialogue/797/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/797/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nSince His Majesty Rudolph took\nthe throne, the war has ended.\nWe've got nothing to do now...\nbut I'm not complaining!"

msgctxt "dialogue/798/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/798/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nHis Majesty Rudolph is very\nyoung, but he has a strong\nsense of duty. At his age, he\nmust still want to play!"

msgctxt "dialogue/799/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/799/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nSince His Majesty Rudolph took\nthe throne, the Guylos Empire\nhas changed. For the better, of\ncourse. Peace is wonderful!"

msgctxt "dialogue/800/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/800/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAs long as the war is over and\nmy children came home safe, I'm\nhappy."

msgctxt "dialogue/801/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/801/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Guardian Force, the\nspecial unit that protects the\npeace! How cool! Maybe I should\nenlist?"

msgctxt "dialogue/802/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/802/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis is a border town, but\nGuygalos, the capital, is a\ngreat city. Oh, I'd love to go\njust once!"

msgctxt "dialogue/803/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/803/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nOur Guylos Empire will prosper\nmore and more! After all, our\nEmperor is the great Rudolph."

msgctxt "dialogue/804/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/804/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWelcome. Traveling? This town\nhas nothing, but there's no\nshortage of peace. Make\nyourselves at home."

msgctxt "dialogue/805/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/805/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nWith the war over, the\nmercenary business is dead. I'll\nhave to become a hauler."

msgctxt "dialogue/806/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/806/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nI figured there'd be work in the\nGuylos Empire... But I'm not the\nonly girl who thought so. Isn't\nthere anything for me?"

msgctxt "dialogue/807/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/807/0x3"
msgstr "Waitress\nWelcome! Please sit at any free\ntable."

msgctxt "dialogue/808/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/808/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe waitress here is cute, but\nthe ones in Guygalos are cuter!"

msgctxt "dialogue/809/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/809/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nLong live the Guylos Empire!\nLong live His Majesty Rudolph!\nAnd while we're at it, long live\nthe waitress!"

msgctxt "dialogue/810/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/810/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nLong live the Guylos Empire!\nLong live His Majesty Rudolph!\nAnd while we're at it, long live\nthe waitress!"

msgctxt "dialogue/811/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/811/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nHis Majesty ordered us of the\nFirst Armored Division to guard\nthe border, and suddenly this\nhappens..."

msgctxt "dialogue/812/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/812/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nOur division commander has His\nMajesty's trust. He fought at\nhis side in Prozen's rebellion.\nA model soldier!"

msgctxt "dialogue/813/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/813/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nSending the First Armored\nDivision just to guard the\nborder?... Who could the enemy\nbe?"

msgctxt "dialogue/814/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/814/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nI've been assigned to the\nglorious First Armored Division!\nI... I mean, this soldier is\nthrilled!"

msgctxt "dialogue/815/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/815/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nOur division commander is very\nskilled, but he's hopeless at\npolitics. Of course, that's part\nof his charm."

msgctxt "dialogue/816/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/816/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWhat Zoid should I develop\nnext?..."

msgctxt "dialogue/817/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/817/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nSuspicious people?\nMust be some misunderstanding."

msgctxt "dialogue/818/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/818/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nAll quiet."

msgctxt "dialogue/819/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/819/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\n......I haven't seen anyone\nsuspicious. Must be some\nmistake..."

msgctxt "dialogue/820/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/820/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\n......I'm on duty."

msgctxt "dialogue/821/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/821/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\n...All quiet..."

msgctxt "dialogue/822/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/822/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nWe're Zoid warriors. Don't call\nus Zoid pilots!"

msgctxt "dialogue/823/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/823/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nZoid battles are fights\nbetween Zoids under fair rules."

msgctxt "dialogue/824/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/824/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nZoid battles are governed by\nthe Zoid Battle Federation, and\non the field, by the Judgeman."

msgctxt "dialogue/825/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/825/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nIf you want to fight the\ndistrict champion, get\nstronger. Keep winning in the\narena and you'll get to face\nhim."

msgctxt "dialogue/826/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/826/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nI want to make A rank already!\nBut I'm still short a lot of\npoints. Gotta work harder!"

msgctxt "dialogue/827/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/827/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nRomeo City... The best Zoids and\nthe best parts! Every Zoid\nwarrior dreams of this city."

msgctxt "dialogue/828/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/828/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWhat Zoid should I develop\nnext...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/829/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/829/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nI'm winning the next Zoid\nbattle!"

msgctxt "dialogue/830/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/830/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Vipers only has Stealth\nVipers. There are a lot of them,\nso don't get cocky."

msgctxt "dialogue/831/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/831/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Kong, as the name says, is\na group of Iron Kongs. Don't\nunderestimate their power."

msgctxt "dialogue/832/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/832/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nThe sonic army that sweeps the\nland: Team Sykes. Can you keep\nup with their moves?"

msgctxt "dialogue/833/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/833/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Redlers only has flying\nZoids. What a trick! You'd\nbetter bring flying Zoids."

msgctxt "dialogue/834/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/834/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nThe Helcats, you know, use\noptical camouflage. They're a\npain. Don't be fooled by their\nsilly name."

msgctxt "dialogue/835/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/835/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Cannon: a crew of gunners\nwho bet everything on\nfirepower. A shootout is bad\nnews. Be careful."

msgctxt "dialogue/836/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/836/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nAttacking by land and air at\nonce is their usual tactic.\nRunning away won't beat Team\nLights."

msgctxt "dialogue/837/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/837/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Bisons, an army of raging\nbulls. Their firepower and\ncharge are no joke. Want a red\ncape?"

msgctxt "dialogue/838/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/838/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nTeam Tigers, an army of golden\ntigers. Watch out for their\nteamwork."

msgctxt "dialogue/839/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/839/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nAfter the tiger, the lion. Taste\nthe power of the king of\nbeasts."

msgctxt "dialogue/840/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/840/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nIf only fixed weapons are\nallowed, your next opponent is\ntough. Watch out for the Spark\nLiger, the thunder beast!"

msgctxt "dialogue/841/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/841/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Warrior\nThere's not a scrap of data on\nthe opponent. Though from the\nname, it sounds like an\nElephander..."

msgctxt "dialogue/842/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/842/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI heard Prince {name} and\nhis friends have formed the\nKingdom's army. And they say\nthey're holding up well! I'm\nsurprised!"

msgctxt "dialogue/843/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/843/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI heard Prince {name} and\nhis friends have formed the\nKingdom's army. And they say\nthey're holding up well! I'm\nsurprised!"

msgctxt "dialogue/844/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/844/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI hope Prince {name} and\nhis friends succeed, but I hope\nthey don't take too many risks.\nI worry about them."

msgctxt "dialogue/845/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/845/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI hope Prince {name} and\nhis friends succeed, but I hope\nthey don't take too many risks.\nI worry about them."

msgctxt "dialogue/846/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/846/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Imperials are nervous and\nreinforcing the castle. So\nthere are no soldiers in town.\nWhat a relief!"

msgctxt "dialogue/847/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/847/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Imperials are nervous and\nreinforcing the castle. So\nthere are no soldiers in town.\nWhat a relief!"

msgctxt "dialogue/848/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/848/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nJustice is on our side! Prince\n{name} will drive out the\nImperials soon!"

msgctxt "dialogue/849/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/849/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nJustice is on our side! Prince\n{name} will drive out the\nImperials soon!"

msgctxt "dialogue/850/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/850/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe enemy is reinforcing the\ncastle's defenses... Could it be\nthe prelude to an offensive...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/851/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/851/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThe enemy is reinforcing the\ncastle's defenses... Could it be\nthe prelude to an offensive...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/852/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/852/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nLooks like the Imperials have\npulled out of town... But there'll\nbe more trouble. This should be\ngood!"

msgctxt "dialogue/853/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/853/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nLooks like the Imperials have\npulled out of town... But there'll\nbe more trouble. This should be\ngood!"

msgctxt "dialogue/854/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/854/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWell, welcome! How've you been?"

msgctxt "dialogue/855/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/855/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWell, welcome! How've you been?"

msgctxt "dialogue/856/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/856/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nOh, Prince {name}!\nWelcome! Come, rest easy."

msgctxt "dialogue/857/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/857/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nOh, Prince {name}!\nWelcome! Come, rest easy."

msgctxt "dialogue/858/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/858/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThanks to His Highness, there\nare no more Imperials in town.\nWe're almost there. Hang in\nthere!"

msgctxt "dialogue/859/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/859/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nThanks to His Highness, there\nare no more Imperials in town.\nWe're almost there. Hang in\nthere!"

msgctxt "dialogue/860/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/860/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nIt's when you're feeling on top\nof the world that you're in the\nmost danger. Don't get cocky.\nThough you don't need the\nadvice, do you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/861/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/861/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nIt's when everyone's\ncelebrating that things get\nmost dangerous. Better not let\nyour guard down. Though you\nprobably don't need the advice,\nhuh?"

msgctxt "dialogue/862/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/862/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nThere's always someone who\nwants to use the commotion to\ncause trouble. And here I\nwanted to celebrate too..."

msgctxt "dialogue/863/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/863/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nWith this many people, keeping\nwatch is hard work. I hope the\ncoronation ends without\nincident."

msgctxt "dialogue/864/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/864/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nHis Highness Rudolph is still\nyoung, but with Regent Prozen,\nthe Empire is safe. The war with\nthe Republic will end in our\nvictory."

msgctxt "dialogue/865/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/865/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhy all the commotion? What\ntown did you come from? It's\nthe coronation of the crown\nprince, His Highness Rudolph."

msgctxt "dialogue/866/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/866/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nHis Highness Rudolph just\nturned ten. But with Regent\nProzen, we can rest easy."

msgctxt "dialogue/867/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/867/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nOur current prosperity is the\nwork of the late emperor, His\nMajesty Zeppelin II. I'm sure His\nHighness Rudolph will keep it\ngoing."

msgctxt "dialogue/868/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/868/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say His Highness Rudolph\nis very kind. I hope the war\nends and peace comes."

msgctxt "dialogue/869/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/869/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nWhen I grow up, I'm gonna marry\nRudolph!"

msgctxt "dialogue/870/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/870/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say we've reached the\ngates of the Republic's\ncapital... If the Republic fell,\nthe continent would belong to\nthe Empire..."

msgctxt "dialogue/871/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/871/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Guard\nMiletos Castle begins beyond\nthis point. Civilians may not\npass."

msgctxt "dialogue/872/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/872/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Guard\nUgh... Of all days to get stuck\non guard duty. Such bad luck."

msgctxt "dialogue/873/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/873/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nToday we celebrate His\nHighness Rudolph's coronation!\nCome on, eat all you want!"

msgctxt "dialogue/874/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/874/0x3"
msgstr "Waitress\nOh, it's so hectic!\nLet me rest a little!"

msgctxt "dialogue/875/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/875/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAh, nothing beats a good party!\nI feel ten years younger."

msgctxt "dialogue/876/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/876/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nKidnapping His Highness\nRudolph! Those Republic folks\nare such lowlife scum!"

msgctxt "dialogue/877/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/877/0x3"
msgstr "Imperial Soldier\nThere's a foppish guy in that\ntavern who picks on people. Be\ncareful."

msgctxt "dialogue/878/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/878/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nA man and a woman with a child?\nNo, I haven't seen them."

msgctxt "dialogue/879/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/879/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say His Highness Rudolph\nhas been kidnapped! Looks like\nit was the Republic. Is he all\nright?"

msgctxt "dialogue/880/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/880/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nDo you know the Galil Ruins?\nThey're ancient ruins on the\nGalil Plateau."

msgctxt "dialogue/881/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/881/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say the capital is in an\nuproar because His Highness\nRudolph was kidnapped. They've\nsent out a huge search party."

msgctxt "dialogue/882/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/882/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThat Republic thing... what was\nit called? That huge Zoid!"

msgctxt "dialogue/882/0x48"
msgid "dialogue/882/0x48"
msgstr "Villager\nThat's it, the Gojulas! I saw it\nheading for the Galil Ruins!"

msgctxt "dialogue/883/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/883/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say Rudolph's been\nkidnapped! Poor little thing...\nWaaah!"

msgctxt "dialogue/884/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/884/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWelcome. Sit wherever there's\nroom."

msgctxt "dialogue/885/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/885/0x3"
msgstr "Zoid Pilot\nLast night I saw a Gojulas\nheading for the Galil Ruins. I'm\nnot mistaken: you can't mix up a\nZoid that flashy."

msgctxt "dialogue/887/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/887/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWe've finally solved the Bloody\nDemon's instability. Soon we'll\nbe able to take it into combat\nas a weapon."

msgctxt "dialogue/888/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/888/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nResearch on the Bloody Demon\nis in its final phase. Heh heh\nheh... The world will never be\nthe same...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/889/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/889/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nSometimes even I get scared.\nCould we be playing with\nsomething we shouldn't touch?"

msgctxt "dialogue/890/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/890/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nHuh? There's nothing but trees\nin Gray Colony! There's nothing\nhere!"

msgctxt "dialogue/890/0x52"
msgid "dialogue/890/0x52"
msgstr "Villager\nOh, well, there is Regent\nProzen's castle."

msgctxt "dialogue/891/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/891/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nLately, at night, a pillar of\nlight rises deep in the forest.\nThey say it leaves scorched\ntrees behind. Oh, how scary!"

msgctxt "dialogue/892/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/892/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nHave you heard? They say\nRepublic Zoids have been\nspotted! Will there be another\nwar...?"

msgctxt "dialogue/893/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/893/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI saw an unknown Zoid heading\ndeep into the mountains! And\nyou can't cross the mountains\nwith a Zoid that way..."

msgctxt "dialogue/894/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/894/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThis area is Regent Prozen's\nterritory. Apparently he comes\nback from the capital now and\nthen."

msgctxt "dialogue/895/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/895/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nMount Iselina is right there,\nbut the path is very rough. You\ncan only cross on foot, so\nnobody goes near."

msgctxt "dialogue/896/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/896/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nWho are you people!? Thieves!?\nEeek, help!"

msgctxt "dialogue/899/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/899/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nOh, Alster. Thanks for\nalways patrolling.\nSuspicious people? You\nmean the ones with you?"

msgctxt "dialogue/900/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/900/0x3"
msgstr "Girl\nAlster, did you fight\nwith Palty again? You\nhave to be nice to\ngirls."

msgctxt "dialogue/901/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/901/0x3"
msgstr "Boy\nAlster! Take me to the\nforest next time!"

msgctxt "dialogue/902/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/902/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAlster! Did you chase\noff those scary Zoids?"

msgctxt "dialogue/903/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/903/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nGood work, Alster.\nAnyone suspicious? I\nhaven't seen anyone.\nSorry."

msgctxt "dialogue/904/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/904/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAnyone suspicious? No,\nI haven't seen anyone.\nBut the Imperial army\nhas come to the forest.\nAnother war?"

msgctxt "dialogue/905/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/905/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe Imperial army's been\nvery quiet lately. It's\nunsettling. I've got a\nbad feeling..."

msgctxt "dialogue/906/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/906/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nUntil recently you'd see\nthem now and then...\nNow they don't show up\nanywhere."

msgctxt "dialogue/907/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/907/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say there's\ninfighting in the\nImperial army. So\nthey're not so united\nafter all. Serves them\nright!"

msgctxt "dialogue/908/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/908/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nIt's unsettling...\nLike the calm before\nthe storm..."

msgctxt "dialogue/909/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/909/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nSo cool! They ran the bad\nguys out of town! When I\ngrow up, I wanna be\nPrince {name}'s\nsidekick!"

msgctxt "dialogue/910/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/910/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI wanna go play outside\ntown, but Mom won't let\nme. That's weird, the bad\nguys are gone now."

msgctxt "dialogue/911/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/911/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWell, welcome! How's\neverything going?"

msgctxt "dialogue/912/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/912/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nLooks like the Imperial\narmy is massing its\nforces at the castle.\nThe final battle must\nbe near...\nBest of luck!"

msgctxt "dialogue/913/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/913/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nLooks like the Imperial\narmy is massing its\nforces at the castle.\nThe final battle must\nbe near...\nBest of luck!"

msgctxt "dialogue/914/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/914/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nA single Zoid did this\nto New Helic City...\nCan we really beat a\nmonster like that?"

msgctxt "dialogue/915/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/915/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThe Death Stinger slipped\npast our defensive line\nand suddenly appeared in\nthe city... The line just\ncollapsed."

msgctxt "dialogue/916/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/916/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nWe're searching for\nsurvivors and covering\nthe remaining units'\nretreat. The commander of\nthe imperial First\nArmored Division must be\nsomewhere around here too."

msgctxt "dialogue/917/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/917/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThe remaining units were\nordered to Lake Windine...\nI wonder what's there?"

msgctxt "dialogue/918/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/918/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThere's no way to beat a\nmonster like that!\nWe might as well give up!"

msgctxt "dialogue/919/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/919/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nI thought about running...\nbut it doesn't matter\nwhere I go. So I'd rather\nfight. That's how I see it."

msgctxt "dialogue/920/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/920/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nBefore the Death Stinger\nattacked, almost all the\ncivilians got out. Maybe\nthat's the only comfort."

msgctxt "dialogue/921/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/921/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nCan you believe it?\nThis was the capital of\nthe Helic Republic...!"

msgctxt "dialogue/922/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/922/0x3"
msgstr "Clerk\nWelcome! Or so I'd like\nto say... but as you can\nsee, we're open, just\nwith nothing to sell."

msgctxt "dialogue/923/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/923/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI was born in this city,\nraised in this city...\nand I've decided to die\nhere. Leave me be."

msgctxt "dialogue/924/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/924/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Officer\nThis Ultrasaurus has been\nrefitted as planned for\nthe final battle. It's\nour ultimate weapon."

msgctxt "dialogue/925/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/925/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Officer\nSince it was found 10\nyears ago, the Ultrasaurus\nhas never once been\nactivated. Will it really\nstart up?"

msgctxt "dialogue/926/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/926/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Officer\nThe Ultrasaurus can't be\nactivated until it's done\ncharging its energy. If\nthe enemy attacked now..."

msgctxt "dialogue/927/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/927/0x3"
msgstr "Researcher\nThe next Zoid is this\none!!"

msgctxt "dialogue/928/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/928/0x3"
msgstr "Scientist\nAfter all, the Gravity\nCannon is an unknown\nweapon. With barely any\ntesting... will it really\nwork?"

msgctxt "dialogue/929/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/929/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThe Ultrasaurus with the\nGravity Cannon is the\nultimate combo! No need\nto fear the Death Stinger!"

msgctxt "dialogue/930/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/930/0x3"
msgstr "Republic Soldier\nThe Death Stinger may be\ncrazy, but we've got\nDr. D. Nobody beats us\nat crazy!"

msgctxt "dialogue/931/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/931/0x3"
msgstr "Secretary\nThe day the Gravity\nCannon is finished has\nfinally come. Putting up\nwith the doctor's orders\nwas worth it."

msgctxt "dialogue/932/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/932/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThe imperial army's been\nvery quiet lately. It's\nunsettling. I have a bad\nfeeling about this..."

msgctxt "dialogue/933/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/933/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nUntil recently you'd see\nthem now and then...\nAnd now they don't show\nup anywhere."

msgctxt "dialogue/934/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/934/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nThey say the imperial\narmy's been fighting\namong themselves. So\nthey're not so united.\nServes them right!"

msgctxt "dialogue/935/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/935/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nHow unsettling...\nIt's like the calm\nbefore the storm..."

msgctxt "dialogue/936/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/936/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nAwesome! They chased\nthe bad guys out of\ntown! When I grow up,\nI'll be Prince {name}'s\nhelper!"

msgctxt "dialogue/937/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/937/0x3"
msgstr "Villager\nI want to play outside\nthe city. But Mom says\nno. Weird, since the bad\nguys are gone now."

msgctxt "dialogue/938/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/938/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWell, welcome! How's\nbusiness?"

msgctxt "dialogue/939/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/939/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nLooks like the imperial\narmy's gathering its\nforces at the castle.\nThe final battle must be\nnear... Good luck!"

msgctxt "dialogue/940/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/940/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\nLooks like the imperial\narmy's gathering its\nforces at the castle.\nThe final battle must be\nnear... Good luck!"

msgctxt "dialogue/941/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/941/0x3"
msgstr "Townsperson\nThe day has finally come...\nI've nothing more to say.\nGo and give it your all!"

msgctxt "dialogue/942/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/942/0x3"
msgstr "Townsperson\nBoys grow into men so\nfast... Go get 'em!\nI'm with you!"

msgctxt "dialogue/943/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/943/0x3"
msgstr "Townsperson\nIf you see Prince {name},\ntell him I'm rooting for\nhim, and to hang in there!"

msgctxt "dialogue/944/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/944/0x3"
msgstr "Townsperson\nI'm going to marry Prince\n{name}! So he'd better\ncome back, no matter what!"

msgctxt "dialogue/945/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/945/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nPrince! I... I always\nbelieved this day would\ncome! May fortune be with\nyou in battle!"

msgctxt "dialogue/946/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/946/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nPrince, leave the rest\nto us. Please take care.\nMay fortune be with\nyou in battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/947/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/947/0x3"
msgstr "Bartender\nWelcome... There's your\nusual table. I'll always\nkeep it free for you."

msgctxt "dialogue/948/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/948/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n......An old man like me\nhas nothing to say.\nMay fortune be with\nyou in battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/949/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/949/0x3"
msgstr "Roman\n......An old man like me\nhas nothing to say.\nMay fortune be with\nyou in battle."

msgctxt "dialogue/950/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/950/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nLeave the defense of\nArcana to us! Prince,\nhurry to Arcadia Castle\nat once!"

msgctxt "dialogue/951/0x3"
msgid "dialogue/951/0x3"
msgstr "Royal Guard\nMay fortune be with you!\nGlory to the Kingdom\nof Arcadia!"

